24: Chapter 24: Selene\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'For the next two days, the handsome Gym Leader Dylan will be out for training. Trainers who wish to challenge this gym, please come back in two days.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Friendly reminder, if you encounter the Gym Leader in the wild, there's a chance he might accept your challenge\u8212?Rota Gym Notice Board.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gym Leader, is this alright?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Today, the receptionist girl, with cute twin tails, smiled happily at Dylan after writing on the notice board.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Very good. Your handwriting is beautiful."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan praised her with satisfaction. Her writing was indeed very pretty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ But Gym Leader, is this really okay? It seems like, apart from the Indigo League Tournament, no other gym takes holidays..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The receptionist girl was happy to be praised but soon showed some worry on her delicate face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What if a challenger reports our gym for neglecting duties?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No worries. Gym leaders need rest too, and I'm not on holiday; I'm training."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan spoke calmly. Normally, gym leaders, as the girl mentioned, only rest during the Indigo League Tournament.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This is mainly because when the Indigo League Tournament starts, no one challenges gyms for badges anymore since the competition has begun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, as a modern and good gym leader, Dylan believed he deserved some time off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Working non-stop all year is not ideal; at least he should have weekends off to relax.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moreover, he could use these weekends to experience the world's adventurous spirit, and he had a point to make\u8212?he was going out to train!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who says gym leaders don't need to improve? Nowadays, the competition among gym leaders is intense. They face pressure from peers, challengers' public opinion, and inspections from the League.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who knows when a pink-haired inspector might come down with their Latias and shut down your gym? (In the anime, the Kanto gym inspector is a Nurse Joy with a Latias. The Joy family is full of surprises.)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, Dylan also needed to train hard to improve himself!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's a normal thing. If I don't train, how can I get stronger? If I don't get stronger, how can I better face challengers? Our gym's reputation is improving bit by bit."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Many strong trainers might come to challenge, so I need to improve too."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan spoke with a straight face, not feeling any shame.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, Dylan knew from the original story that gym leaders often 'disappeared,' wasn't it a standard feature?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was just blending in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, I believe the Gym Leader can do it!" The receptionist girl nodded enthusiastically, her twin tails bouncing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Very good. Go home now, and remember to come to the gym in two days."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yay~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Getting a two-day break, the receptionist girl was quite happy and ready to have some fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"By the way, Gym Leader, is the gym still hiring?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm? Do you have someone to recommend?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan checked the time; Ilene hadn't arrived yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, I have a friend who's very interested in becoming a trainer, and she's a great person."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gym Leader, you're so amazing; could she come to the gym as an apprentice?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The receptionist girl looked at Dylan expectantly. She wasn't interested in becoming a trainer herself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though training was popular in this world, not everyone wanted to be a trainer, as it required a solid foundation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The girl became the receptionist at Rota Gym because her family wasn't well off, and Dylan, knowing her situation, offered her the position out of kindness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sure, since you recommended her, bring her in a couple of days."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pondered for a moment and then smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Great! Gym Leader, you can trust Selene. She's different from me; she's really amazing! She could recite type matchups easily as a child!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan was surprised to hear the name. Selene?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Look, Gym Leader, Selene is here! Selene~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The receptionist girl noticed something, her eyes lighting up, and she waved excitedly in that direction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan turned to see a slender black-haired girl with a pure, delicate face, wearing a yellow floral top and green shorts, her straight legs visible. She looked around fifteen or sixteen years old, with a pure and innocent aura.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing the girl's voice, Selene quickened her pace, jogging over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's eyes flickered as he looked at Selene. Was this fate?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey!." Selene smiled sweetly, clearly happy to see her childhood friend.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene~ Long time no see! This is the Gym Leader, the leader of Rota Gym."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The receptionist girl hugged her friend tightly and quickly introduced Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gym Leader, this is Selene, my neighbor, whom I just mentioned."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello, Gym Leader Dylan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene politely bowed, her clear eyes filled with curiosity as she glanced at Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For this Rota Gym leader her friend spoke of, Selene was indeed very curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello, no need to be so formal. Since you're a friend of her, just call me Dylan like she does."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's gentle voice made it easy to feel at ease.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I heard that you want to become a trainer, right? How old are you now?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm fifteen, turning sixteen in five months."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene answered obediently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then you can start traveling near the end of the year." Dylan nodded. No wonder she was still in Kanto.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Would you like to join Rota Gym? I'm not a famous trainer, but I'll do my best to teach you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you, Gym Leader Dylan, I'd love to." Selene was pleasantly surprised. Becoming an apprentice at a gym is a rare opportunity for any aspiring trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her dream was to become a champion!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And her friend was desperately giving her encouraging looks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yay~ Now Selene can keep me company every day."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The receptionist girl was thrilled, jumping up in excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, come to the gym with her in two days."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Okay~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ilene is here. Gym Leader Dylan, we'll leave now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go ahead."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan watched the two girls leave, chatting happily, still feeling a bit emotional.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What's up? Is she a friend?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ilene walked up to Dylan, noticing his unusual expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, a very talented trainer. What a coincidence~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan sighed at the coincidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew Selene was from Kanto, only moving to Alola with her mother at the start of the game.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the original story never specified where in Kanto Selene was from. Turns out, it was from Rota.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A very talented trainer?" Ilene was surprised. Those two words were quite significant, especially coming from Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, she's a prodigy~" Dylan glanced at Selene, who hadn't gone far yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And by 'prodigy,' Dylan meant it as a compliment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This girl was as talented as Red and Blue!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who would have thought?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This seemingly innocent girl not only single-handedly defeated the strongest evil organization, Team Rainbow Rocket, from a parallel world but also defeated the 'strongest legendary Pok\u233?mon,' Necrozma, three times, eventually subduing it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's go."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan stopped thinking about it. Whether Selene in this real world had the same talent as in the game, she was now Rota Gym's first apprentice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He would teach her well. Who knows, maybe a future trainer who shocks the world will come from Rota Gym?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
