Yet, without a doubt, Team Rocket is also the most straightforward 'evil' in people's minds among all the evil organizations. The anime, aimed at children, rarely reveals Team Rocket's true dark side, but both the games and the special manga provide descriptions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the special manga, Giovanni is depicted as a ruthless and cunning warlord who even dismembers a Pok\u233?mon in front of the protagonist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Team Rocket's atrocities include robbing passerby Pok\u233?mon, hunting wild Pok\u233?mon, and conducting inhumane genetic experiments on Pok\u233?mon. The list of their crimes is extensive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes, Giovanni, the leader of Team Rocket, is also the gym leader of Viridian Gym. Ironically, the Pok\u233?mon League is unaware of this fact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni, the dark source of Kanto's underworld, is highly respected and revered in the public eye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan had briefly searched for information about Giovanni and found that, besides being a gym leader, Giovanni is also a businessman. Known as the 'Ground-Type Giovanni,' he is rumored to be the strongest gym leader in the Kanto region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As an expert in Ground-type Pok\u233?mon, Giovanni wrote a widely circulated book, "The Secrets of the Earth," sharing his insights. This broad-mindedness earned him immense respect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
