If only this were a simulation world, Dylan would love to see exactly what level this Pikachu was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thunderbolt!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Pikachu was pushed back, its cheeks sparked with electricity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
