Of course, Pikachu was all about high-speed, fast attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pikachu's low growl rumbled as it sped towards Arbok, golden lightning crackling once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive bolt of lightning descended, striking down towards Arbok.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An Electric-type Thunder attack!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
