"..." Red frowned slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sharp Air Slash hit Toxapex's tentacles directly, causing Toxapex's body to shiver for a moment, but then\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nothing else happened!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
