However, currently, the attack strength of Arbok and Drapion had long fallen behind Toxapex's defensive growth rate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Toxapex weren't so reserved, then if it were a Pok\u233?mon like Arbok, it would definitely say to Arbok and Drapion, "Is that all? Haven't you eaten? Put some effort in!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ash was dumbfounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red on the field had already furrowed his brows. Not only was the Air Slash's impact on Toxapex less than ideal, but with the Light Screen up, how could Charizard attack from a distance?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Light Screen's reduction of special attack damage was too effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
