Red fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this scene also left the surrounding crowd stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh? How did Charizard get poisoned?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baneful Bunker! It's that Baneful Bunker move!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goodness, this move is too sneaky!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
