"Venoshock!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan didn't care about this. He immediately ordered Toxapex to pursue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxapex raised its two tentacles, and purple poison gathered. Two columns of poisonous liquid shot out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Poison-type, Venoshock!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang~!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
