This means that this Venoshock hit two buffs\u8212?Charizard had no chance of escaping the pain!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And as Charizard hit the ground, it triggered another layer of Toxic Spikes, with purple poison quickly enveloping Charizard again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hiss\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, Ash and the others couldn't help but gasp, and Charmander beside Ash stared blankly at its now miserable senior, its eyes wide with shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That's right, the damage from Toxic Spikes and poisoning does not overlap! Even if poisoned, the damage from Toxic Spikes still applies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
