Pain! It really hurt so much!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Red has no hope left." Brock shook his head as he came to this realization.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Charizard was already poisoned, and with that series of attacks, Charizard's condition was critical.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And with Toxapex's ridiculous defense and Light Screen protecting it, even if it was a battle of attrition, Charizard would be worn out, not to mention Toxapex's self-recovery.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red's defeat was certain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This guy is really strong\u8230?" Misty agreed, looking at Dylan with admiration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
