80: Chapter 80: Why Not Be a Decent Person?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Archer was both amused and angered by Proton. So now he's being accused of lying? But he wasn't lying!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
