No, fighting was out of the question. Dylan was too strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at Proton, it seemed his main Pok\u233?mon had already been taken down by Dylan. Although Archer still had some of his main Pok\u233?mon, what was the use?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had no choice but to negotiate. Archer didn't want to end up in jail; he still had work to do for Team Rocket!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
