"Dylan, I don't think Team Rocket has wronged you. Ariana has already been arrested, and that achievement is enough."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Archer didn't give up but spoke sincerely to Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you turn a blind eye and let Proton and I leave, or even just one of us, Team Rocket will reward you far more generously than the League."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He still had critically important genetic fusion data, the product of years of research at this base. He had to get it out!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
