What a joke\u8212?though he did enjoy watching entertaining and thrilling scenes, what benefit would there be in letting Archer and Proton go? Even if there were benefits, they wouldn't be worth it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Salazzle."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Salazzle bared its teeth and began to approach Archer and Proton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Damn it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Archer understood that Dylan intended for Salazzle to attack them, rendering them unable to resist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But how could he let that happen?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz, buzz, buzz~!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, the faint sound of wings flapping reached Dylan's ears. Nidoking and Salazzle noticed it immediately as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan looked towards the left corridor, his expression tense. A yellow figure, as fast as lightning, was swiftly approaching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Salazzle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite Dylan's warning and Salazzle quickly gathering flames in its mouth, it was still too late.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The yellow Pok\u233?mon, like a knight's lance, thrust its long needle fiercely into Salazzle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Salazzle felt a sharp pain and immense force hit her, sending her flying backward like a cannonball, smashing heavily into the wall behind her, shattering it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everything happened too fast! So fast that the three present hadn't even reacted yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's brow furrowed tightly as he looked at the Pok\u233?mon that had stopped in front of Archer and Proton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It resembled a giant yellow wasp, with two pairs of wings on its back and slender legs, with large, long white needles at the front of its arms, resembling the head of a knight's lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a Beedrill, a Bug/Poison-type Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beedrill was one of the most common Bug-type Pok\u233?mon in the Kanto region. You could find swarms of them in almost any large forest, though they were usually not very strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, this Beedrill had just swiftly attacked and sent Dylan's Salazzle flying!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though Salazzle wasn't Dylan's main Pok\u233?mon, it was already at level 53, making it quite powerful among the Elite Four-level Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it was so easily sent flying by this Beedrill!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Boss is here!" As high-ranking Team Rocket executives, Archer and Proton were delighted to see the Beedrill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The debris was pushed aside, and Salazzle slowly emerged, breathing heavily, her narrow eyes glaring angrily at Beedrill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was clear that Salazzle wasn't in good shape.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
