Dylan glanced at Salazzle. It seemed that Beedrill hadn't even used any special move, meaning it was just a regular attack that had done this much damage to Salazzle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such a terrifying Beedrill could only belong to one person\u8212?Giovanni, the boss of Team Rocket!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Click, click, click~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sound of polished shoes echoed, and from around the corner, a middle-aged man in a black suit and fedora hat slowly walked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was Giovanni!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Heh~ Young people these days are truly amazing."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A deep, hoarse male voice came from him, clearly disguised, as were his appearance and build.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan looked Giovanni up and down. He was very different from how he remembered him, but that made sense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni appearing here in person was already incredibly risky. If he hadn't disguised himself, his Viridian Gym would've been raided overnight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a base in Celadon City that was bound to be destroyed, Giovanni wouldn't have acted so recklessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And you are?" Dylan placed his left hand in his pocket, pressing a button on his communicator. He was signaling Lance, something they had agreed upon before the operation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As fast as he was growing, Dylan knew his limits. He was still far from the level of top Champions like Giovanni or Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Beedrill in front of him was at least level 80! And that was a conservative estimate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Boss!" Archer and Proton immediately ran to Giovanni's side, both respectful and ashamed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They never imagined that one day, they would need their boss to personally come to their rescue. As subordinates, they felt like total failures.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You should understand now," Giovanni said, taking the USB drive from Archer and slipping it into his pocket, his mature and calm smile directed at Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, Giovanni had been here for a while. If it weren't for the fact that Archer and Proton had no way to escape, he wouldn't have risked stepping in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The leader of Team Rocket," Dylan squinted slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Exactly, but today really isn't a good day. Kid, if we get the chance, we'll meet again," Giovanni said calmly, preparing to leave with Archer and Proton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although he found Dylan intriguing, the Kanto Champion, Lance, was just outside, and Giovanni didn't want to deal with him right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beedrill floated behind the three, its red insect eyes fixed on Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I can't let you leave so easily," Dylan decisively threw out a Pok\u233?ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
