An Ice-type Blizzard!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The air in the base plummeted in temperature, white snowflakes fell, and the walls on both sides of the corridor frosted over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A very powerful Blizzard!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?" Giovanni paused, surprised as he turned around. Articuno?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But as the raging snowstorm approached, Beedrill simply raised its right limb, and a white light flashed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Fighting-type Brick Break!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With an impressive strike from its long, white needle, the Blizzard was effortlessly split in two.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching Beedrill handle the attack as if it were slicing through vegetables, Dylan couldn't help but be amazed. This Beedrill was ridiculously strong!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was no way he could beat this absurdly powerful Beedrill, but it didn't matter. He had bought enough time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A loud explosion erupted from nearby, flames bursting out as a thick wall was blasted open.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
