Lance!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni narrowed his eyes as he looked at the arrogant, cold-blooded redhead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was going to be interesting!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan took a few steps back, leaning against Articuno as he watched Giovanni and Lance get closer. He was just about ready to grab some popcorn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The clash between Kanto's Champion, Lance, and the dark mastermind of Team Rocket, Giovanni\u8212?this was going to be one hell of a show!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
