84: Chapter 84: You're Not Weak!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Beep~ Eevee, Normal Type, Evolution Pok\u233?mon\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ability: Adaptability\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moves: Tackle, Tail Whip, Quick Attack, Swift, Bite, Detect (inherited)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Description: To quickly adapt to changes in its environment, this Pok\u233?mon possesses the potential for multiple evolutions.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Little one, are you full?" Dylan picked up the now much more familiar Eevee, placing it on his shoulder, and gently rubbed its fluffy chin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
