There was no follow-up, as the anonymous writer seemed to have reached their breaking point, likely needing a couple of hours to recover.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Emmm...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kiyo and his sister exchanged glances, both with odd expressions. They had some recollection of this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
