"I have a feeling more and more challengers are going to come," Kiyo's sister said, blinking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That post had garnered a lot of interest, with many challengers who had already faced Rota Gym sharing their experiences and others who were curious joining in the discussion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The popularity of the Rota Gym and its roulette mechanism was rising fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
