"Gary is the best!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Our determined Gary is so charming!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Behind Gary, his cheerleading squad, who had also parked their bikes, gazed at him with adoring eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
