"..." Gary was lost in deep thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue withdrew Arcanine, staring at it for a long moment before lifting his gaze back to Darkrai with a frown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its speed and power were impressive, and it could float. This wasn't going to be easy\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As expected of a legendary Pok\u233?mon, it's as strong as they say."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue calmly adjusted his black shirt, giving his evaluation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks for the compliment. I hadn't planned on using Darkrai, but given the current situation\u8230? things are a bit special," Dylan said with a smile, gesturing to Blue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's see how you handle my Darkrai, Mr. Blue."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue's expression darkened immediately. He really wished he knew how to handle this Darkrai right now!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
