105: Chapter 105: How could you have this thing in your team?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a moment of thought, Dylan decided to send out Incineroar first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
