Meanwhile, Meowscarada's left paw kept hammering at Hydreigon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Play Rough was very painful. Hydreigon roared in agony, its body wobbling and struggling to fly straight!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if Meowscarada couldn't attack with full strength in this state, Play Rough was still too much for Hydreigon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the fourth hit from Meowscarada, which essentially amounted to a full Play Rough attack, Hydreigon finally couldn't hold on any longer and fell with a wail.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom~!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under Zinnia's grim expression, the Hydreigon crashed heavily to the ground. Dust billowed up, and the ground trembled slightly, showing just how hard it had fallen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Play Rough!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dylan didn't wait for the dust to settle before ordering Meowscarada to attack again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The previous Play Rough had severely injured Hydreigon; another hit would be perfect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Through the hazy dust, Meowscarada remained on top of Hydreigon, its sharp claws and fangs, glowing with a pink aura, continually striking at Hydreigon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydreigon's pained growls echoed again. When the dust finally began to clear, Meowscarada gracefully stood up and walked back to Dylan with elegant cat-like steps.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the bottom of the pit, Hydreigon was already unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meowscarada's unsuccessful initial surprise attack, the heavy impact from the fall, and two quadruple-effective Play Roughs\u8212?Hydreigon simply couldn't withstand it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silence! The crowd fell completely silent!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
