Yet now it had been defeated without accomplishing anything... well, it did do something: it spewed fire twice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was clear that the main reason was that the agile Meowscarada found an opportunity to get on Hydreigon's back, but regardless of the process, the outcome was that Hydreigon was utterly defeated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zinnia was also completely silent, staring at Hydreigon, lost in thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hydreigon is unable to battle. Meowscarada wins."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Itto announced the result of the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yay! Meowscarada is amazing!" Lillie cheered, waving her tiny fists. As expected of her brother's first Pok\u233?mon! Who cares about Hydreigon, the pseudo-legendary? Haha, we took it down easily!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zinnia recalled Hydreigon and stared at its Pok\u233? Ball for a long time, taking a deep breath to calm her turbulent emotions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zinnia's gaze toward Dylan had subtly changed as she took out another Pok\u233? Ball and threw it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Salamence!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A dragon's roar echoed through the sky as crimson wings spread wide. A fearsome, incredibly fierce dragon looked down at Meowscarada with its savage eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A four-legged dragon Pok\u233?mon with striking, blood-red wings, a long tail, and a deep blue body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was none other than Salamence, the pseudo-legendary Dragon Pok\u233?mon! The aura of dragon's majesty spread, and even Lillie could sense something was off. This Salamence was clearly stronger than Zinnia's previous Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Another pseudo-legendary Dragon-type..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie took out her Pok\u233?dex and pointed it at Salamence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Beep~ Salamence, Dragon/Flying type, the Dragon Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ability: Intimidate\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moves: Double-Edge, Flamethrower, Zen Headbutt, Dragon Claw, Dragon Rush, Hyper Beam, Hurricane...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Description: With wings that finally grew, it soars in the vast sky, spewing flames in excitement and turning the ground into a burning field."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No doubt, an extremely powerful Salamence!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what happened next shocked Lillie and Ilene beyond words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Salamence!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zinnia raised her arm, and the Mega Bracelet on her leg lit up with a brilliant light. Almost simultaneously, the Mega Evolution Stone on Salamence's neck shone, enveloping it in a thick aura of evolutionary energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Evolution, a step beyond evolution!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is that an evolution?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How? Salamence can evolve further?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie and Ilene watched in astonishment as Salamence underwent another evolution mid-air. How was this possible?!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon, the light of evolution faded, revealing a completely new form of Salamence to everyone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
