This was Mega Salamence!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meowscarada's beautiful cat-like eyes focused on Mega Salamence, and its expression grew serious. As a Pok\u233?mon, it could more directly sense the immense and overwhelming pressure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This opponent was incredibly strong!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
