"So about Regirock..." Dylan brought up the rock guardian again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm... but Regirock was a gift from my dear friend, meow..." Clefairy gnawed on its little paw, clearly torn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On one hand was its beloved caretaker, and on the other was its friend's precious "gift."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, cutie, didn't you say you ran out of tuna cans? I'll buy you ten more boxes!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Really? But..." Mew's big watery eyes lit up, though there was still a bit of hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Twenty boxes!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Waa... Dylan, you're so bad... This would be unfair to the Rock Guardian..." Mew whimpered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thirty boxes!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Actually, the Rock Guardian isn't that important, Meow. It's always mischievous. It's normal if it gets lost, Meow. Seriously, it loves running off."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew spoke seriously. What Rock Guardian? The Rock Guardian got lost hundreds of years ago. All it had now were the Steel Guardian and the Ice Guardian, Meow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the way, how many boxes of tuna cans could the Steel Guardian and the Ice Guardian be traded for?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No, no, I can't! I'm awful for even thinking that! After all, they're the guardians left behind by the big Guardian to protect the Tree of Beginning, Meow! Hmm, and there are already thirty boxes, woohoo~!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leah: WoW!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie: (-)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What did they just witness? So filthy!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, Dylan, when will the tuna cans arrive, Meow?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew sat on Dylan's shoulder, pulling his hair eagerly as she asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tomorrow morning, I guess. I'll arrange it when we get back," Dylan rolled his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But I want to eat some tonight, Meow..." Mew's gaze turned sorrowful, her voice weak and spiritless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll have someone check if there's a nearby store selling some."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ Dylan, you're the best, Meow."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
