"As a lady, I've always believed that Rota Gym is the beacon of the Kanto region! A Gym as warm and sunny as Rota Gym is the moral standard for all Gyms! Strongly recommend everyone to challenge it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're overdoing it. While I also believe Rota Gym is excellent, such words are inappropriate. Today, I challenged the dark purple team, and I'm really grateful for Dylan's guidance. (smile.jpg)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I came from Sinnoh to challenge gyms in Kanto, and I must say, Rota Gym is more worth challenging than any Gym in Sinnoh! There's a new surprise every day."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan nodded in satisfaction. It seemed everyone still loved Rota Gym.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once the Ghost-type team was fully formed, he would prepare the next surprise for them!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
