Dylan smiled warmly at the Alolan Ninetales, letting the power of his Viridian bond seep out, easing the lead Ninetales' wariness. Meanwhile, the more lively and outgoing Vulpix were already starting to edge toward Dylan curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
