Dylan, of course, hadn't overlooked this. His backyard was huge, divided into several areas, and one of those areas was specially designed for Ice-type Pok\u233?mon. There was even an 'artificial' snow mountain\u8212?crafted by none other than Articuno itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You can live here for now, and later I'll give you an even bigger snow mountain."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
