"Oh~ Mr. Dylan, please come in." The assistant replied, gesturing for Dylan and the others to enter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The professor is giving the Pok\u233?mon a health check in the backyard; I'll take you there."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
