"Hello, Professor Oak."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan slightly bowed to show respect as Professor Oak approached, and Leah and Lillie quickly greeted him as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah~ there's no need to be so polite; I'm just an ordinary old man." Professor Oak said with a hearty laugh, his demeanor very kind. Although he was not young anymore, he showed no signs of aging, but rather seemed full of energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I've heard from Blue and Gary about you, Gym Leader Dylan; Blue has a very high opinion of you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Professor Oak looked at Dylan with great interest. He knew his grandsons well; both Blue and Gary were quite arrogant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially Blue; it was curious that a gym could make him face defeat while still holding him in high regard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Giovanni of the Viridian Gym was only rated "not bad" by Blue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
