"Professor Oak, they don't need to evolve."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan stood up and walked in front of Pikachu and Eevee, wearing a gentle smile. He gently rubbed the little creatures' heads with his fingers glowing with a bit of green light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It felt very comfortable. Dylan placed two prepared small hats on Pikachu and Eevee's heads.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They are the best partner Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
