The idea of having the first new Rota Badge was tempting, and Erika couldn't resist any longer. "Then, I'll gladly accept!" she said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking the Ghost Rota Badge in hand, Erika felt its smooth, jade-like texture, and her previous disappointment melted away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wow~ I'm so jealous! I want one of Dylan's badges too; it's gorgeous!" Daisy and the others walked over, and Lily leaned in to admire the badge in Erika's hand, her eyes practically sparkling as she glanced at Dylan with a clear hint in her expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
