Challenge the Rota Gym? That would be asking for trouble.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed she would have to wait for Misty to come back and challenge on her behalf. Surely, getting a badge for her sister wouldn't be too much, right? Hopefully, by then, the Rota Gym would have a Water-type Rota Badge because Lily preferred that type.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
