He had no doubt that in the future, the most challenging badge to earn in the Kanto region would no longer be the Earth Badge or the Volcano Badge, but the Rota Badge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Daisy and the others nodded in agreement, while Erika lightly rubbed the Ghost Rota Badge in her hand, already cherishing it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After Erika's challenge concluded, Dylan gave the group a tour around the Rota Gym. When they saw the extravagant backyard, they couldn't help but marvel at Dylan's wealth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
