Such ignorance. Ghetsis thought that if he didn't put this kid in his place, the boy would continue to act insolent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed a lesson was indeed necessary to make the boy understand the meaning of 'knowing one's place.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
