However, as it was knocked back, Dawn Wings Necrozma's Dragon Pulse was already fired, hitting Black Kyurem as it attempted to pursue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The dragon-shaped pulse exploded on Black Kyurem's body, and it let out a painful roar\u8212?dragon versus dragon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though Black Kyurem was an Ice-type, Ice-type had no resistance to Dragon-type moves, so Dragon Pulse was still effective against Black Kyurem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
