If it were Dusk Mane Necrozma in its Solgaleo form, there might have been a chance to turn the tide, perhaps even defeat this Kyurem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Time to retreat, and come back later to take down this Ice Dragon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
