"Reshiram, let's go!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing that Black Kyurem was being suppressed by the Prismatic Laser, Dylan didn't hesitate at all. He and Lillie quickly switched to riding Reshiram, preparing to make their escape.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Good!" Reshiram immediately turned, flapping its wings as it sped away, while Dylan took out the Ultra Ball and recalled Dawn Wings Necrozma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking back at Black Kyurem, which was still being pinned down by the Prismatic Laser, Dylan sighed. It seemed that time was still too short; they hadn't been able to take down this beast yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But that's alright\u8212?once Necrozma absorbs enough light and transforms into Ultra Necrozma, defeating Kyurem won't be an issue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Ice Dragon will be mine sooner or later!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
