Hmm, once again, she missed Regirock. How about switching to the Rock Guardian, Dylan?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That gym leader's rule against switching Pok\u233?mon could also be overlooked, in her opinion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
