"Excadrill, dodge!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lacey called out urgently to her Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Excadrill, now lacking its Ground typing due to Terastallization, was no longer immune to Electric-type moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It tried to dive underground again, but Thunder was too fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
