163: Chapter 163: You ****\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are we surrounded by Team Plasma?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No, no, no!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie's eyes sparkled as she looked at the black-clad young man exuding an unparalleled aura. Despite her upbringing as an educated lady, she couldn't find the right words to describe the excitement she felt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Brother, you're amazing!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lillie."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, Brother!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Call Champion Alder and ask him to bring officers to take these people away."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan handed his phone to Lillie, keeping his gaze fixed on Ghetsis and N.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is just perfect. I was planning to leave Unova soon, and yet here comes such a delightful surprise."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Got it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie felt it was her duty. She grabbed the phone, quickly navigated to Alder's number, and dialed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello? Champion Alder? This is Lillie. My brother has surrounded Team Plasma single-handedly. Can you send Officer Jenny and her team to handle this?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How many? Hmm... I'd say there are about 20 to 30 members here."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie glanced around, roughly estimating the number.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, on Ghetsis's side\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Father, that's Kyurem!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N was stunned. That gray dragon\u8212?there was no mistaking it. It was Kyurem! But how? How could Dylan have captured Kyurem? It didn't make sense!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just yesterday, Kyurem was chasing Dylan and Reshiram. If not for N and Zekrom being lured away, Reshiram might not have survived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But today, Kyurem was Dylan's Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N couldn't comprehend it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ghetsis's face darkened, his fury palpable. Of course, he recognized Kyurem\u8212?it was a crucial part of his plan. But that plan wasn't supposed to start yet!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"N, go and defeat Reshiram and Kyurem!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"??? Father?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N was genuinely shocked by his adoptive father's command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What made Ghetsis think he could defeat Kyurem, let alone Reshiram? Zekrom barely escaped with its life yesterday!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What's wrong? I raised you to fulfill this idealistic path, and now our greatest obstacle stands before us. Are you going to back down, N?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ghetsis's frustration was mounting, his eyes boring into N.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Faced with Ghetsis's absurd command, N fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"N!! Are you going to disappoint me like this?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Father, even Zekrom is no match for Kyurem. We need to retreat." N pressed his lips together, trying to reason with Ghetsis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Silence! N, you are the king of Team Plasma! How can you say such things?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ghetsis was livid, enraged by N's perceived betrayal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?" N's silence deepened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He couldn't understand how the once-wise Ghetsis had become so irrational.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress, observing the scene, stifled a laugh. Ghetsis was losing it, and N wasn't much better, trying to reason with someone whose mind was clearly unhinged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Should I try to sneak away?} Colress pondered, adjusting his glasses. But no\u8212?Reshiram and Kyurem were watching them closely. Any attempt to flee would likely provoke an attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, he decided to wait and see.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Have you two finished your argument yet?" Dylan's voice interrupted their tense exchange.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you want to keep arguing, you can do it in jail. You can even fight each other there."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
