164: Chapter 164: Ok\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Our esteemed Plasma Team founder, Sage Ghetsis, spat blood and fainted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
