Dylan suggested to Alder. Ghetsis, with his arrogant and overconfident personality, was also notoriously small-minded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Ghetsis were made to endure some hardships behind bars and face a bit of mental torment, he would definitely crack under pressure. Once his composure broke, he'd undoubtedly vent his frustrations on N. This would make N utterly disappointed in him, allowing N to see the harsh truths of the world more clearly and come to a realization.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
