165: Chapter 165: Kanto\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Viridian City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the time Dylan and Lillie left the airport, it was nearly dusk.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They then rode on Reshiram toward the Indigo Plateau. The Indigo Plateau wasn't far from Viridian City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike in the games, the Indigo Plateau in reality had a sizable athlete's village, much like Silver Town for the Silver Conference, Lilycove City for the Hoenn Grand Festival, or Lily of the Valley Island for the Sinnoh League.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Otherwise, where would the competitors and spectators stay during regional tournaments? It'd be a joke without proper accommodations.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rooar~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The majestic cry of the white dragon echoed in front of the Indigo Plateau's athlete's village before it gracefully descended, flapping its wings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the village entrance stood the short-statured President Charles Goodshow, hands clasped behind his back. Beside him was Lorelei, elegantly dressed in a professional suit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"President, Lorelei."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the white dragon landed, Dylan and Lillie dismounted and greeted the two.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh~ hahaha, Dylan! Welcome back to Kanto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
President Goodshow warmly approached, though due to his height, he could only pat Dylan's arm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So this is Reshiram, the White Dragon? I can't believe it\u8212?it's even more beautiful than I imagined!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
President Goodshow gazed in awe at the elegant, pure white dragon. Its flawless form exuded breathtaking beauty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My goodness! Such a gorgeous legendary dragon\u8212?it must be incredibly sacred and noble."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram raised its head slightly, its azure dragon eyes gazing into the distant sky. Proud and aloof, it perfectly embodied its lofty demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lorelei adjusted her glasses, her eyes glimmering with intrigue at the sight of Reshiram\u8212?the legendary Dragon of Truth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"To think that you actually gained the recognition of Reshiram, the Dragon of Truth. Dylan, you're truly remarkable!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lorelei couldn't help but marvel. This junior's excellence had exceeded her imagination. Dylan was already close to Mew, and now he had also gained Reshiram's acknowledgment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I was just lucky. Reshiram happened to choose me," Dylan replied humbly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing this, Reshiram raised its head even higher.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's right! It was I who chose Dylan, not the other way around!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"From every angle, it's flawless beauty. Dylan, why not have Reshiram leave behind some flames? I've thought for a while now that Moltres' flames don't really suit the Indigo League," Goodshow suggested with a grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But Reshiram isn't a Pok\u233?mon native to Kanto, right?" Dylan asked, surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who says? Dylan, you're from Kanto, and Reshiram is now your Pok\u233?mon. Therefore, it's part of Kanto. Doesn't that make it a Kanto Pok\u233?mon?" President Goodshow declared righteously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You say Reshiram is the Dragon God of Unova? Do you have proof? Reshiram is now Kanto's Pok\u233?mon\u8212?it's the Dragon God of Kanto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram nodded in agreement, fully embracing its new identity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lorelei adjusted her glasses without expression, while Lillie stood quietly, somewhat overwhelmed by the conversation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Actually, that makes sense. The Indigo League is Kanto's grandest event, so the sacred flame should represent Kanto," Goodshow concluded, setting the idea aside for the future.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cheese~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram maintained its aloof pose as Goodshow stood in front of it, smiling brilliantly. A Rotom Pok\u233?dex captured their photo from every angle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
