With its bramble club in hand, Ogerpon leapt into the air, heading for the trembling Pecharunt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Memories of that fateful night overwhelmed Pecharunt. The terrifying sight of Ogerpon wielding its bramble club left it frozen in fear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Bang!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The club struck Pecharunt with immense force, sending it crashing to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
