Tears rolled down Pecharunt's cheeks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha\u8230? Pecha-runttt\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching its despair, Ogerpon's expression turned complex. Even though it had defeated Pecharunt once more, the past could never be undone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How pitiful," Lillie murmured, feeling a pang of sympathy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
