"But that's all in the past now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan took steady steps toward Ogerpon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing the footsteps, Ogerpon turned its head and saw Dylan walking toward it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well? Do you feel better now?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon nodded, then shook its head. The light around it dissipated as it de-teracrystallized, tightly embracing Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Those memories were now part of the past\u8212?it was time to embrace a new life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
