After all, Ogerpon had just said, "I like Dylan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge Oge~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon's big eyes squinted into crescents, its happiness radiating as it grinned widely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I like you too, Ogerpon. I hope we can stay together from now on."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge yo~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon chirped happily, overflowing with joy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then come along."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan took out a Luxury Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon reached out with its arm, touching the ball willingly. In a flash of red light, it was absorbed into the Luxury Ball, which clicked shut without even a single shake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I've caught Ogerpon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan held the Luxury Ball with a heartfelt smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ball opened again, and Ogerpon appeared beside Dylan, clinging to his leg and letting out soft, affectionate cries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, Ogerpon, let's go check on that one."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan rubbed Ogerpon's head and shifted his gaze to Pecharunt , who was still sobbing on the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's a pitiful creature," Dylan said with a sigh. While he still believed Pecharunt 's current state was its own doing, there was a tinge of empathy in his voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Tap\u8230? tap\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pecharunt lay flat on the ground, and as the sound of approaching footsteps reached its ears, it turned its head. The sight of Dylan and Ogerpon filled its view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Your past\u8230? there's nothing left of it now," Dylan said, crouching to meet Pecharunt 's gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tears welled up in Pecharunt 's eyes again. Hearing those words struck a sorrowful chord, making it want to cry even more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon looked at Pecharunt with pity, its emotions deeply conflicted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But the present and the future are yours to shape. If you're willing to change, you can come with me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pecharunt froze, staring blankly at Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes. We can be your companions and friends, but you must change. You can't let your toxic sticky cakes harm anyone anymore. Can you do that? I'll have Ogerpon keep an eye on you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oge~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan spoke firmly, and Ogerpon nodded in agreement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pecharunt 's toxic sticky cakes were notorious for enhancing the eater's abilities and desires\u8212?even controlling them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was an incredibly dangerous ability. Legends said that Pecharunt once used its sticky cakes to control most of the villagers in Kitakami, even manipulating a Champion-level Trainer like Nemona.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sticky mochi were like a drug, addictive and dangerous to all who consumed them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pecharunt 's raspy voice carried hope and surprise. Could it really have new companions and happiness?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course, but the choice is yours to make."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then we'll be in your care from now on, Pecharunt ."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan extended his hand with a smile. He wasn't afraid that Pecharunt might be faking its change of heart\u8212?Necrozma was watching carefully from behind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Pecharunt harbored any ill intentions, Necrozma could intervene immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moreover, Dylan, knowing Pecharunt 's story, understood its true nature. In some ways, Pecharunt and Ogerpon were very similar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ogerpon yearned for friends and happiness, while Pecharunt longed for care and love.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fate, however, had intertwined them in tragedy. To fulfill the elderly couple's desires, Pecharunt had destroyed Ogerpon's happiness. Enraged, Ogerpon had, in turn, "taken away" Pecharunt 's "happiness."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now, that would change.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pecharunt floated up, drawing closer to Dylan, its raspy cries brimming with anticipation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"From now on, we're all partners."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Green light shimmered from Dylan's hand as he gently patted Pecharunt 's small head, his voice soft and reassuring.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching this, Ogerpon tilted its head, its expression a mixture of curiosity and amusement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pecha!" Pecharunt cried out in satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan's captured two more legends~" Ilene said with a warm smile, while Lillie's eyes sparkled with joy for her brother.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes, everyone had a bright future ahead\u8212?except\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced at the defeated Okidogi, Munkidori, and Fezandipiti lying on the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
