A time machine...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ilene and Lillie were completely dumbfounded. A time machine? Seriously?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With today's level of technology, was it even possible to create something like that? It seemed utterly impossible by all logical standards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, brother, you're saying that both Roaring Moon and the Slither Wing we just encountered are...?" Lillie finally pieced it together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's right. Both of them were brought here through the time machine. They're ancient forms, likely of Salamence and Volcarona," Dylan replied, his gaze fixed on the massive, oddly adorable Scream Tail before him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This Scream Tail is the same\u8212?an ancient form, likely of Jigglypuff."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why "likely," though?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because, according to the storyline, Paradox Pok\u233?mon are said to be Pok\u233?mon from alternate timelines\u8212?modern Pok\u233?mon as they might have looked in ancient or future eras.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Nintendo had never explicitly confirmed this. Instead, they used vague phrasing like "suspected," "there's a theory," or "it's believed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And there were contradictions. For instance, there are ancient Paradox forms of Suicune and future forms of Virizion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The trio of Cobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion are said to have entrusted their future to Keldeo, suggesting they don't have a future themselves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Suicune, Entei, and Raikou\u8212?the so-called Beasts of Ho-Oh\u8212?were Pok\u233?mon that, according to lore, died in the fire at the Bell Tower 150 years ago. Ho-Oh resurrected them, giving them new forms and life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Suicune and the others were only reborn 150 years ago, how could they have ancient forms?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this contradiction aligns perfectly with the meaning of "Paradox"\u8212?something absurd, illogical, or contradictory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Beep~ Scream Tail. Fairy/Psychic type. Paradox Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ability: Protosynthesis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moves: Psychic Fangs, Hyper Voice, Play Rough, Rest, Body Slam, Bite, Roar...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Description: A supernatural magazine once described a mysterious Pok\u233?mon believed to resemble Jigglypuff from one billion years ago. This Pok\u233?mon looks similar to that description.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
