Dylan picked up Scream Tail's Pok\u233? Ball. In the games, Paradox Pok\u233?mon appeared based on version exclusivity. But in this world, with both Professor Sada and Professor Turo present, it made sense for both ancient and future forms to coexist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
