On the left was Professor Sada, wearing a researcher's white coat over an orange tube top and shorts. Her gray hair gave her a wild yet alluring look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the right was Professor Turo, also in a lab coat but wearing a sleek, high-tech bodysuit underneath. His beard gave him a mature and composed demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, it's an honor to meet you, Professor Sada and Professor Turo," Dylan said, bowing slightly to the two.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sada and Turo led Dylan, Lillie, and Ilene into the lab's main hall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you've made it to the lab, then you've surely seen what's happening outside. Dylan, what do you think of them?" Turo asked, his voice deep and magnetic, yet eerily devoid of emotion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
