"If they appear in the outside world, the consequences would be unimaginable."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan added this remark, noting that the ancient forms were brutal and savage, while the future forms were cold and emotionless\u8212?perfect reflections of what Paradox Pok\u233?mon truly represented.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're absolutely right," Professor Sada AI agreed. "Whether it's the ferocious and ruthless ancient Pok\u233?mon or the icy, unfeeling future Pok\u233?mon, they are not suited for the outside world. Their power would destroy the modern ecosystem."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"While we know the dream of the real Professors Sada and Turo was for ancient, future, and modern Pok\u233?mon to coexist in harmony, that vision is simply unrealistic," Professor Turo AI added, his tone calm but firm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dream? Wait a second... are you saying\u8212??" Lillie's eyes widened in realization.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, my apologies. It seems we forgot to mention this. We're not the real Professors Sada and Turo. We are AI robots created by them," Sada AI explained with a slight tilt of her head, then spoke softly as if recalling an old memory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"!!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie and Ilene were stunned. While Dylan had already told them that the professors had created AI, they hadn't expected it to be {\i
this} advanced.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aside from the lack of emotion in their voices, how were they any different from real humans?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There's no need to be surprised," Turo AI said evenly. "With the level of AI technology available in today's world, something like us would be impossible to achieve. However, the crystals embedded within this Zero Lab enabled this cutting-edge development. That's why we cannot leave this facility."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Turo AI's voice remained emotionless as he continued, "Dylan, you are a very strong trainer."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How would you know?" Dylan raised an eyebrow. Though technically speaking to Sada AI, Dylan still addressed them as "Professors" out of respect\u8212?they deserved the title.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
