Koraidon and Miraidon\u8212?known as the "Paradise Guardian Dragons" and featured on the covers of {\i
The Scarlet Book} and {\i
The Violet Book}\u8212?were Paradox Pok\u233?mon themselves, likely ancient and future forms of Cyclizar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But unlike other Paradox Pok\u233?mon, Koraidon and Miraidon were true legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly, why did Cyclizar fare so poorly in comparison? While not weak, it didn't hold a candle to Koraidon or Miraidon in strength or stature.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I see," Dylan said, understanding. It made sense that Koraidon and Miraidon could sense the presence of the Kyurem on his team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's why we'd like to ask for your help, Dylan," Turo AI continued.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
