"As we mentioned before, the time machine continues to operate, endlessly transporting ancient and future Pok\u233?mon into the modern era. If this continues, sooner or later, they will leave Area Zero and spread into the outside world," Sada AI explained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
