"As AI replicas of the Professors, we do not think it is right for such a tragedy to unfold," she continued, her voice still calm yet tinged with subtle melancholy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"To prevent this, Dylan, we would like you to defeat the strongest AI left behind by the Professors and use your strength to shatter their\u8212?our\u8212?dreams," Turo AI said solemnly. For a brief moment, his voice seemed to carry a faint, almost imperceptible weight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why is that?" Lillie asked, her mind struggling to process what she was hearing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
