Dylan agreed to their request, but to shut down the time machine, he needed a specific item: *The Scarlet Book* and *The Violet Book* containing the IDs of Professors Sada and Turo.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This task required Dylan to retrieve the books personally, as Sada AI and Turo AI could not leave the Zero Lab.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, it wasn't a difficult endeavor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Riding on Reshiram, Dylan and the others quickly flew to Mesagoza and contacted Arven using the phone number provided by Sada AI.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arven was a young man with ash-brown hair and a stern, serious expression, though beneath it all, he was kindhearted and gentle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're saying you can take me to see my parents?" Arven asked in a low voice as he approached Dylan. Arven was, of course, the son of Professors Sada and Turo.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My parents are in the\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"In the Zero Lab, right?" Dylan cut him off gently with a smile. "I know, because I just came from there."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
