But before the wave could fully dissipate, Lapras had already leaped high into the air\u8212?its target, Volcarona.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You think the same move will work twice, Red? That's underestimating me a little, don't you think?" Dylan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Volcarona, Hurricane!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volcarona let out a deep cry. As it flapped its wings forcefully, a violent storm surged forward to engulf the descending Lapras.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Flying-type Hurricane!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan wasn't about to let Lapras trade hits this time. Hurricane's wide coverage attack was completely different from the previously used Solar Beam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red reacted instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Lapras plummeted toward Volcarona, a green Protect barrier shimmered around its body, blocking the raging winds of Hurricane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Protect barrier began to crack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bug Buzz!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Brine!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the moment Protect shattered, both Pok\u233?mon attacked simultaneously\u8212?Volcarona unleashed another Bug Buzz, while Lapras fired a jet of water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Water-type Brine! When the opponent's health was low, Brine's power doubled!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sonic waves of Bug Buzz pulsed outward, covering the entire space in front of Volcarona.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red had intended to make Brine slip past Volcarona's attack like before, but Dylan had anticipated this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Bug Buzz covering such a large area, Brine couldn't sneak through\u8212?it had to clash head-on with the attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, with Volcarona's Special Attack boosted and Swarm activated, its Bug Buzz was absurdly powerful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even at double power, Brine couldn't break through\u8212?it was Bug Buzz that struck Lapras instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, right before impact, Lapras forcibly twisted its body, turning its back shell toward Volcarona to absorb the brunt of the hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Bug Buzz blasted into Lapras, the Pok\u233?mon cried out in pain, its body spiraling downward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lapras crashed heavily onto the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finish it with Giga Drain!" Dylan ordered decisively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volcarona descended, its body glowing with deep green energy as particles of life force began drifting toward it from Lapras.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lapras! Hydro Pump!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, Red's voice rang out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan was momentarily surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before his eyes, Lapras abruptly lifted its head, water energy surging in its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had just been struck by Bug Buzz and slammed into the ground\u8212?how could it counterattack so quickly? But the reality was undeniable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was it because Lapras had used its shell to tank the damage? Had Red planned all of this?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan narrowed his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No\u8212?if Giga Drain didn't take effect quickly enough, Volcarona would be the one to go down first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bug Buzz!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lapras unleashed a massive torrent of water, while Volcarona abandoned Giga Drain and immediately flapped its wings, sending out another devastating Bug Buzz.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two explosive sounds erupted almost simultaneously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Hydro Pump even fully connected, Bug Buzz had already struck Volcarona\u8212?but the immense water pressure sent Volcarona flying backward in a spray of water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, Bug Buzz detonated against Lapras, creating a massive shockwave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap! What a turn of events! I thought Lapras was done for!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, I don't get it\u8212?how did Lapras fire off Hydro Pump so fast after getting hit and crashing?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Volcarona might not withstand that Hydro Pump... Whoa! This challenger is insane! He might actually be the first to take down Dylan's Pok\u233?mon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"666! This guy is incredible!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The spectators, who had gathered to watch, erupted into excited discussions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the Battlefield\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volcarona struggled to lift itself, but the super-effective Hydro Pump had dealt a serious blow. Combined with the Ancient Power from earlier\u8212?quadruple effective against it\u8212?Volcarona ultimately couldn't get back up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It collapsed, completely unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the other side, as the dust settled, Lapras was revealed with spiral eyes\u8212?it hadn't been able to withstand Bug Buzz either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Volcarona and Lapras are both unable to battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan recalled Volcarona, looking down at its Pok\u233? Ball with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not bad at all, Red. You're even stronger than I expected."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He looked up at Red, his expression genuinely impressed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red tugged his cap down slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though he had taken down Volcarona, he didn't feel like he had gained any real advantage. In fact, this full-team battle was shaping up to be even tougher than he had anticipated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's strategy revolved around an all-Fire-type team, and yet Lapras\u8212?a Water-type Pok\u233?mon\u8212?had already been taken out early on\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was definitely not a good sign. Especially considering the battle rules had actually been slightly in Red's favor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But the battle is just getting started, Red. Your next opponent will be far harder to deal with than Volcarona."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pulled out another Pok\u233? Ball, a smirk forming on his lips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red pressed the brim of his cap down further, the shadow obscuring his red eyes and the serious expression on his face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Harder to deal with than Volcarona?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Did that mean Volcarona was actually the weakest of Dylan's core team?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red furrowed his brows but quickly relaxed them again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The stronger Dylan was, the more intense the battle\u8212?and the more excited Red became.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8230? how had Blue managed to defeat Dylan and earn the Rota Badge?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could it be that he had simply lucked out with a favorable type matchup, and Dylan had used weaker Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah, that must be it. Red was sure of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
