{\qc
226: Chapter 226: Feel Its Power!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan flipped his hand and tossed out the Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fierce Incineroar reappeared in front of Dylan, letting out a low growl in a show of intimidation toward Red.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing Incineroar, Red fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite his silence, Red still opened his Pok\u233? Ball, and Blastoise landed in front of him once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then came the familiar combination\u8212?Intimidate + Fake Out + Parting Shot\u8212?a three-hit debuff sequence. Red frowned but found himself helpless against it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was truly\u8230? an utterly unreasonable weakening strategy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Next, Dylan switched to Ninetales, bringing the harsh sunlight back into play with its Drought ability.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baton Pass." Dylan quickly recalled Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shell Smash!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red hesitated for a moment before issuing his command to Blastoise. With all of Dylan's tactical maneuvers, he couldn't just sit there and watch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But attacking was pointless\u8212?before any move could reach Ninetales, it would likely already be back in its Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red also refrained from using Rain Dance to counter the harsh sunlight, because Ninetales and Incineroar could rotate seamlessly!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he used Rain Dance now, Dylan could simply switch back to Incineroar and use Parting Shot to cycle Ninetales in again\u8212?it would be meaningless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise let out a low growl as a brilliant white light continuously flashed around its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shell Smash!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Normal-type move that lowers the user's Defense and Special Defense by one stage but drastically increases Attack, Special Attack, and Speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a high-risk, high-reward setup move\u8212?but in this case?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Due to Incineroar's debuffs, Blastoise's Attack had only returned to its normal level, its Special Attack had only risen by one stage, and the only true gain was in Speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Moth! Get ready for battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan tossed out his fourth Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a flash of white light, a Pok\u233?mon resembling Volcarona hovered silently in front of him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It shared many physical traits with Volcarona, but its mechanical design was unmistakable\u8212?even its wings looked like they were made of cold, lifeless metal, giving it an eerie presence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was Iron Moth!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Beep\u8212?Iron Moth, Fire/Poison-type, Paradox Pok\u233?mon.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ability: Quark Drive}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Moves: Bug Buzz, Overheat, Morning Sun, Fiery Dance, Sludge Wave, Discharge, Fire Blast, Electric Terrain\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Description: This Pok\u233?mon bears a strong resemblance to unidentified flying objects (UFOs) rumored to observe humans, as reported in supernatural magazines.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's Rotom Pok\u233?dex provided detailed information on Iron Moth, but the Pok\u233?dexes of Blue and the others failed to recognize it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What is that Pok\u233?mon?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red tried to recall any knowledge of this Pok\u233?mon but found nothing in his memory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From its appearance, could it be a different form of Volcarona?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Moth is a Paradox Pok\u233?mon with Fire and Poison typing," Dylan explained. He never liked keeping type advantages a secret.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red's crimson eyes flickered slightly. He was already familiar with Paradox Pok\u233?mon\u8212?after all, Dylan had gifted him a powerful Roaring Moon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And with a Fire + Poison typing, that meant Iron Moth had a quadruple weakness to Ground moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, since Iron Moth was airborne, hitting it with a Ground-type move would be a challenge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red remained cautious. Based on what Dylan had said earlier, this Iron Moth was likely just as strong as the Volcarona from before\u8212?if not even stronger!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise, use Hydro Pump!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pulling down his cap slightly, Red gave the order\u8212?he needed to gauge Iron Moth's strength first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise let out a roar as the twin cannons on its back began to glow blue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydro Pump!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Blastoise wasn't at full health\u8212?having taken a hit from Volcarona's Fiery Dance earlier and being struck twice by Incineroar's Fake Out\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
thanks to Shell Smash, it had negated the effects of Parting Shot and boosted its Special Attack by one stage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a result, this Hydro Pump was just as strong as the one used against Volcarona earlier!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive surge of water erupted, crashing toward Iron Moth like an unstoppable tidal wave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Blast." Dylan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth slid backward with an eerie grace, its body glowing red as flames condensed in front of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive, kanji-shaped blaze erupted forward, colliding directly with the incoming Hydro Pump.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another head-on clash?! Dylan really had a fiery personality!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Many spectators in the stands were astonished\u8212?few trainers would dare to pit a Fire-type move directly against a Water-type move in sheer force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire Blast and Hydro Pump clashed violently, their immense power surging against one another, neither side yielding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But soon, Blue and the others noticed with shock\u8212?Iron Moth's Fire Blast was beginning to overpower Hydro Pump!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What\u8230??"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Bird Keeper was utterly stunned. He wasn't mistaken\u8212?Fire Blast was actually pushing Hydro Pump back toward Blastoise!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This completely defied logic!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red narrowed his eyes at the sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise's Hydro Pump wasn't any weaker than before\u8212?this wasn't a matter of Blastoise getting weaker.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was that Iron Moth was even stronger than Volcarona!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Red, my Iron Moth has a much higher Special Attack than Volcarona!" Dylan grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeed, Iron Moth's Special Attack was significantly higher than Volcarona's!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although the harsh sunlight didn't activate Iron Moth's ability, it still boosted the power of Fire-type moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise!" Red called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise roared, squeezing out every bit of its strength to intensify Hydro Pump.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Moth, overpower it!" Dylan commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth's mechanical core glowed ominously as Fire Blast surged in size, its advance accelerating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydro Pump was completely overwhelmed and evaporated\u8212?Fire Blast crashed directly into Blastoise!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fiery explosions erupted, sending red-hot embers flying as shockwaves spread outward, drowning out Blastoise's cries of pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A searing heatwave rolled across the battlefield, forcing Red to shield his face to avoid taking the brunt of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What a powerful Fire Blast!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red frowned\u8212?despite the sunlight's boost and debuffs, the fact that Iron Moth could outright overpower Blastoise's Hydro Pump was ridiculous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smoke and dust filled the air, obscuring Blastoise's figure completely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Discharge!" Dylan ordered without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He didn't need to see Blastoise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth hovered above the battlefield, sparks of electricity crackling around its metallic wings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A second later, a massive wave of electric energy surged downward\u8212?Discharge!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect!" Red commanded immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Electricity was super-effective against Blastoise\u8212?he couldn't afford to take the hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Within the smoke, Blastoise barely managed to conjure a protective barrier. Discharge struck the shield, golden lightning crackling violently, but it failed to break through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Keep using Discharge."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How long could it keep blocking?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth's body sparked with energy again as another wave of lightning rained down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red knew he had to act fast\u8212?Blastoise couldn't stay on the defensive forever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The second Discharge struck, but Blastoise was gone\u8212?a dark hole was left in its place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dig?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised an eyebrow\u8212?Iron Moth had no way to counter Dig.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Prepare Fiery Dance."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth's metallic wings shimmered as flames began to dance along them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, Blastoise burst from the ground behind it, cloaked in Ground-type energy, lunging toward Iron Moth!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fiery Dance!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Moth swiftly turned, releasing a surge of scorching flames just as Blastoise reached striking range.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fiery Dance Clashes with Blastoise's Dig!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise pushed forward with all its might, trying to break through the wall of flames from Iron Moth's Fiery Dance. Red's crimson eyes flickered with sharp focus.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Dig could land a hit on Iron Moth, even if it meant a trade of damage, it would still be worth it. But landing a hit on Iron Moth was easier said than done.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a sudden flap of Iron Moth's wings, the flames of Fiery Dance surged violently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A deafening explosion rocked the battlefield, and the sky was painted in dazzling flames, reflecting in the eyes of every spectator.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No way\u8212?Dig can't get close to Iron Moth! Its Fire-type attacks are way too strong!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Psychic-type trainer wiped the sweat from his face, staring in awe at the sea of crimson flames that had engulfed the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Hydro Pump had failed to overpower Iron Moth's flames\u8212?there was no way Dig could withstand the full force of Fiery Dance head-on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's right. Shell Smash did boost Blastoise's Attack, but because of Incineroar's debuffs, it only balanced out to normal levels."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf fanned herself with a poster. "Damn, it's getting hotter in here!"The Rotan Gym's ceiling had already been opened, but with Sunny Day still active and Dylan's Fire-type Pok\u233?mon continuously using Fire moves, the temperature remained high.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet, not a single spectator left\u8212?a little heat was nothing compared to the excitement of witnessing this incredible gym battle!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There's still some time left on Sunny Day. Blastoise definitely can't match up to Iron Moth. But\u8212?wait! That's a Substitute?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Psychic trainer had been analyzing the fight but suddenly widened his eyes in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield, Fiery Dance had detonated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise should have been knocked down from the sky\u8212?yet, in that instant, its body vanished in a puff of white smoke!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the effect of a Substitute being destroyed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough, the real Blastoise appeared right where its Substitute had been, cloaked in swirling, surging water, charging straight at Iron Moth!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aqua Jet!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not only that, but a bright blue energy aura surrounded Blastoise\u8212?its Torrent ability had been activated!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incredible\u8212?he used Substitute underground?" Dylan raised an eyebrow in surprise. But then, a grin slowly spread across his face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That's just like you, Red!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BANG!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise's Aqua Jet crashed into Iron Moth before it could retreat, sending the mechanical-winged Pok\u233?mon hurtling down like a missile. It slammed hard into the battlefield floor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Water-type moves were super-effective against Iron Moth, and with Torrent active, Aqua Jet's power was further boosted.Even under Sunny Day, which weakened Water moves, this attack still dealt massive damage to Iron Moth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On top of that, just like Volcarona, Iron Moth's physical defense was low, making the impact even more devastating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wow! That was incredible! That hit did serious damage to Iron Moth!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mitsuki gasped in amazement. This Red guy was insanely skilled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, using Substitute underground\u8212?that was a brilliant strategy. He must have known from the start that Dig wouldn't work against Iron Moth."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf was just as impressed. This kind of battle IQ was on another level!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Iron Moth sent crashing down, Blastoise landed heavily as well\u8212?but the moment its feet touched the ground, it winced in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wave Crash was powerful\u8212?but it had recoil damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Discharge."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, a golden bolt of electricity shot out, striking Blastoise the instant its recoil ended.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
ZZZTT!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sparks crackled violently across Blastoise's body, sending jolts of pain through it as it curled up slightly, letting out a low growl of agony.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not far away, Iron Moth slowly lifted itself back into the air. Its mechanical wings flickered with residual electricity, its form battered yet still standing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its eerie cross-shaped eyes locked onto Blastoise with a cold, mechanical intensity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So fast\u8230??" Red's brows furrowed. It was because of Wave Crash's recoil.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If there had been no recoil stun, Blastoise could have chased after Iron Moth\u8212?but now, it was too late.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another Discharge erupted, lightning surging through the battlefield. The explosion of electrical energy sent shockwaves outward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the smoke cleared, Blastoise lay unconscious on the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise is unable to battle. Iron Moth wins!" Leaf announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red silently recalled Blastoise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That made two of his Pok\u233?mon down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And both were Water-types\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battle had just gotten even harder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, there was some good news\u8212?Iron Moth had taken a serious hit, and Sunny Day was about to end.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, Red\u8212?let's see how you plan to handle my Iron Moth next."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan grinned, looking at Red with excitement in his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was why he loved battling strong opponents!The thrill of a truly competitive fight, the unexpected twists\u8212?this was on a whole different level than facing weak trainers!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Dylan also loved crushing opponents mercilessly and basking in the admiration and shock of onlookers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah\u8230? alternating between these two feelings was pretty great!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red could see the burning anticipation in Dylan's gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His red eyes gleamed slightly as he pulled out an Ultra Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, most of his main Pok\u233?mon were caught using standard Pok\u233? Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Except for one.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because\u8230? this was a Pok\u233?mon that Dylan had personally given to him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan\u8212?this is the Pok\u233?mon you gave me!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red threw the Ultra Ball, his crimson eyes flashing with determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, feel its power!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roaring Moon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
ROOOOAAARRR!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A savage, draconic roar thundered through the Rotan Gym.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
