228: Chapter 228: Facing a Legend!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Face Entei! Face a Legend!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For Red, this was both a tough challenge and an exciting opportunity\u8212?exactly the kind of battle he loved!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only in fights like these could he truly feel his own existence and his purpose as a Trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He craved battle. He dreamed of battle. He lived for battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victory and honor? Those were just bonuses that came along the way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red knew very well\u8212?he was fundamentally different from Blue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue chased the peak of the Trainer world because he wanted to be the Champion, to be recognized as the strongest Trainer in the world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That had been Blue's dream since childhood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Red?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He sought strength for a different reason\u8212?to battle stronger opponents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as he kept getting stronger, the opponents he encountered would also be stronger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He challenged the Indigo League because the Kanto Elite Four were the strongest Trainers in the region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He came to Rota Gym because its Gym Leader was Dylan!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Scale Shot!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red's crimson eyes burned with passion, his voice brimming with excitement and intensity\u8212?a side of him rarely seen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon's blood-red wings sliced through the air, releasing a rain of glowing blue scales that shot down like bullets.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Dragon-type Scale Shot!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entei lowered its stance, its muscular legs tensing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A brilliant white light flared behind it\u8212?then boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, Entei shot forward like a lightning bolt!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Normal-type priority move\u8212?Extreme Speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scale Shot covered a wide area, but Extreme Speed was simply too fast\u8212?before the scales could land, Entei had already vanished!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roaring Moon, fly higher!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red's sharp gaze locked onto the orange blur as Entei dashed across the battlefield at insane speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon flapped its massive wings, soaring higher into the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But suddenly\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A fiery blur leaped up, heading straight for Roaring Moon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was Entei!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boosted by Extreme Speed, it moved faster than expected, even catching Roaring Moon off guard!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BANG!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entei's tackle slammed into Roaring Moon's midsection!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The dragon gritted its teeth, letting out a pained growl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon was a brutal physical attacker\u8212?aside from Special Attack and Defense, it had no weaknesses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With one of the highest Attack stats among non-Legendary Pok\u233?mon, blazing speed, and flight capabilities, it was an absolute powerhouse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its low Defense was its only true flaw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rock Slide!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red didn't hesitate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with its low Defense, Roaring Moon wasn't going to lose to a simple Extreme Speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a fierce roar, Roaring Moon summoned massive boulders, launching them straight at Entei.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once again, Entei vanished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using the momentum from its own speed, it sidestepped the incoming boulders, dodging them with ease!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't let it escape! Dragon Rush!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red immediately pressed the attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Extreme Speed was a frustrating move to deal with, but now that Entei was airborne, it had no way to regain its momentum!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was the perfect chance to strike!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
ROAR!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon's wings flared wide, its entire body radiating pure Dragon energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The energy formed into the shape of a fearsome dragon, surrounding Roaring Moon's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon Rush!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The feral dragon dived down, slamming toward Entei with unstoppable force!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sacred Fire!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan reacted instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entei let out a thunderous roar, its body erupting in violet flames!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sacred Fire\u8212?a powerful Fire-type move originally exclusive to Ho-Oh, but Entei could also use it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Entei's Sacred Fire was different\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike Ho-Oh's radiant multicolored flames, Entei's version burned with deep violet hues.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon Rush and Sacred Fire collided\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The impact sent waves of energy rippling through the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The temperature inside the Gym rapidly soared from the heat of battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BANG!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
