But before the flames could completely disperse\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive shadow broke through the firestorm!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon forced its way through the explosion!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CRASH!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon Rush slammed into Entei!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Legendary Beast roared in pain, but Roaring Moon didn't stop.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With unstoppable momentum, Roaring Moon slammed Entei straight into the ground!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battlefield trembled from the sheer force of impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ground beneath Entei cracked apart, leaving deep fissures.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dust and debris filled the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Damn! That hit was brutal!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This Roaring Moon is crazy strong!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
