Word had already spread through Rota\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan, the Gym Leader, was going all-out in a full-team battle against a challenger!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even casual onlookers from Rota's shopping district had rushed over to see.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trainers from nearby areas had also arrived, drawn by the intensity of the fight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
