Recently, there were even rumors that a group from Galar had come to Rota to recruit Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roaring Moon! Rock Slide!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red ignored the growing audience.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He didn't care about the crowd\u8212?he never had.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was completely focused on the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was his chance to press his advantage\u8212?he wasn't going to waste it!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon soared upward, its wings stirring the air, summoning a hail of massive boulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A powerful Rock Slide!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The orange blur shot forward again, slamming into Roaring Moon's chest!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon roared in fury, its expression twisted into a feral snarl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Claw!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red didn't panic\u8212?he knew Roaring Moon excelled in close combat!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring Moon's claws gleamed with draconic energy, slashing toward Entei.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Crunch\u8212?bite it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
