"The only Pok\u233?mon in the games that can Mega Evolve without a Mega Stone."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan observed Rayquaza with great interest. As Hoenn's third legendary deity, the Sky Dragon, its power was nothing short of mesmerizing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the games, Rayquaza was unique\u8212?it didn't need a Mega Stone to Mega Evolve. All it had to do was learn Dragon Ascent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, in reality, other Pok\u233?mon had demonstrated the ability to Mega Evolve on their own, like Mewtwo, Latios, and Latias in the movies. However, Dylan suspected that they either had their Mega Stones embedded in their bodies or had fused with them entirely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
