In the next instant, Beedrill spun around and slammed into Marshadow with Aerial Ace!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marshadow cried out in pain\u8212?Flying-type moves were super effective against it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Still got some tricks up your sleeve." Dylan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pursuit!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Punch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beedrill's right lance gleamed with dark energy as it struck toward the staggered Marshadow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Marshadow ducked low, narrowly avoiding the attack as Beedrill's lance pierced just above its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking the opportunity, Marshadow lunged forward, its right fist bursting into flames\u8212?Fire Punch!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, Beedrill swung its other lance to intercept.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni frowned slightly\u8212?Marshadow's reaction speed was insane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire Punch smashed into Beedrill's waist!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A surge of red-hot flames exploded upon impact, and Beedrill let out a cry as it was blasted backward through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire-type moves were super effective against Beedrill! That hit was devastating!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're winning this!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie clutched her hands together nervously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Spectral Thief!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marshadow instantly transformed into a shadow, streaking after the airborne Beedrill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A surge of dark energy shot into the sky, completely engulfing Beedrill before it even hit the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Those eerie, hollow orange eyes reappeared, floating within the shadows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Spectral Thief detonated with a deafening explosion. Darkness rippled outward, and Beedrill crashed to the ground, motionless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marshadow reformed from the shadows, standing quietly as it gazed at its fallen opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beedrill struggled, trying to lift its head, but pain wracked its body. It couldn't stand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Beedrill is unable to battle! Marshadow wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Matori stepped forward, examined Beedrill, and announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni took a long, silent look at Beedrill's Pok\u233? Ball before recalling it. His deep eyes flickered with unreadable thoughts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Impressive. Truly impressive."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a moment, Giovanni lowered his head and chuckled softly, then looked at Dylan, clapping lightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, you are truly strong."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His tone was full of genuine admiration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Since reaching Champion-level, my Beedrill has never been defeated. You are the first."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni understood\u8212?Beedrill was his strongest Pok\u233?mon, and yet, Dylan had bested it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, you also didn't know much about Genesect and Marshadow." Dylan smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Genesect's Final Gambit had been crucial, and Spectral Thief had caught Giovanni off guard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, Giovanni's Beedrill still had untapped potential\u8212?he didn't have its Mega Stone yet. Once he did, its power would reach even greater heights.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No, a loss is a loss."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni shook his head. Dylan had a point, but Giovanni wasn't one to make excuses for his own defeat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if he had known about Genesect and Marshadow, whether Beedrill could have beaten both was still uncertain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Technically, our battle should end here, Dylan. Beedrill is my strongest Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni gazed at Marshadow with a slight smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Marshadow was incredibly powerful. Given Beedrill's defeat, his Rhyperior and Dugtrio wouldn't stand a chance against it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"However, Dylan\u8230? You've probably guessed it. I have one last trump card."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's not my Pok\u233?mon, but right now, it's my ally. Let it be my final opponent against you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hands in his pockets, Giovanni spoke calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Footsteps echoed in the silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A silver-white Pok\u233?mon emerged from behind Giovanni, its piercing psychic eyes locking onto Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie's eyes widened in shock, the Pok\u233?mon's figure reflecting in her pupils.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had seen this Pok\u233?mon before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in the underground facility beneath Saffron City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And its presence confirmed one thing\u8212?Giovanni was with Team Rocket!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not just that\u8212?with Giovanni's strength, there was no doubt\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was the LEADER of Team Rocket!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait\u8230? The Team Rocket boss was also a Gym Leader?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The silver Pok\u233?mon came to a stop in front of Giovanni, staring directly at Marshadow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, this is my final fighter."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Its name is\u8230? Mewtwo."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni's deep voice remained calm, but the pride in it was unmistakable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course. Mewtwo.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch\u8230? Now what should I use against Mewtwo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
