263: Chapter 263: If Anyone\u8217?s Fighting Mewtwo, It Has to Be Me!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The legendary Pok\u233?mon created from Mew's genetic material.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie remembered it clearly. Back in that underground facility in Saffron City, if not for Mewtwo's appearance, all those high-ranking officers would have already been captured by Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, how do you plan to deal with it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni smiled faintly, his sharp gaze fixed on Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo was his final trump card. He knew Dylan wouldn't fear it, but he was curious\u8212?how would Mewtwo compare to Dylan's other legendary Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially under his command, as a top-tier Champion!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Return, Marshadow." Dylan withdrew Marshadow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Marshadow was strong, but it hadn't broken past its limits yet. Even though Mewtwo had only been awakened for less than a year, its power had already reached the level of a Tier 1 Legendary.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It would be too much to ask Marshadow to take on Mewtwo. There was no need for that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, since Giovanni was "breaking the rules" by using a Tier 1 Legendary, then he couldn't blame Dylan for doing the same! After all, it was Giovanni who "broke the taboo" first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As expected, if I'm going to fight Mewtwo, I have to use {\i
that}."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan thought it over and over again, but in the end, there was only one real choice. After all, the opponent was {\i
Mewtwo}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Peppa."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan opened his backpack and struggled to pull out a certain Pok\u233?mon that had been snoring away inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo's psychic eyes immediately flared up with intense energy, locking onto the chubby, round-bellied {\i
Clefairy} in Dylan's hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni narrowed his eyes slightly. Seeing it up close, this "Clefairy" was even more absurdly plump than he had imagined.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wake up. Wake up already."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan slapped the pudgy cheeks of the so-called "Clefairy," only to find that it was sleeping as soundly as a dead log, completely unresponsive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you a pig? Get up and help me out already."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it was useless. The atmosphere was starting to get awkward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smacked it a few more times, but apparently, the thick layer of fat absorbed the impact, preventing his palm from getting through. The "Clefairy" remained in blissful slumber.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uh\u8230? Mewtwo, can you help me out here?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan hesitated before turning to Mewtwo for assistance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?" Mewtwo was silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next moment, Mewtwo lifted its left arm, and an immense, invisible psychic force surged forth, its blue aura instantly enveloping the "Clefairy."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Slowly, it was lifted into the air, rising all the way to the ceiling. Then, with a sharp downward swing of Mewtwo's arm\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
BOOM!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The "Clefairy" was slammed down at high speed, crashing heavily into the floor, sending up a thick cloud of dust.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
Miii!} (Who the hell sneak-attacked me while I was sleeping?!)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An enraged cry rang out as a pink psychic shockwave blasted outward, instantly dispersing the dust cloud.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The now-glowing, pink {\i
Clefairy} floated up from the crater, its furious eyes locked onto Mewtwo. It was about to lose its temper!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Did no one understand how bad its morning temper was?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
Mii?}"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then it saw Mewtwo and froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
Oh, it's you again, Mii. I don't wanna fight you. You always lose to me, and you still refuse to call me 'Mama.'}"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clefairy pouted, its earlier irritation vanishing in an instant. Although Mewtwo had been quite rude in waking it up, Clefairy still had a certain level of tolerance for it\u8212?after all, Mewtwo {\i
was} technically its "offspring," created from its genetic material.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clefairy wasn't the type to hold grudges anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?I DON'T EVEN HAVE A MOTHER!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo's forehead visibly throbbed with frustration as its telepathic voice practically growled through clenched teeth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni watched their exchange with great amusement. It seemed that something had happened during Mewtwo's previous encounter with Mew that he wasn't aware of.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But from the looks of it, Mewtwo had finally resolved its inner conflict regarding Mew. That was a good thing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Peppa, this is a proper battle. Your opponent is Mewtwo."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan spoke to Clefairy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
Eh? But it's my 'offspring,' Mii. I can't bring myself to hit it.}"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clefairy's eyes sparkled mischievously, though it put on an exaggerated expression of reluctance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo's fists clenched tighter, its psychic aura flickering violently. {\i
What do you mean you "can't bring yourself to do it"?! You're practically grinning, you bastard!!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Twenty crates."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
Teaching this kid a lesson is my responsibility, Mii!}"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clefairy agreed without hesitation. In an instant, it shimmered, reverting to its true form\u8212?the legendary pink {\i
Mew}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni's eyes widened in rare astonishment as he finally got a clear look at Mew's appearance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo, meanwhile, closed its eyes and repeated to itself: {\i
I have no connection to this thing. I have absolutely no relation to this pink pig.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, this is really\u8230? {\i
Mew}?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing Giovanni's question, Mew immediately turned and glared at him, puffing up in indignation. Was he\u8230? questioning its {\i
figure}?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Peppa has been eating well since coming to my place, so please don't be surprised, Giovanni-senpai."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan coughed lightly, giving a tactful explanation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?I see." Giovanni fell silent. He had nothing to say to that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"However, a battle between Mew and Mewtwo isn't suited for an indoor gym. Giovanni-senpai, shall we move to the wild?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
