"How do you feel?" Dylan asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I feel\u8230? excellent."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo's deep, resonant telepathic voice echoed in his mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The voice\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It sounded slightly feminine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like the Mewtwo from Genesect and the Legend Awakened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Try this out, Mewtwo."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
