Though its body had become smaller, Shiny Mewtwo Y could feel an overwhelming surge of power coursing through it!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beep~ Shiny Mewtwo Y, Psychic-type, Genetic Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
