269: Chapter 269: Help Me!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I want to report a crime!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A disheveled female secretary burst into the Saffron City Police Station, so frantic she didn't even know where her shoes had gone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And you are\u8230??"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
