To put it nicely\u8212?it looked kind of creepy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ding~ Amoonguss. Grass/Poison Type. Mushroom Pok\u233?mon.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ability: Effect Spore}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Moves: Spore, Solar Beam, Toxic, Rage Powder, Giga Drain, Synthesis, Pollen Puff\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
It swings its cap-like arms in a luring dance to attract prey. Prefers dark, damp places.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Listening to the Rotom Pok\u233?dex, Itto fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?This thing is part of the main team?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
