Unfortunately, this one had Blaze, not Intimidate\u8212?so no Attack drop for Amoonguss.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, this was likely Kukui's ace Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As the challenger, please take the first move, Professor."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan politely gestured for him to begin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
