But at the same time, a gentle green glow spread from Amoonguss\u8212?Grassy Terrain had been activated, softening the loss of offensive power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Braviary!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui's second Pok\u233? Ball released a majestic eagle Pok\u233?mon that soared overhead, letting out a piercing cry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ding~ Braviary. Normal/Flying Type. Valiant Pok\u233?mon.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ability: Keen Eye}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Moves: Brave Bird, Defog, Air Slash, Crush Claw, Aerial Ace, Sky Attack\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
A brave sky warrior\u8212?respected even more by its peers the more scars it carries.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Braviary looked strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie's eyes widened slightly. As an Alolan, she'd heard of Kukui for a long time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rumor had it he'd once attempted the Island Challenge, but hadn't made it to Trial Captain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
