"This looks tough\u8230? Braviary has the aerial advantage. Amoonguss probably won't even be able to touch it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Itto rubbed his chin, noting Amoonguss's poor speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flying beats Grass. A bad match-up."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
