Any serious challenger would obviously bring type counters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Braviary, use Aerial Ace!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The eagle let out a fierce cry and swept downward like a bolt of lightning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sweet Scent."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's command was soft and calm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss twirled its stubby arms, releasing a cloud of pink, sweet-smelling mist all around itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui frowned. That wasn't an attack\u8212?it was a supportive move, usually used to lower evasion or distract foes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But something about it felt\u8230? off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was there something else in that mist? The pink was thick, and hard to see through. Maybe he was imagining it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Braviary dove through the scent cloud, slamming into Amoonguss with Aerial Ace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss let out a pained grunt\u8212?Flying was super effective, and Braviary had great Attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Spore," Dylan said, lips curling slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No good, Dylan! My Braviary can fly!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui grinned. Spore was powerful, sure\u8212?but Braviary could just stay airborne.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh? Professor Kukui, take a closer look."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui glanced at Braviary and suddenly froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The eagle was hovering awkwardly, wings faltering as it struggled to stay aloft.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Braviary! What are you doing? Fly, come on!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
