But Amoonguss's Spore was already in motion\u8212?bursting forth like a cloud of pollen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, Braviary wobbled\u8230? and dropped like a rock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It hit the ground with a {\i
thud}, fast asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Spore: Sprays sleep-inducing spores to cause the opponent to fall asleep.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yep. Braviary was out cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss happily bounced over, tapping Braviary's head with one of its mushroom cap arms. Satisfied that it was in a deep slumber, its wide pink mouth curled into an even creepier grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It actually put Braviary to sleep?" Itto was stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Didn't make sense. Braviary was fast and strong\u8212?how did Amoonguss even manage?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
