"\u8230?What happened?" Kukui frowned. Was it that Sweet Scent?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Braviary hadn't lingered near Amoonguss, it should've avoided the spores.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sweet Scent could definitely cause a lapse in guard, but Kukui knew his Braviary\u8212?it was too well-trained to fall for that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He looked at Dylan, seeking confirmation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It was spores," Dylan said with a soft smile. "I mixed a small amount of Spore into the Sweet Scent. Hard to see. Once Braviary breathed it in, it was already too late."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui's frown deepened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So there was something off with that scent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What a reliable back that is~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan looked proudly at his Amoonguss, snoring Braviary beside it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Anyone who calls Amoonguss ugly when its back is this useful\u8212?we'll have words! What a strong, skilled, and beautiful back!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
