{\qc
292: Chapter 292: Cute!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan thought Amoonguss was as reliable as ever. Kukui, however, didn't quite agree.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was starting to find this situation pretty tricky\u8212?his Braviary was asleep, and unless it used Sleep Talk, it was just a sitting duck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Sleep Talk was a gamble\u8212?it randomly selects one of the moves the user knows. And Braviary had learned way too many.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Should he switch it out? But even then, it'd still be asleep when it came back later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grassy Terrain glimmered softly, its green light healing Amoonguss a little.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Braviary, now grounded, couldn't benefit from it while at full HP.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sludge Bomb."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Kukui hesitated, Dylan gave his command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss raised both arms, purple energy condensing before launching blobs of toxic sludge at Braviary.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Braviary, use Sleep Talk!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui quickly responded\u8212?he couldn't just stand there and let it be pummeled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still asleep, Braviary stirred, talons twitching. A soft white glow enveloped it\u8212?it used Hone Claws!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui winced. Boosting attack was nice and all, but not very helpful right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss's Sludge Bombs landed cleanly, exploding one after another. Braviary groaned in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite Amoonguss's modest special attack\u8212?and the fact it had been weakened earlier by Parting Shot\u8212?Braviary didn't have the best special defense either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the smoke cleared, Braviary looked pretty beat up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Keep it up. Sludge Bomb again."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Return, Braviary!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui immediately called it back. He wasn't going to let it take another hit for nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He sent out his third Pok\u233?mon\u8212?a beautiful, pale blue fox with a regal poise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An Alolan Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its Ice/Fairy typing was a strong counter to Amoonguss.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike Braviary, who preferred melee, Alolan Ninetales was a ranged attacker. Its offensive stats weren't overwhelming, but its mobility and typing made it very effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alolan Ninetales has a 4x weakness to Steel, but Amoonguss can't learn any Steel moves," Leaf noted, checking the Rotom Dex.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This one had the Snow Cloak ability\u8212?not Snow Warning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Snow Cloak boosts evasion during hail, but without setting up hail first, it wasn't doing anything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Amoonguss is just too slow for this matchup," Itto muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alolan Ninetales was agile and had decent power\u8212?especially under a skilled trainer like Kukui.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And it can't learn any switching moves either," Lillie added.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That makes it hard for my brother to rotate, but that's okay. It's just his first Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, Blizzard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui wasted no time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a melodic cry, Ninetales gathered icy energy in its mouth. A fierce snowstorm roared across the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rollout."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised an eyebrow. Kukui had quickly adjusted his strategy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss wasn't good at dealing with ranged attackers. Its physical attack was poor, and speed even worse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moves like Spore were great\u8212?wide area, fast to use, and guaranteed to sleep\u8212?but only at close range.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Against distance fighters, it struggled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8230? not completely helpless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Dylan's command, Amoonguss curled up and began spinning rapidly\u8212?a genetic move: Rollout.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rolling mushroom picked up speed and just barely dodged the Blizzard, tucking itself into a corner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grassy Terrain pulsed again, healing it slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Keep rolling forward."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss didn't stop\u8212?its rolling grew faster as it headed toward Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Freeze the ground with Ice Beam."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui reacted quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales fired a twisting beam of icy light along the ground, instantly freezing the surface in Amoonguss's path.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss hit the slick ice and started to skid\u8212?completely out of control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan chuckled lightly. "As expected of Professor Kukui."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blizzard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The storm erupted again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss stopped rolling, but inertia carried it forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A green barrier flared to life just in time to block the full force of the Blizzard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Quick response," Kukui admitted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If that Protect had been even a second late, Amoonguss would've been done for.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sweet Scent."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss swung its arms, releasing another wave of pink fragrance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, back off. Then Ice Beam."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui had learned his lesson from Braviary. No way he'd let Ninetales get close to that suspicious mist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales retreated, and as Amoonguss rolled closer, it leapt up gracefully, soaring over the mushroom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ice Beam!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From midair, Ninetales turned and blasted a freezing beam straight at Amoonguss.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Spore!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan didn't hesitate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss halted its roll and flung its arms wide, spraying a dense cloud of spores upward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui's eyes widened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Ice Beam hit, instantly freezing some of the spores, and struck Amoonguss hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The frost seared through it\u8212?it cried out in pain. Ice was super effective, and it hurt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, it had managed to unleash most of the Spore cloud.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales, midair, couldn't dodge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The spores engulfed it, and within moments, Ninetales was overwhelmed by a wave of drowsiness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thump!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It fell, fast asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss bounced over, tapping Ninetales's head with its mushroom arm again\u8212?classic move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Satisfied, it jumped up and down gleefully and began a ridiculous little dance on top of Ninetales's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It liked to dance, apparently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Again?" Amelia stared, her expression unreadable. "It's dancing\u8230? on her head\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This thing is so damn weird," Itto muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd initially disliked Amoonguss\u8212?ugly and not that strong, he thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now? It had already put two of Kukui's Pok\u233?mon to sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That thing could sleep a whole party if you weren't careful!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"See? Amoonguss is adorable," Dylan said, utterly pleased, watching it wiggle around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He fully believed in his Pok\u233?mon's cuteness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Cute!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui had question marks swirling above his head. His usually tan face was darkening visibly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This ugly, freaky thing\u8212?CUTE!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that's what Dylan meant when he said Grass Pok\u233?mon were cute!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This thing was dancing on top of his sleeping, elegant, ethereal Ninetales!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The audacity! How dare this grotesque fungus desecrate his graceful ice fox!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Return, Ninetales."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui quickly withdrew her. He couldn't watch another second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gross. Absolutely revolting. Not only did it sleep her, it danced on her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That thing needed to go\u8212?fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If I let that thing sleep one more of my team, this match is done," he muttered, glaring at the eccentric mushroom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grassy Terrain glowed again, healing Amoonguss some more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui threw out his ace\u8212?no more games. He was going to end this mushroom menace here and now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flash of white\u8212?his powerful Incineroar appeared, growling low.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss swayed slowly from side to side, completely unfazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar, huh?" Dylan raised an eyebrow. "You've got to keep your cool in battle, Professor Kukui."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He sounded amused. Kukui looked dead serious now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I am cool, Dylan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Alright then."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar, Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flames roared from Incineroar's belt, surging toward Amoonguss.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dodge it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with its slow speed, Amoonguss had enough distance to hop awkwardly out of the way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Spin!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another swirl of flames surrounded the area, trapping Amoonguss in a searing vortex.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss landed, wincing. It hated the heat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is tricky," Dylan muttered. Kukui was really pushing hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Incineroar was strong, no doubt about it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Time to wait for an opening\u8212?Kukui was bound to go for a close-range move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Punch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Right on cue, Incineroar charged, flames blazing on its claws.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Spore!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan called it\u8212?Amoonguss didn't back down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if it meant taking a hit, if Spore landed, it'd be worth it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amoonguss hopped back, arms flailing as it unleashed a cloud of spores.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked ridiculous, to be honest\u8212?but effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flare Blitz!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Kukui was ready this time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar roared, flames engulfing its entire body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flare Blitz!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It charged straight through the spores, burning every last one away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nice try, Dylan! Spore won't work on my Incineroar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui finally grinned again, feeling vindicated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan just smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Flare Blitz slammed into Amoonguss, launching it across the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It crashed to the ground, fainted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be fair, it had already taken a lot\u8212?Braviary's Aerial Ace, Ninetales's Ice Beam\u8212?plus the burning damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grassy Terrain could only do so much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Amoonguss had done its job. It had put two of Kukui's Pok\u233?mon to sleep\u8212?an amazing performance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Amoonguss is unable to battle. Incineroar wins," Leaf declared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Couldn't hang on, huh? A shame," Itto muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If it had put Incineroar to sleep too\u8230? that would've been insane."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well done. Get some rest."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan returned Amoonguss, praising it gently as he clipped the Pok\u233? Ball to his belt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finally."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui let out a breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That mushroom was deceptively hard to beat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're strong, Professor Kukui. Taking down my Amoonguss is no easy feat."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled, holding up his next Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I appreciate it. I am a pretty well-known trainer in Alola, after all."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui still stayed modest, though he didn't say he was the strongest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then\u8230? let's see how you handle this one, Professor."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's smile widened as he threw his second Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My second Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Whimsicott! Let's go!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a puff of white light, an adorable cotton fluff landed on the field, smiling brightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It struck a confident pose, tiny hands on its hips, staring up at Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whimsicott. Now that's actually cute."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui nodded in approval.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even he had to admit\u8212?it was undeniably adorable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Unlike that weird, creepy mushroom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides Spore, what else did that thing even have!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whimsicott, though? Now that was a real cutie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
