293: Chapter 293: Dylan, You Can't Fight Like This!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If I remember correctly, Whimsicott's damage output isn't very high,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Professor Kukui muttered to himself, weighing his options.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar, Parting Shot."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui decided it was time to withdraw his ace. He wouldn't have used it to quickly handle Amoonguss earlier if he had any other choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar barked out a stream of trash talk at Whimsicott, but the little fluffball kept its bright, mischievous smile\u8212?only narrowing its eyes slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A faint glow surrounded Whimsicott as its attack and special attack were lowered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Incineroar retreated into its Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Braviary!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kukui sent out his second pick.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as it appeared, Braviary dropped heavily onto the field\u8212?still sound asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh? Trying to stall out sleep turns with a low-damage opponent?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan tilted his head slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor Kukui, that might not be the best idea."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
