Itto declared the outcome.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch\u8230? that brat's gotten even stronger."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching from the sidelines, Itto let out a low whistle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Compared to their last encounter at Meteor Falls, Dylan was clearly on another level now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
