299: Chapter 299: Ultra Beast!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In front of Lusamine's mansion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Since we're all ready, let's go."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan looked at the three people behind him\u8212?Lusamine, Lillie, and Leaf.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hurry up, hurry up! I can't wait!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf was practically bouncing with excitement. This was a parallel world, after all\u8212?she was beyond curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lunala."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a small smile, Dylan enlarged a Pok\u233? Ball in his hand and released a majestic bat-like creature\u8212?Lunala.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Lunala let out a high-pitched cry, a net-like Ultra Wormhole slowly formed above them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was an Ultra Wormhole\u8212?an unstable passage connecting the Pok\u233?mon world and Ultra Space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Cosmog couldn't open one stably, Lunala, Solgaleo, and Necrozma could freely tear them open.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
