Rainbow Ghetsis realized too late that something was wrong. Mewtwo Y's glowing blue eyes locked onto him, and his own gaze turned dazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hypnosis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Five Pok\u233?balls floated from Rainbow Ghetsis and drifted over to Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan took out a box and placed them inside. Now, Ghetsis had no means of resistance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Big brother, who {\i
is} this guy?" Lillie asked, staring at the now-hypnotized Rainbow Ghetsis in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had her suspicions, but it was still hard to believe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A parallel world's Ghetsis, most likely. He probably came here to invade our world." Dylan looked at the dazed man standing in place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You guys should realize it now\u8212?this universe is vast. There are parallel worlds. Maybe there's one where you, Lillie, are going to school with a bunch of friends."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled gently. The parallel timelines in the Pok\u233?mon universe really were a mystery.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eh?" Lillie blinked in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Good thing you intercepted him, Dylan. If he'd gotten loose with Zekrom, it would've been a real disaster."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue frowned slightly. Dylan had taken down Rainbow Ghetsis with ease, but that didn't mean Ghetsis was weak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was, after all, a Champion-level Trainer with Zekrom. If he'd slipped into the real world and acted from the shadows, he'd have been a major threat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Exactly." Lusamine nodded in agreement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This matter really does need to be taken seriously. There may be others who use Ultra Space to come to our world."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan considered the situation. Since Rainbow Ghetsis came through first, Rainbow Giovanni and the others were bound to follow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Someone would need to keep an eye on Ultra Space. If they really did arrive, Dylan wouldn't be afraid\u8212?but finding them once they went into hiding would be difficult.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No rushing this. Compared to Team Rainbow Rocket, Dylan was more concerned about this world's Necrozma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he could capture Necrozma, then with both Dawn Wings and Dusk Mane forms, he'd be set.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
