"Trick Room!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kieran shouted decisively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Porygon-Z raised its head, and a spatial cube began spinning and forming in front of it\u8212?Trick Room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
