"Hydrapple, charge!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kieran gave the command without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trick Room had a time limit\u8212?he had to defeat Weavile before it ended.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydrapple hissed as it dragged its apple forward at surprising speed under the effects of Trick Room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Pulse!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydrapple opened its mouth wide, and several smaller "apple worms" emerged, charging up energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon-type Dragon Pulse! When multiple heads fired together, the beam's power doubled!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Several pulses merged into one thick laser that shot toward Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile leapt backward to dodge, but under Trick Room, its normally agile body now felt sluggish and heavy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The powerful Dragon Pulse struck Weavile's previous position, exploding violently, and the shockwave still hit Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile grunted, forced into another retreat\u8212?but as it looked up again, Hydrapple was already right in front of it!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Icicle Crash!" Dylan raised an eyebrow at the sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile slashed its right claw, summoning giant icicles from the air and launching them at Hydrapple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pollen Puff!" Kieran countered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydrapple roared and fired a green energy sphere toward Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bug-type Pollen Puff!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The icicles slammed into Hydrapple, making it cry out in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But at the same time, Pollen Puff hit Weavile squarely, exploding and sending it flying\u8212?Bug-type moves were super effective against Weavile, and the damage was high.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tera Burst!" Kieran ordered a follow-up strike.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Icicle Crash didn't counter a now Fighting-type Hydrapple, and with its solid defense, Hydrapple had taken the hit well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydrapple charged its mouth with Tera energy, forming a massive energy fist and fired it at Weavile\u8212?Fighting-type Tera Burst!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile couldn't take a 4x-effective Tera Burst. It would be a one-hit KO.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gritting its teeth, Weavile raised a protective shield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tera Burst smashed into the shield and exploded, but it didn't break through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Pulse!" Hydrapple surged forward again, gathering energy in its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was waiting for Protect to wear off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Quick Attack!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as Protect faded, Weavile bolted away, dodging Dragon Pulse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't rush."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kieran stayed calm. Even with Trick Room making Hydrapple faster, Weavile's Quick Attack still gave it great mobility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile suddenly appeared behind Hydrapple and slammed into it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tera Burst!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aerial Ace!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydrapple whipped around, energy building once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Weavile leapt up and spun around, cloaked in white wind energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flying-type Aerial Ace!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pow!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The strike hit Hydrapple's head, making it cry out. Flying was strong against Fighting\u8212?this hit was solid.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But a moment later, Tera Burst launched, smashing straight into Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weavile was blasted away by the exploding energy fist, crashing hard into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weavile is unable to battle. Hydrapple wins," Lan declared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well done, Kieran!" Carmine was thrilled for her brother.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A 4x-effective Tera Burst\u8212?there was no way Weavile could survive that. Tera Fighting was a brilliant move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nicely done. That Trick Room was clever."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan recalled Weavile and clapped for Kieran.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trick Room was a very niche move. Few used it, as it only altered speed for a short time and didn't directly raise power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But often, battles were lost simply due to lack of speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without Trick Room shifting the speed dynamic, Hydrapple would've had a hard time ever landing a hit on Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like Grimmsnarl earlier\u8212?beaten by Weavile's speed and agility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kieran, you've really grown strong."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pulled out a crimson Luxury Ball, genuinely impressed\u8212?not just by Kieran's strength, but by his tactical mind. Coming up with Trick Room to counter Weavile mid-battle showed sharp awareness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then next up, just as we promised."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Luxury Ball in his hand expanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kieran, are you ready?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, Mr. Dylan!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kieran's eyes glowed with excitement, though he kept his emotions in check and responded solemnly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That long-passed-down "ghost"!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Very good, then\u8230?" Dylan chuckled softly and threw out his fifth Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ogerpon! Prepare for battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
