\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Indigo Plateau.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After being "missing" for several days, Lance finally returned\u8212?and the Kanto League's high council convened immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside the conference room, Chairman Goodshow sat at the head. On his left were the League's councilors; on the right sat the Kanto Elite Four, led by Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
