The barking wouldn't stop. It was starting to annoy him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His icy stare immediately silenced the bickering councilors. An eerie quiet fell over the room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were bold enough to attack him behind words\u8212?but not brave enough to face him directly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because he was Lance\u8212?the Dragon Master!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go on. Keep talking."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance stood slowly, his blood-red hair casting a shadow over his eyes. His entire presence radiated danger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lance\u8230?" Goodshow's voice trembled slightly, trying to interject.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Lance raised a hand to stop him. His boots echoed against the floor as he walked forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I joined the League because I believed we could make the world better. There should be no place for sin or evil in a pure world."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes. This world should be clean. Pok\u233?mon, nature\u8212?they all deserve better.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then why\u8230? why are there always disgusting things\u8212?why do they always fester and rot everything they touch?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance's expression twisted, the sharp lines of his face warping into rage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The room remained silent. Even the councilors sensed something was terribly wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance's expression was terrifying\u8212?too terrifying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We've always tried to fight it\u8230?" Goodshow sighed wearily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But they never go away. The filthy maggots, the stench-ridden scum\u8212?they're right here!" Lance's eyes swept over the councilors.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had always known some of them were rotten. The evidence he had reviewed made that clear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some had even conspired with Team Rocket.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Evil is evil. Even dressed in human skin, their disgusting stench can't be hidden."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Murderous intent radiated from him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow's pupils contracted. Lance\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But now I know how to purge this rot once and for all. Chairman\u8212?watch carefully."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance's shadowed eyes gleamed with fury.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Behind him, a powerful Dragonite emerged. Its eyes mirrored Lance's own\u8212?dark, cold, dangerous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A heavy, suffocating pressure filled the room\u8212?Dragonite's aura.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The councilors stared in horror at Lance and Dragonite. What was he about to do?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Starting today, I, Lance the Dragon Master, resign from the Kanto League. I'll punish the darkness in my own way."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance's voice was devoid of emotion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The League might strive toward light, but it was no longer a place for him. To Lance, it had become a shackle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow shut his eyes in sorrow. So it had come to this, after all. Despite all his efforts\u8212?he couldn't stop it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Agatha kept her eyes closed. Lorelei crossed her arms and smirked coldly at the councilors' pale faces.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Bruno, he simply lowered his head in silence, detached as always.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lance\u8230? is there truly no room for compromise?" Goodshow still tried to reach him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The League has changed," Lance said calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But before I go, let me do one last thing for it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His cold eyes swept over the councilors\u8212?rats in human skin. This world didn't need such filth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll make this world clear and blue again!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
(End of Chapter)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
