Like Lance, Giovanni had long reached the upper limits of Champion-tier. Over the years, he had cultivated many core Ground-types.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was what true depth looked like.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maybe Red and Blue could catch up to his first-string team within a year\u8212?but not his full roster. Not yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni and Red began their battle. Unsurprisingly, Red also lost.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue looked sour. Red had lasted slightly longer and had done more damage\u8212?his performance against Giovanni's fourth Pok\u233?mon was better than Blue's against Dugtrio.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That just made Blue more annoyed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So Giovanni's the head of the Elite Four," Goodshow said cheerfully. "What about second and third?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch\u8230? I'll take it back next year," Blue grumbled. He admitted defeat, but only for now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for second and third\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
