Giovanni's was dramatic: hands in his pockets, back half-turned to the camera, half his face hidden in shadow with a sly, malicious smile. His partner Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Persian.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes, his beloved Persian\u8212?still one of his favorites.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
