321: Chapter 321: I Promise You\u8217?re Gonna Love This\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I stand with the League!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bruno declared solemnly, wearing a serious expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
