Bruno pulled out two badges from his pocket\u8212?Dylan recognized them at a glance. The Boulder Badge from Pewter and the Cascade Badge from Cerulean.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He nodded. The eight original Kanto Gyms were historically significant, the first established when the League was formed. Their original badges were made from high-energy materials.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the manga, Team Rocket had used badge energy to fuse the three Legendary Birds. The Elite Four used Cerise Island itself as an amplifier to summon and control legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
