His beliefs were simple: battle!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bruno believed that both humans and Pok\u233?mon grow through the trials of combat. He'd spent his life training in the mountains, growing alongside his Fighting-types through endless sparring and hardship.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To never stop moving forward. To always pursue greater heights. To never be complacent. That was Bruno.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
