Hitmonchan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beep~ Hitmonchan, Fighting-type, the Punching Pok\u233?mon.Ability: Iron FistMoves: Focus Punch, Close Combat, Fire Punch, Ice Punch, Thunder Punch, Bullet Punch, Detect\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
