"Excellent. Leon is thrilled about the match\u8212?he's already preparing."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose then handed Dylan a box.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Inside are three Dynamax Bands. While you can't use Dynamax in other regions, here in Galar, at power spots, you'll be able to experience it fully."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
