"You're welcome. I, for one, can't wait to see your battle with Leon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose knew Leon well. Even when faced with the likes of Lance\u8212?who was considered 'invincible'\u8212?he wouldn't be outclassed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Dylan? Younger, but rumored to command Legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Legendaries weren't invincible. Rose had faith in Leon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if Leon did lose? That would only confirm Dylan's strength and reassure Rose that the Champion of Kanto was truly worthy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I look forward to seeing Leon's power firsthand," Dylan replied. "I'll treat this match seriously."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, this wasn't just any battle\u8212?it was {\b
Kanto vs. Galar}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
