"Another Paradox Pok\u233?mon, huh? But it doesn't matter\u8212?this is Urshifu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard grinned wide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even against a Fairy-type\u8212?Urshifu was king!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Urshifu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recalled his partner. His Dynamax Band flashed crimson.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scarlet energy surged into the Pok\u233? Ball. It grew massive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One\u8230? two\u8230? three!The ball pulsed, and Mustard hurled it into the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wushiiiii!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark clouds swirled as Urshifu emerged, now towering in Gigantamax form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crimson stripes streaked its body. Its face was twisted in a furious roar. Blood-red head-fur flared, three scarlet clouds circling its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gigantamax Urshifu \u8212? Single Strike Style!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Beep~ Urshifu (Gigantamax, Single Strike Style). Fighting/Dark-type.Ability: Unseen Fist.Info: Said to be the embodiment of fury. Its terrifying roar and appearance are believed to drive away evil from the world.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked absolutely terrifying\u8212?but the Dex called it a holy protector?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf squinted up at the colossus. Sure {\i
looked} like it would punch God.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A divine avatar, banishing evil with righteous fury\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan was impressed. The longer he looked, the more he liked it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then I'll Gigantamax too."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recalled Iron Valiant. His own Dynamax Band pulsed with light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One\u8230? two\u8230? three!Iron Valiant grew, rising to match Urshifu's towering form. Three red clouds circled its waist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A Gigantamax battle!"Leaf's eyes sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Last time, Dylan's Necrozma had one-shot Leon's Gigantamax Charizard before it could fight back. She'd never seen an actual Gigantamax clash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes! This is a real showdown!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard was ecstatic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Urshifu, Max Mindstorm!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu couldn't rely on Fighting or Dark moves\u8212?Fairy-types resist both. Psychic was the play.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Max Starfall," Dylan said calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moonblast transformed into Max Starfall, summoning pink energy above Iron Valiant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, Urshifu roared, summoning rainbow energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!Pink stars crashed into Urshifu. Rainbow rings exploded around Iron Valiant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both hits landed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The field glowed purple\u8212?Psychic Terrain. Although Max Starfall would have created Misty Terrain, Max Mindstorm overrode it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But terrain aside, the damage was clear:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Again\u8212?Max Starfall."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan noted the immense impact the first hit had on Urshifu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was 4x weak to Fairy. And while its physical defense was solid, its special defense was not.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant launched another pink star.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Max Guard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard panicked. One more hit might knock Urshifu out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A shimmering wall blocked the star, nullifying the damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Third Max Starfall," Dylan said smoothly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You shameless brat\u8212?three in a row?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard winced. If he tried Max Guard again, it might fail\u8212?only a one-third chance to succeed after consecutive use.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had to risk an attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Max Ooze!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu raised its arms, poison erupting from the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!The third star struck true, slamming Urshifu hard. Poison geysers burst beneath Iron Valiant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Pok\u233?mon were hit\u8212?but Urshifu crumpled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The terrain shifted once more to Misty Terrain as Max Starfall's effects took hold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The clouds dispersed. Gigantamax ended.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant knelt, shrinking back. It was battered\u8212?but standing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu\u8230? wasn't.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Urshifu is unable to battle. Iron Valiant wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf waved her flag.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Technically, Mustard still had Kommo-o left. But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nope, nope. I forfeit."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard picked up his jacket and brushed off the dust, chuckling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, he looked a little defeated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three battles, all with Fighting-types. And Dylan hadn't used a {\i
single} actual Fighting-type move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
He really got me good\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf blinked, then nodded. No way Kommo-o, who was also 4x weak to Fairy, could turn the tide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Waves upon waves\u8230? you're incredible, Little Dandan. Loo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard came over with a big smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though not in his prime, Mustard considered himself still quite formidable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dylan had run circles around him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You flatter me, Sensei. I only had a type advantage."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bah! Don't be modest. I got wrecked."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Come. Let's talk inside. You lot\u8212?back to training!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He ushered Dylan and the others into the dojo's main hall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"To be honest," Mustard said, sipping tea, "one reason I built this dojo was to find a worthy Trainer for Urshifu's offspring."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He pulled out a Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I think you're the one. Take a look."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A burst of light revealed a cream-colored bear cub, standing tall with shut eyes. It launched into an energetic flurry of punches and kicks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the routine, it noticed Dylan and froze\u8212?then scurried behind Mustard to hide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pfft~ Shy little thing, huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf giggled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haha! Only around strangers. But this cub has incredible potential\u8212?even more than its parents."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard rubbed the little one's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Little cub, this is your new Trainer\u8212?Little Dandan. Be your best, alright?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cub peeked at Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello. I'm Dylan. Let's get along."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan knelt and extended a hand, radiating a soothing green aura from his Verdant Power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cub relaxed immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It marched up, posing confidently with one hand on its hip.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Good energy. Once you've grown strong, we'll come challenge Sensei again."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baaah!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Better train hard then, little guy!" Mustard laughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"By the way, Dylan\u8212?have you decided which form to evolve it into?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan fell into thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Single Strike or Rapid Strike, huh\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(Chapter End)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
