349: Chapter 349: Time to Challenge My Master!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Returning from Galar to the Kanto region happened the following day.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roses personally saw them off at the airport, fully fulfilling his role as host.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He truly was a master of etiquette\u8212?but unfortunately, Dylan had no intention of settling in another region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
