Without realizing it\u8230? she'd been pushed to the edge.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let me see your final strength, Selene."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled warmly, raising a hand in anticipation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, you will!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's eyes curved into crescents\u8212?her pure, confident smile returning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar! Let's do this!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She threw her last Pok\u233? Ball high. A burst of white light\u8212?and with a mighty roar, Incineroar landed on the field, arms wide and teeth bared at Sableye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's very first partner\u8212?her ace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's give it our all, buddy! We're not letting Big Bro Gym Leader look down on us!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene clutched her floral sun hat tightly, burning with fighting spirit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"ROAR!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar let out a deafening roar\u8212?its fierce presence filled the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Intimidate activated!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A ripple of white energy spread from Sableye's body\u8212?its Attack was reduced by one stage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So full of spirit," Dylan said with a chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In truth, Sableye was at a big disadvantage here.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its Prankster-boosted status moves were useless against Dark-types\u8212?like Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flatter!" Dylan still gave the command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even without Prankster's priority, the move could still be used.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fake Out!" Selene countered instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wouldn't deal damage to Sableye, but that wasn't the point\u8212?she just wanted the priority from Fake Out to get in close and avoid Flatter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye clapped its hands and cheered loudly, voice filled with exaggerated praise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Incineroar didn't flinch. It zipped across the field in a red blur\u8212?its Fake Out allowing it to instantly close the distance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a flash, Incineroar was behind Sableye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Taunt!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hands on its hips, Incineroar let out a savage roar straight into Sableye's face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ripple of Taunt surged forward\u8212?Sableye staggered, eyes narrowing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nice!" Selene grinned. That took care of Sableye's status moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Keep your distance. Use Power Gem!" Dylan decided not to brute force it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Incineroar was strong\u8212?his student's first Pok\u233?mon, her ace. Head-on wasn't wise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye jumped back\u8212?gemstones formed around it and launched forward in a barrage of glowing beams.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Darkest Lariat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar spun into a fiery tornado\u8212?arms out, spinning like a drill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rock blasts from Power Gem shattered against the spinning attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar closed in, then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The spinning blow slammed into Sableye, launching it across the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark-type: Darkest Lariat!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Being a Ghost-type, Sableye had no resistance to this hit\u8212?it landed hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye tumbled, then rose with a low growl\u8212?its jewel-like eyes glaring at Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar roared\u8212?its belt of flames ignited, spewing a stream of fire straight at Sableye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dodge!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye sidestepped\u8212?but Incineroar sprinted after it, fire still spewing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye leapt into the air to avoid the flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Throat Chop!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black energy surged around Incineroar's claws\u8212?it leapt up and struck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark-type: Throat Chop!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dodge it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye twisted midair\u8212?its body bent unnaturally. It managed to barely dodge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just barely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Power Gem!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Darkest Lariat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Pok\u233?mon clashed again\u8212?Sableye unleashed a burst of gem-light, while Incineroar spun up to intercept.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both moves hit\u8212?Incineroar winced from the hit, but its spinning arms crashed into Sableye again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sableye hit the ground hard. Its defenses were mediocre\u8212?two direct hits from Darkest Lariat had left it reeling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Power Gem had landed as well\u8212?and Rock beats Fire. Even with its modest Special Attack, Sableye had dealt a decent blow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finish it, Incineroar!" Selene's fist pumped skyward, her momentum peaking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taunt wouldn't last forever. Once it wore off, Sableye could stall with Pain Split or other tricks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene wasn't giving it that chance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blast Burn!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
ROAR!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar's entire body flared with intense red energy\u8212?it slammed its fists into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cracks spread across the arena\u8212?glowing crimson lines racing beneath Sableye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was like a volcanic eruption\u8212?Blast Burn burst from the ground, engulfing Sableye in a towering inferno.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Fire-type signature move, known only to Fire-type starters and Mew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire arena was bathed in red light\u8212?fans gasped as their eyes reflected the flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One second\u8230? Two\u8230? Three\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The inferno slowly faded. The ground was scorched black\u8212?Sableye lay at the center, knocked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not far away, Incineroar stood frozen\u8212?its body locked in place from Blast Burn's post-move recoil.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sableye is unable to battle. Incineroar wins."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wow! Selene's Incineroar is {\i
amazing!}" Yellow exclaimed, clapping her hands to her chest, eyes sparkling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Super strong! It totally dominated Sableye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course! That's the very first Pok\u233?mon Big Bro Gym Leader gave Selene\u8212?her absolute favorite," Asha said proudly, beaming with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She couldn't help it\u8212?Selene was her bestie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Big Sis is really strong," Silver nodded seriously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching the full battle so far, he had to admit Selene was powerful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking the title of Dylan's top student\u8230? might take longer than he thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?She's come a long way. Impressive."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan recalled his fainted Sableye, smiling at Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The tiger puffed its chest out proudly\u8212?glowing with satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite its fierce, savage look, this Incineroar and his own Incineroar were actually twin sisters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yep\u8212?{\i
two big scary girl cats.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
