{\qc
357: Chapter 357: Want to Try Challenging a Legend?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sending you out on a journey really was the right choice. Every step along the way has clearly settled into your eyes now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's voice was filled with admiration. After all, just half a year ago, this girl had barely even qualified as a Trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And now\u8212?she was standing on the battlefield opposite him, fighting with everything she had.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It felt surreal, but not unpleasant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Your Incineroar is impressive, Selene. As it happens, I recently obtained a new Dark-type Legendary Pok\u233?mon in Galar. Its strength is just about right to be your opponent. Want to give it a try?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan considered it. He had originally planned to send out Kingambit to counter Incineroar\u8212?but on second thought, this seemed like a much better choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course I want to!" Selene's eyes lit up, her voice bursting with excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Dark-type Legendary Pok\u233?mon?! How could she possibly turn that down?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, if her big bro Gym Leader said it was a good match for her Incineroar, she believed him. Dylan always ran his gym battles fairly\u8212?he never used Pok\u233?mon that far outclassed the challenger's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well\u8230? except for the Golden Legendary team. That was the one and only exception.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's eyes burned with anticipation. Challenging a Legendary\u8212?{\i
that} was the dream of every Trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She couldn't be more excited.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's my apprentice." Dylan smiled, clearly satisfied with her answer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoa\u8212?is she really about to battle one of Dylan's Legendaries?" the older girl in the stands exclaimed, fired up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Legendary Pok\u233?mon had long been one of Dylan's signature aces.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene's got guts," the bird tamer added with a whistle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Legendary or not, it's still a Pok\u233?mon," the psychic said flatly, unimpressed. "Strong, sure\u8212?but not invincible."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The title might be intimidating, but as a Trainer, when you're offered the chance to challenge a Legendary, how could you say no?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Dylan had made it clear: this one wasn't leagues above Selene in strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it were him down there, no way he'd pass it up either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Word is, Brandon's been challenged multiple times this year alone," the psychic added.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Brandon was known for having a team of legendary titans\u8212?widely known\u8212?and second only to Dylan in terms of fame among Legendary trainers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From what the psychic had heard, Brandon had even lost to a few challengers this year.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then let's begin..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pulled out a deep crimson Pok\u233? Ball and tossed it behind him with a flick.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Moltres, battle ready!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
SCREEEEE\u8212?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A strange, almost sinister cry rang out as a massive black-and-red bird spread its wings, flames rippling like ribbons from its feathers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What the\u8212?Moltres?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shock rippled through the crowd as they stared at the majestic figure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait. Was that really\u8230? Moltres?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The name didn't seem to fit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Moltres looked nothing like the fiery bird from the Kanto legends.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its entire body was cloaked in black plumage, a crimson belly glowing with eerie energy. Its red beak curved like a scythe, and its wings and tail shimmered with a fire-like aura that seemed more spectral than hot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The vibe was dark. Wicked. Wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't the Moltres they knew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Kanto Moltres was famous\u8212?even if most people hadn't seen it in person, the sacred flame it provided for the Indigo League torch relay was iconic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Images of Moltres were everywhere online\u8230? but this? This was an entirely different bird.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even calling it a shiny form felt off. It was clearly a different species altogether.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ding~ Moltres (Galarian Form). Dark/Flying-type. The Wicked Flame Pok\u233?mon.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ability: Berserk}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Moves: Brave Bird, Hurricane, Fiery Wrath, Air Slash, Sucker Punch, Payback...}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Description: Those who come into contact with the malevolent flame-like aura surrounding it will find their soul scorched to ash. (Galarian Form)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...Okay, but why is this thing still called 'Moltres' when it's not even a Fire-type?" Leaf grumbled, reading off the Rotomdex's data.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seriously. This was nonsense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just because it {\i
looked} like it was on fire didn't mean it was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it wasn't. It had no Fire-type moves other than, like, Sunny Day\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I don't know either, Rotom..." the Rotomdex flailed helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Galarian Moltres. Dark/Flying. Selene, let's see if you can take it down."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised a hand, smiling as he issued the challenge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't had this bird for long\u8212?just recently caught it in Galar. To be honest, he hadn't trained it up that much either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By his estimation, this Galarian Moltres was around the same level as Selene's Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a standard-tier Legendary\u8212?rare, sure, with superior stats, but not overwhelmingly overpowered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, sir!" Selene locked eyes on the ominous bird. Though it didn't look anything like the Moltres she expected, her fighting spirit blazed even hotter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was her first-ever battle against a Legendary Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar! Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene threw her arm forward with confidence, striking first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She wasn't sure why a Moltres didn't have Fire typing\u8212?but that just made things easier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark resisted Dark, but her Fire-type moves would hit for neutral damage. That was fine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar bellowed\u8212?its waist flames roared into a pillar, spewing a column of fire at Galarian Moltres.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fiery Wrath," Dylan said coolly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moltres raised its head and let out an eerie shriek\u8212?its wings flared open, black-and-red energy swirling ominously around it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fiery Wrath\u8212?a Dark-type special move, exclusive to Galarian Moltres.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It surged forward, colliding mid-air with Flamethrower in a swirling clash of black flames and red-orange fire.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The clash didn't last long\u8212?Fiery Wrath overwhelmed Flamethrower and pushed through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar!" Selene's eyes narrowed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sensing the danger, Incineroar cut off its flames and dove aside just in time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!Fiery Wrath crashed where it had just stood\u8212?flames erupted violently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Strong Special Attack. We can't outblast it with ranged moves."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene instantly reassessed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Moltres was clearly a special attacker\u8212?trading firepower with it was a losing battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Worse, it was flying. Incineroar had no way to reach it unless it came down on its own.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless Moltres decided to get close\u8212?how could she fight it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flame Charge!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene quickly found her solution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar roared and charged, flames licking at its fur\u8212?Flame Charge boosted its speed with every hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yup\u8212?this was the plan. Stack up speed, and even if she couldn't fly, she could outpace Moltres and strike when it landed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
All martial arts under heaven bow to speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sucker Punch."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled\u8212?he saw through her plan at once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Galarian Moltres's eyes flashed red\u8212?it dove like a shadow, striking before Flame Charge could finish.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
WHAM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sucker punch collided hard with Incineroar, staggering it and pushing it back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thunder Punch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene seized the opening.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar charged\u8212?lightning surging along its right paw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moltres beat its wings furiously, trying to rise\u8212?but Incineroar pushed through the wind, arm cocked back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!Thunder Punch struck home\u8212?right in Moltres's gut. Sparks flew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Electric beats Flying. The hit landed cleanly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hurricane!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fury sparked in Moltres's glowing blue eyes\u8212?it beat its wings, summoning a swirling cyclone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flying-type: Hurricane!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The wind roared\u8212?Incineroar was blasted into the air, howling in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not good!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's heart dropped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thunder Punch had hit, but Moltres countered way too fast. Its defense was no joke.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Brave Bird!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
SCREEE!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moltres soared upward\u8212?its body wreathed in a brilliant blue flame, forming the shape of a divine bird.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Brave Bird incoming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It locked onto the falling Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene reacted instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar raised a green barrier midair\u8212?barely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!Brave Bird collided with Protect\u8212?the barrier held, but Incineroar still plummeted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ancient Power!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the shield vanished, Moltres flared its wings\u8212?summoning glowing stones that crashed down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rock-type: Ancient Power!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM BOOM BOOM!Stones slammed down just as Incineroar hit the ground\u8212?dust exploded upward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar roared in pain\u8212?Rock was strong against Fire-types.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hurricane!" Dylan pressed on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moltres flapped again\u8212?another cyclone barreled down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Explosive Blaze!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
ROAR!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar's furious bellow echoed\u8212?flames surged skyward in a massive eruption.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attack intercepted the oncoming Hurricane\u8212?Moltres couldn't dodge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It squawked in pain, retreating as the flames licked at its feathers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8212?the blowback only seemed to fuel its rage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Galarian Moltres's Berserk ability triggered\u8212?its Special Attack rose sharply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The storm couldn't break through the flames\u8212?Moltres couldn't follow up for now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But that was fine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan watched as the fire cleared, the glowing red aura intensifying around his Legendary bird.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This one had a real temper.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder its Ability was {\i
Berserk}, and its signature move was {\i
Fiery Wrath}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recalled\u8212?when he brought this Moltres home, it clashed constantly with the Kanto Moltres.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Totally different personalities.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Galarian Moltres looked down on Kantonian Moltres for being weak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kanto Moltres dismissed Galarian Moltres as some weird mutant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had to separate them constantly to keep them from fighting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Come to think of it\u8230? Zapdos and Articuno had the same issues.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
