358: Chapter 358: For the Sake of the League!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though the explosive blaze had temporarily forced Galarian Moltres back and disrupted its Hurricane, it ultimately didn't do much to change the outcome.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ancient Power."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan gave the next command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Galarian Moltres flapped its wings, glowing boulders formed around it and began to rain down on the Incineroar below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still stunned from the recoil of its own Blast Burn, Incineroar couldn't dodge\u8212?its eyes widened as the rocks crashed down and buried it with a pained roar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A bright white glow rippled over Moltres's body\u8212?Ancient Power's secondary effect activated, boosting its Attack, Defense, Special Attack, Special Defense, and Speed, all by one stage!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch..." Selene clicked her tongue. This fight was already difficult, and now Moltres had gotten buffed? Great.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under Dylan's calm orders, another Ancient Power followed, and Incineroar was buried again. When the dust settled, it was unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar is unable to battle. Galarian Moltres wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Challenger Selene's six Pok\u233?mon are all unable to battle. The Rota Gym challenge ends in failure."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
