It was over. Incineroar had been Selene's last Pok\u233?mon. Its defeat meant the battle\u8212?and the challenge\u8212?was lost.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aww, what a shame."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene didn't look too upset though\u8212?after all, defeating her teacher wasn't going to be easy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, she'd dared to hope.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If she'd actually won, she'd have been the first ever to earn a Rota Badge by beating Dylan in battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the audience buzzed, Dylan stepped forward to meet her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You've grown a lot stronger. You didn't let me down."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the hopeful sparkle in her eyes, Dylan didn't hold back his praise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~" Selene beamed, squinting with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Keep it up. Next year, maybe go for the Kanto Champion title."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
