If it was Dylan, fine\u8212?but the new Elite Four?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Ground-type Gym Leader named Giovanni, and three barely-grown kids?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Them? Beat him?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ridiculous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
