"\u8230?Klinklang, I'll need you again."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After some thought, N sent out his steel companion once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least Arbok didn't have Corrosion, so Klinklang couldn't be poisoned easily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, back to Klinklang?" Dylan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But N, my Arbok's no slouch either."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My friend is strong as well," N replied calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You think your Arbok's strong? My Klinklang isn't weak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
