Steel-type move: Shift Gear!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Move in close."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok lowered its upper body and slithered forward at high speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Within moments, Klinklang's gears locked into place, glowing brightly\u8212?Shift Gear successful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Klinklang's Attack rose by one stage; its Speed by two.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
