N was playing it safe. He didn't want Arbok getting close.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Klinklang floated back and launched its twin gears at Arbok.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steel-type: Gear Grind!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shadow Sneak!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok's eyes gleamed black for an instant. Its speed surged as it vanished from sight and reappeared behind Klinklang in a flash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"N!" N's eyes widened in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Too fast!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with Speed boosts, Klinklang hadn't seen that coming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok had deliberately moved slowly before\u8212?just to create a false sense of safety.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That devious snake!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok lashed out, its tail wreathed in shadowy energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wham!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
