Despite its high Defense, Klinklang staggered from the force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Fang!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok wasn't done. It dropped from above, fangs glowing with fire.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
