Klinklang grit through the pain and launched another gear\u8212?but Arbok moved too quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CRUNCH!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attack glanced off Arbok's belly, but it didn't stop the cobra.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Fire Fang sank into Klinklang, fire erupting on impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The gear Pok\u233?mon let out a mechanical screech\u8212?it was in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok bit down and slammed it into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
