Even without our "big brother," I'll beat you down!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black Dragon: {\i
And what do YOU have besides shiny feathers?!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom was practically vibrating with fury. That smug white fluffball thought it could beat {\i
him}?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
