Zekrom tried to rise, lifting slightly to evade, but Reshiram's timing had been too perfect. The attack landed\u8212?BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom let out a grunt, blasted back, having barely escaped a full hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the damage was significant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That damn white snake\u8230? it ambushed me!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
