Zekrom's Dragon Claw struck Reshiram, causing it to cry out. But behind those cold sapphire eyes, there was no pain\u8212?only satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because the spell was complete.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom's Dragon-type moves were now sealed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?You've gotta be kidding."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
