And then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The third wave of Toxic hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom shuddered as purple venom blazed across its body, stronger than ever before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This one hurt. Bad.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder and Iris both grimaced. The black dragon was really suffering now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Pulse."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another wave. Another shot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom tried to dodge but couldn't\u8212?his movements were sluggish.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The blast hit. Zekrom roared in pain\u8212?his massive body crashing to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luckily, he didn't trigger Toxic Spikes\u8212?probably because his earlier Discharge had blown the whole battlefield to bits.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram hovered overhead, eyes glinting with smug superiority.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wuu~ (Heehee~ Black Dragon! What are you gonna do against me?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She circled above him proudly, victorious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom clenched his jaws\u8212?utterly humiliated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Zekrom! Fusion Bolt!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N realized this couldn't continue. They had to close the gap.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom's turbine roared to life, blue lightning wrapping his body like armor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The black dragon shot forward with dazzling speed\u8212?his trump card engaged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if Fusion Bolt wasn't very effective, it could still break through Reshiram's spam from up close.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
