{\qc
388: Chapter 388: This Isn\u8217?t a Pok\u233?mon Battle!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like her Hawlucha, which had been paralyzed by Thunder Wave, Diantha herself felt stunned\u8212?paralyzed in a different way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her mind was spinning. No, this wasn't right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was absolutely not what she imagined a Pok\u233?mon battle would be like. And\u8230? was this even Fairy-type?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dylan didn't care what Diantha was thinking. Now that Hawlucha was paralyzed, it was the perfect moment to go on the offensive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dazzling Gleam."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan gave the order with a calm smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Klefki shimmered with a beautiful pink light, and beams of energy shot toward Hawlucha.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hawlucha!" Diantha snapped out of it with a gasp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Hawlucha couldn't dodge\u8212?though the paralysis was beginning to wear off, it was still sluggish and unresponsive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had no way to evade the incoming move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dazzling Gleam hit Hawlucha dead-on, and it let out a pained cry as it slammed into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
