But this shiny Gardevoir?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was raw, undeniable power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And what Diantha couldn't accept\u8212?what hurt\u8212?was that Dylan's Gardevoir\u8230? was simply better than hers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
