Reshiram's psychic voice trembled with rare gravity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That thing? Dylan blinked, but soon he understood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Waaaah! It's really you, Reshiram!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A childish voice rang out, full of joy. It reached both Dylan and Reshiram's ears.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Reshiram's expression darkened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A small, pink-and-gray Pok\u233?mon floated toward them, eyes sparkling as it zoomed toward Reshiram.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't you come any closer!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flames flared violently around Reshiram as it glared at the little Pok\u233?mon, radiating extreme caution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hoopa Confined."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's eyes lit up in recognition.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was none other than the mythical mischief-maker, Hoopa in Confined Form!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa skidded to a stop mid-air, barely avoiding Reshiram's flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why, Reshiram? You're so mean! I thought we were old friends\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa pouted, looking genuinely hurt. It had sensed Reshiram's presence and rushed over to say hello\u8212?only to be met with this hostility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram stared, utterly baffled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That aura\u8212?it was Hoopa, no doubt. It could never forget the deep, malicious energy of a hundred years ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked and felt entirely different.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The once terrifying force of nature now seemed\u8230? harmless. Like it could be roasted with one breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In just a century, how had it changed so much?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well\u8230? whatever. Reshiram didn't care.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm not your friend. I don't know you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a huff, it vanished into its Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had nothing more to say to this lunatic. Even if Hoopa now seemed innocent, Reshiram wanted no part of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?That's so mean," Hoopa muttered, eyes misty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Seems like Reshiram doesn't think too highly of you, Hoopa."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pocketed the Pok\u233? Ball, smiling faintly at the miserable little Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't an act. Hoopa's childlike sorrow was completely genuine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, this was no longer the fearsome Djinn of legend. With its powers sealed, Hoopa's nature had regressed\u8212?it truly acted like a little kid.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know me?" Hoopa blinked, then quickly lit up. "Wow! You caught Reshiram? So cool\u8212?wait\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It floated closer, circling Dylan curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, it sniffed the air\u8212?nose twitching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoa!! Kyurem, Rayquaza, Calyrex\u8230? even Mew?! Who ARE you?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa was stunned. It recognized those scents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It knew these legends.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You've got quite the nose."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised a brow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ I used to play with them all the time. Hoopa was super strong back then!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa giggled proudly, striking a heroic pose.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The girls watched with interest. Hoopa's strange appearance had already caught their attention.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its body was mostly gray with pink accents, a pink tuft on its head, curved golden horns with rings, no legs, and a tail-like wisp below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
"Beep~ Hoopa (Confined Form), Psychic/Ghost-type. The Mischief Pok\u233?mon.}{\i
Ability: Magician.}{\i
Moves: Hyperspace Hole, Psychic, Trick, Shadow Ball, Trick Room, Phantom Force...}{\i
Description: A troublemaker who uses its rings to toss everything far away by warping space."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom's Pok\u233?dex entry popped up cheerfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eh? I'm in there? Where'd you get that?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa flew up to the Pok\u233?dex, puzzled. Ever since its powers were sealed, it had stayed in the Valley of Creation, rarely appearing publicly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It didn't expect to be cataloged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And honestly\u8230? sure, it remembered those moves\u8212?but in this form, it wasn't even sure it could beat a Pikachu anymore\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In short, Hoopa was a mythical Pok\u233?mon in name only. In practice? Completely useless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
All it had left was its ability to float and use its signature rings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan gave me all that info~" Rotom chirped proudly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hoopa, what are you doing here?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan sidestepped the question. Ever since its rampage a century ago, Hoopa had lived in the Valley of Creation under the care of Ghris.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After Ghris passed away, his successors\u8212?Meray and Baraz\u8212?had become Hoopa's guardians.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were like family to one another, and Hoopa held deep affection for them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, I came here with Meray! We were out shopping for supplies. Oh no\u8212?Meray!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa froze, realizing it had gotten distracted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Uh-oh!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
(End of Chapter)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
