394: Chapter 394: Can You Summon Yveltal?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa suddenly remembered Meray and nervously bit its finger, trying to think.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
