And yes\u8212?it wasn't telepathy. Hoopa actually spoke human language.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's Dylan, Hoopa. I know who you are," Dylan corrected gently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh? Mr. Dylan, you know Hoopa?" Meray looked surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had brought Hoopa with her on many trips into Desert City, but no one had ever recognized it before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
