Even though Ash had shared many adventures with Hoopa in the movie, it was clear that Meray and Baraz were the ones Hoopa loved most. That was why, when it used its most treasured memories to touch the heart of its dark self, they were all moments shared with Meray and her brother.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Knowing that bond, Meray and Baraz had wanted to return Hoopa's sealed power\u8212?but no one expected that sealed power to form its own consciousness and resentment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
