Once seated, Dylan pulled out some donuts, which Hoopa took happily. With its big eyes squinting in joy, it nibbled contentedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hoopa is so cute~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Lillie and Leaf sparkled with joy. The mischievous little guy was just too adorable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ Hoopa is also super strong!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa proudly placed its hands on its hips, grinning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Really? So how do you compare to Reshiram?" Leaf asked slyly, tilting her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Reshiram? Not a match! Hoopa could beat three of it at once!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
