"Of course."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yay! Meray is the best!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa twirled happily in the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled at the heartwarming scene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After chatting a bit more, the group went their separate ways.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan had come to Desert City specifically to learn more about the Valley of Creation and find Hoopa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't expected to meet it so soon, let alone with Meray. It was a pleasant surprise\u8212?but not the right time yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After checking into a hotel and dropping off their luggage, Dylan and the others set out to explore the exotic desert city.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But they hadn't gone far when Hoopa drifted lazily toward them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dy-lan~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
