Hoopa looked troubled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its rings still worked, just not as well. The forceful summoning could anger the legendaries\u8212?and nowadays, Hoopa didn't have the strength to handle their wrath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
