"As long as we secure Yveltal\u8230? this world can finally become truly beautiful."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lysandre turned his eyes back toward the tank. His gaze burned as he looked at the little green swirl of a Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Zygarde's Core.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
