396: Chapter 396: What Should Be Done?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lysandre had made up his mind to capture Yveltal, and he didn't hesitate\u8212?he was a man of decisive action.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
