The massive black silhouette slowly rose again\u8212?Unbound Hoopa hovered into the air, a suffocating aura emanating from its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Its eyes\u8230?" Ilene noticed first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its formerly normal eyes were now glowing blood-red, full of seething hatred and malice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shnk! Shnk!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
