"Disappear! All of you\u8212?DISAPPEAR!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unbound Hoopa's voice rumbled with fury, shouting at\u8230? something unseen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark energy crackled in front of the hole in its chest\u8212?Dark Pulse!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baraz! Call it back!" Dylan shouted to the dazed man.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Right!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Baraz snapped out of it and raised the Prison Bottle, chanting an incantation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The bottle glowed mysteriously. Hoopa stiffened in midair, glaring down with its glowing red eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pressure was chilling\u8212?but Baraz's concern for Hoopa outweighed his fear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The dark energy began to surge out of Hoopa's body again\u8212?flowing back into the bottle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
