Hoopa bit its lip, clearly still shaken.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Brother!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meray cried out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan turned\u8212?and saw Baraz trembling violently, still holding the bottle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, everyone sensed something wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
