399: Chapter 399: I\u8217?m the Real One!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gyarados roared with its gaping maw, a violent aura radiating from its massive form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Lysandre's ace Pok\u233?mon, it was indeed formidable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dylan was genuinely a little surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
