"Man, this guy's got guts," Leaf said, pulling out her camera from her spatial backpack. "Challenging Dylan with just a Mega Gyarados? Gotta send this to Archer and the others."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She genuinely thought Lysandre's courage deserved admiration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That's what evil organizations needed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No guts, no glory!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ding~ Gyarados (Mega Evolution), Water/Dark-type, Atrocious Pok\u233?mon}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ability: Mold Breaker}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Signature Moves: Hyper Beam, Outrage, Aqua Tail, Dragon Dance, Crunch, Waterfall...}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Description: Though it has an instinct to destroy everything, it will obey the Trainer it truly trusts. (Mega Evolution)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A solid powerhouse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie listened as the Rotom Dex recited its data, scanning the massive beast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8230? it didn't seem quite as scary as Wallace's Gyarados?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He doesn't seem to know much about Dylan, huh?" Ilene tilted her head, puzzled by Lysandre's composed demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Otherwise, how else could he be standing there like that?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Come, Champion Dylan. Let me see just how strong the one who defeated Ms. Diantha really is."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lysandre was full of fighting spirit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't felt any pressure from that little green guy Dylan sent out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was being underestimated, clearly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But that was fine\u8212?let Dylan let his guard down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once Zygarde beat Yveltal and joined him, the power dynamic would shift. For now, he'd humor the Champion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
