Xerneas indeed wore a puzzled look. If memory served, Rayquaza were supposed to be green.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Rayquaza occasionally appeared in Kalos, and Xerneas had seen them before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That black Rayquaza was clearly a shiny, no doubt about that. But the red one\u8230? Alright, let's call it a mutation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now, as the battle went on, green scales were starting to show beneath the red?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Xerneas was utterly confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Little Rayquaza hadn't yet noticed how much of its "paint" had chipped off. It remained fixated below, watching nervously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That combo just now had dealt serious damage, but it probably still wasn't enough to completely take down Black Rayquaza.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rayquaza!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough, a furious roar soon pierced the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black Rayquaza soared upward, glimmering with white light\u8212?Extreme Speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It barreled into Little Rayquaza, sending it flying with a pained grunt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At high altitude, Black Rayquaza opened its jaws wide. Pure dragon energy surged, forming a massive sphere that glowed like a miniature cosmos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Draco Meteor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blizzard!" Dylan commanded as he spotted the attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Draco Meteor rose to its apex like a dazzling firework, then exploded. Dozens of meteor-like energy bursts began falling like shooting stars.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shiny Mewtwo stretched out its arms and unleashed a howling Blizzard of ice and snow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black Rayquaza had just launched its Draco Meteor and couldn't defend in time\u8212?it immediately pulled back, trying to evade.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eternabeam!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan wasn't about to let it get away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eternatus's massive body reared up, six crimson points lighting up on its claws.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A heavy, oppressive aura blanketed the battlefield. Black Rayquaza looked up at the six glowing lights, its eyes narrowing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with its mind under control, it could feel the dread emanating from above.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Draco Meteor's glowing comets rained down at blistering speed. Little Rayquaza dodged out of the impact zone first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Shiny Mewtwo had just cast Blizzard and couldn't escape in time. It threw up a Barrier, bracing for impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM! BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One after another, the comets struck. The Barrier trembled under the blows. It wasn't perfect defense\u8212?especially not against a full-power Draco Meteor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the third hit, Mewtwo's Barrier cracked and shattered. The next comet struck its body directly, blasting it away in a smoking arc.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, Eternatus finished charging.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Six crimson death rays descended\u8212?Eternabeam, its strongest move!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Time seemed to freeze. Black Rayquaza could see only those six blinding red lights.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It threw up a Protect shield as the beams closed in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOOOOOM!!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The world was swallowed in crimson light. Winds howled like demons. No one could even keep their eyes open.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black Rayquaza's green barrier was utterly engulfed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One second. Two. Three. Four\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Five full seconds later, Eternabeam's residual glow still lingered, but Rayquaza's Protect had begun to fracture.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The shield finally gave out. Rayquaza tried to summon a Dragon Ascent, but too late.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The beams tore into its body directly, and pain surged through every nerve.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CRAAASH!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The impact drove Rayquaza back to the ground, and the earth shuddered like an earthquake had struck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A deafening shockwave followed as Eternabeam detonated across the desert floor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoa!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even from far away, the overwhelming red light stunned Leaf and the others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That Eternabeam\u8230? it's way stronger than the one in Galar," Lillie said, stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in Hammerlocke, Eternatus had also used Eternabeam, and it was impressive. But this\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That one might as well have been a bigger Dynamax Cannon in comparison.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well yeah, Dylan's trained it since then," Leaf added, tongue clicking. "Still, the power gap is nuts."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rayquaza's probably done for," Ilene murmured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Eternabeam was Dragon-type\u8212?and Rayquaza had taken the full blast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if it wasn't knocked out, it had to be critically wounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seconds ticked by. As the glow faded, the battlefield revealed a massive crater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the bottom, Black Rayquaza lay bruised and battered, breathing heavily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The red in its eyes was all but gone. It hadn't fainted\u8230? but couldn't even lift its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It tried, trembling\u8212?then gave up, letting its head drop again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its injuries were far too severe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Mom."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Little Rayquaza's voice was soft. Seeing its mother like this\u8212?heartsick didn't begin to cover it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let her rest for now," Dylan said gently. "Once Hoopa is defeated, she should return to normal."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He turned his eyes back to the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dawn Wings Necrozma had taken out Dialga\u8212?now lying beside its twin, Palkia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stellar Terapagos had defeated Primal Kyogre, who could no longer fight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black Kyurem had just dealt a finishing blow to Complete Zygarde\u8212?too injured now to keep going.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That left only Origin Giratina and Unbound Hoopa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced at Calyrex, who had taken noticeable damage by now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rayquaza, Mewtwo\u8212?go help Calyrex."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He ordered Little Rayquaza and Shiny Mewtwo to assist against Giratina.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Shadow Sneak technique was too troublesome. He didn't want to deal with it himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And besides, the time had come to end this chaotic, glorious battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ugh, fine\u8230?" Mewtwo groaned, glowing blue and soaring toward Giratina.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Little Rayquaza dragged its wings reluctantly\u8212?still aching from earlier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan rode Reshiram toward Unbound Hoopa, followed by his remaining legendaries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whew~ Dylan, you're the best!" Confined Hoopa cheered, floating beside him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course," Dylan chuckled, giving its cheek a playful squeeze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This battle? It had been amazing. He wouldn't forget it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Necrozma!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dusk Mane Necrozma crashed into Hoopa once more. Hyperspace Fury and Sunsteel Strike collided, sending both reeling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Necrozma had backup now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa\u8230? was out of options.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It glared toward its last "ally"\u8212?Origin Giratina\u8212?its face contorted in rage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You've lost, Hoopa. Don't you think so?" Dylan asked calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unbound Hoopa floated between its six golden rings, its crimson eyes cold and furious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I know you hate this child\u8212?but it wasn't its fault. Resentment won't help."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa's hatred for Confined Hoopa was understandable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been sealed in the bottle for over a hundred years, left in darkness and forgotten.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Confined Hoopa had never tried to reclaim its power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No, it had never even found the bottle\u8212?nor could it leave the Valley of Creation early on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Confined Hoopa looked down, conflicted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Disappear!! Disappear!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Unbound Hoopa didn't care. It shrieked in fury, its red eyes locked on Confined Hoopa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its favorite words had always been the same: "Disappear."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Golden rings spun outward, dark fists emerging.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hyperspace Fury!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stellar Cluster."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan simply shook his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Terapagos glowed at the crown, releasing a hail of star-shaped energy blasts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They clashed with Hoopa's incoming fists.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fists shattered several stars\u8212?but there were too many. The assault overwhelmed them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fists retreated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sunsteel Strike."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Necrozma blazed like a miniature sun and charged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa tried to counter, summoning a pulsing Dark Pulse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Necrozma tanked the hit and slammed directly into Hoopa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"AAARGH!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa shrieked, electricity crackling across its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Power Gem."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dawn Wings Necrozma unfurled its wings, launching radiant gem-like blasts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CRASH!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The impact drove Hoopa back, its massive body beginning to teeter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Strong as it was, it couldn't handle the combined onslaught of three heavyweights.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was the weakness of being ganged up on\u8212?no time to react, only to suffer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bug Buzz."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Terapagos shimmered green, emitting a piercing hum.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BZZZ\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Waves of sound crashed into Hoopa. Its pained groan echoed as it slammed into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bug-type Bug Buzz. Four-times effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a critical hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan\u8230? maybe we should stop\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Confined Hoopa tugged on Dylan's shirt, pleading for mercy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this rate\u8230? they might actually kill it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It still resented Hoopa, sure\u8212?but watching its other half suffer like this?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It hurt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
