After all, Dylan\u8212?riding on Reshiram\u8212?was just cheerfully watching the scene unfold without the slightest intent to intervene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Which could only mean he had his reasons.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
