422: Chapter 422: \u8220?You Didn\u8217?t Go This Hard Against Dylan!\u8221?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wyndon City, Galar Region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan and his group had returned here once again\u8212?but this time, not by plane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even by air, the journey from Hoenn to Galar took close to ten hours.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
