Leon wouldn't allow that to happen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had a duty\u8212?to be strong, and to make Galar stronger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then, we'll see how tomorrow goes."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
