The livestream comment section had turned into an all-out war.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Galar vs. Unova.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Other regions just sat back and devoured popcorn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the announcer called out their names, Iris and Leon entered the stadium and took their places.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon gave Iris a respectful nod\u8212?this was still a match between professionals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whatever the netizens were saying didn't matter. Reputation was earned on the battlefield, not online.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sigh\u8230? That girl\u8230? I told her not to rush in like this\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Up in the stands, Alder pressed a hand to his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beside him were N, Rosa, and Hilda\u8212?all there to cheer on Iris.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder had planned to take things slow in the tournament.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Iris?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She believed Champions should blaze trails\u8212?and so she boldly declared her challenge, eager to earn recognition for Unova.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know that's just how Iris is," N smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Besides, she's strong. Give her some credit."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he didn't use Reshiram, N wasn't even sure he could beat her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The problem is who she challenged," Alder said grimly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, but didn't Leon get swept by Dylan?" Mei blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah\u8230? because Dylan is Dylan," N added with a strange look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"His team was insane. I still don't understand how he put that lineup together."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Plus, Galar's really eager to reclaim their honor," N continued.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Leon needs to win cleanly this time."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
