High speed, high attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Rillaboom baited a move, tanked a hit, and countered with Focus Punch and another Acrobatics.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Archeops fainted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
