Leon Gigantamaxed Rillaboom to take it down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fifth: Lapras.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wounded, panting, but Rillaboom still held on\u8212?and defeated it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven, Dylan, and the others were stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was five knockouts. From one Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If she'd waited until year's end, Iris might've stood a better chance," Dylan said softly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not that he was surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Classic Leon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the anime, his Rillaboom one-shot four of Diantha's Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, Iris was facing a one-vs-five.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Leon really is strong," Geeta murmured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What blows my mind is that Dylan zeroed this Leon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
