His social media was flooded with photos and battle clips. Even though he got mocked for his ten consecutive losses to Leon, he never let it bother him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The guy had thick skin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yo~ Mr. Giovanni, looking forward to this!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan flashed a bright grin and waved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Outside of battle, he was friendly and easygoing\u8212?on the surface, at least.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Likewise," Giovanni replied coolly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They say you specialize in Ground-types, huh? Funny\u8212?I've got a little experience with those myself."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan's smile widened, flashing teeth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hope you're ready to go all-out. I'm kinda strong, you know?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He couldn't imagine losing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, Kanto's Elite Four were famous\u8212?but he wasn't worried.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd heard that even the third-ranked Kanto Elite Four member, Blue, had just crushed Wallace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But whatever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni used Ground-types. Raihan knew how to deal with those.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And besides\u8212?Ground-types would never beat Dragons.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I hope you take this seriously, Mr. Raihan. It'd be a shame to send you back to Galar looking like a fool."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni's tone was calm\u8230? but the confidence behind it? Ice-cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?" Raihan's eyes sparkled. "Interesting guy!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee stepped in to explain the match rules.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The scoreboard's arrow began to spin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now that's what I'm talkin' about!" Blue grinned. "That's the spirit Kanto's Elite Four should have!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No pushovers. No apologies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue was loving it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What, you thought anyone could compare to Kanto's crew?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Please.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Frankly, Blue thought Kanto deserved four slots in the Masters Eight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not five\u8212?Leaf didn't count.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, she was strong. But her heart wasn't in it. All she ever thought about was Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No big deal though.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan #1. Himself #2. Giovanni #3. Red could scrape by at #4.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was plenty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Let the world see Kanto's power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who do you think will win?" Wallace asked curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace and the others were currently in Kanto too. No scheduled matches for them today\u8212?and with the tournament in full swing, regional travel was frequent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Raihan's strong," Leon said cheerfully, arms folded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Naturally, he was rooting for his friend.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, Leon. What's the most Pok\u233?mon Raihan's ever knocked out in a battle against you?" Dylan asked casually.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan's power level was\u8230? hard to pin down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
According to his league card, "If Raihan went to another region, he'd be Champion."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No doubt\u8212?he was Champion-level.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Also from his card: "Though he's lost to Leon ten times, he's defeated more of Leon's Pok\u233?mon than any other Trainer."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure. But considering he challenged ten times, that stat didn't exactly impress.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The real question: how many of Leon's main team had he ever defeated?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uhh\u8230? best showing?" Leon thought for a moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe\u8230? two."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You held back, didn't you?" Dylan asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon didn't reply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But everyone knew the answer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When Leon wanted to enjoy a battle, he had to hold back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then let's see how many of Giovanni's team Raihan can take down," Dylan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Champion in another region?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sorry, buddy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every single member of Kanto's Elite Four could be a Champion\u8212?anywhere else.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
