He had hoped Raihan would at least match Giovanni's pace or hold out longer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now\u8230? even if Giovanni wasn't as strong as Leon, he was close.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or maybe they were equals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kanto really is full of talent, Chairman Goodshow."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose turned to the elderly Kanto chairman beside him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He couldn't help but feel a bit envious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kanto's Elite Four included all young prodigies besides Giovanni\u8212?and with Blue already beating Wallace, their strength was unquestionable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now Giovanni, the top among them, was showing his full might.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahaha, you're too kind!" Goodshow was beaming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This feels amazing!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Absolutely amazing!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
