He spoke modestly, referring to Dylan's disciples: Selene, Silver, and Yellow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow had figured it out\u8212?if Dylan accepts a student, they're a prodigy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
