She'd have to earn it herself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silver and Yellow weren't officially Trainers yet\u8212?they still needed to start their journeys.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He offered a polite, awkward smile. Even he wasn't sure what to say.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Giovanni's Great Tusk had already taken down Raihan's Flygon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose didn't need to watch anymore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Raihan could avoid a full team wipe, that would be a victory in itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni\u8230? was absolutely a "final boss" level opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In this entire tournament, only Leon might be able to go toe-to-toe with him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, by the way, Chairman Rose\u8212?Dylan mentioned something, and I'm unsure. What's your take?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow sipped his tea while enjoying his star Elite's performance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
