"Well, the original plan is: at the end of the year, the Masters Eight are set. Then they face off in a random bracket to decide the world's strongest."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rose nodded. That was indeed the current format.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But\u8230? isn't eight a bit too few?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
