But now that so many powerful Trainers were emerging across all regions\u8230? eight just felt tight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the competition would be brutal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow wanted to open the bracket. Dylan's idea, but Goodshow agreed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes. I think it could work," Rose smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More finalists meant more Galar representation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Galar had a lot of Champions\u8212?Leon, Gloria, Mustard, Raihan\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If more made it into the finals, Galar would shine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We'd have to divide the final bracket: a qualifying round for the Masters Eight, then a final showdown for World #1."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sounds great. Let's bring it up with the others after the match."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
