Mega Evolved Kangaskhan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Beep\u8212?Kangaskhan (Mega Evolution), Normal-type, Parent Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ability: Parental Bond\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moves: Outrage, Reversal, Fake Out, Sucker Punch, Fire Punch, Ice Punch\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
