Raihan could only watch as the two Kangaskhan\u8212?one big, one small\u8212?rushed Archaludon from both sides.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fists flying like a blur.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Block one? The other hit. Dodge one? The other landed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan was in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was 1v1?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
