425: Chapter 425: Steven, You\u8217?re the Lucky Guy\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Archaludon is unable to battle. Mega Kangaskhan wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
