With that announcement, the entire Indigo Plateau erupted into deafening cheers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Giovanni! Giovanni!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The chanting, so full of passion and reverence, swept through the arena like a wave. That's the power of the home crowd.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
