It only proved Steven's strategy wasn't wrong\u8230? but that Taunt was a problem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ice Beam!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven decided to test the waters anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Claydol's arms glowed as icy-blue energy condensed, launching twin freezing beams at Zapdos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
