445: Chapter 445: Because They\u8217?re Both Champions!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the gaze of countless spectators, Cynthia and Steven's battle finally began.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
