And then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aggron bellowed, a shockwave forcing Spiritomb back into its ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Was he waiting for this?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
