Still, Cynthia's expression tightened. Lucario facing Aggron was a lopsided matchup\u8212?Lucario's Fighting-type moves tore right through Aggron's armor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven recalled Aggron without hesitation and swapped in Claydol instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
