Still, her Porygon-Z was in fighting condition. She couldn't give up now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thunder!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia ordered. She needed to test Flutter Mane's power in its current state.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flutter Mane, Moonblast."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lightning split the air\u8212?while a glowing sphere of moonlight formed before Flutter Mane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attacks collided midair, shockwaves bursting across the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's eyes widened. Thunder should have overpowered Moonblast easily\u8212?yet the clash held even.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Worse, Moonblast gradually pushed Thunder back\u8212?until it shattered the lightning bolt entirely, surging toward Porygon-Z.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Porygon-Z dodged just in time, but Cynthia's heart sank.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Imprison."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's voice cut in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane's hair writhed as a glowing red "X" symbol appeared before it, sinking into its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's pupils contracted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Psychic-type move: Imprison.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Any move Flutter Mane knew, Porygon-Z could no longer use.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if Flutter Mane knew Electric moves\u8212?which it did\u8212?then Porygon-Z was left with nothing but Zap Cannon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One slow, unreliable shot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's mind raced, but Dylan's eyes told her he'd already guessed her next thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Porygon-Z, retu\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mean Look."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane's eyes gleamed with eerie darkness. Porygon-Z's shadow warped, locking it in place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The red recall beam from Cynthia's Pok\u233? Ball hit\u8212?but was swallowed by shadow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silence fell.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's chest rose and fell sharply, frustration roiling within.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
First Lucario, now Porygon-Z\u8212?blocked from retreat. How could he {\i
do this}?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So cruel\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Champion Dylan isn't even human. He even denies his opponent the right to switch out. Absolute monster."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If that were me on the field, I'd be crying by now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Imprison + Mean Look\u8230? what grudge does he have against her? This is torture!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What are you talking about? Dylan's actually being {\i
nice} this time! Clearly you've never challenged the Rota Gym!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both the stadium and livestream chat went wild. Making Cynthia fail to withdraw {\i
twice} in one match was outrageous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cynthia's patience is incredible."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace muttered in awe as he watched her silently endure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He prided himself on his composure, but in his own match against Dylan, he had nearly snapped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Cynthia? Blocked twice, yet her face barely twitched. Her mental fortitude was terrifying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace had to give her his respect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You won't be escaping so easily, Cynthia."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's voice was warm, his smile gentle\u8212?almost mocking in contrast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?" Cynthia pressed her lips tight, forcing her emotions down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Calm. Stay calm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But with most of Porygon-Z's arsenal sealed, there was nothing left it could do against Flutter Mane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially under Sunny Day, with Protosynthesis fueling its overwhelming Special Attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Porygon-Z is unable to battle. Flutter Mane wins."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee declared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia silently recalled it. Three of her Pok\u233?mon were gone now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Flutter Mane\u8212?how was she supposed to beat it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At last, she drew her next Pok\u233? Ball, tossing it high.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Take flight\u8212?Garchomp!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her ace had arrived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
(End of Chapter)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
