450: Chapter 451: Dylan\u8217?s Super Evolution!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Take to the skies! Garchomp!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
