For Cynthia's supporters, just seeing Garchomp take the field was enough to fill them with an indescribable sense of security.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was something none of her other main Pok\u233?mon could bring.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because Garchomp was strong. Very strong. Cynthia's ultimate trump card.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as Garchomp hadn't fallen, Cynthia had not lost. She had proven this countless times since the day she became Sinnoh Champion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
