{\i
Beep\u8212?Garchomp (Mega Evolution), Dragon/Ground type, Mach Pok\u233?mon.Ability: Sand Force.Signature Moves: Dragon Rush, Earthquake, Dig, Dragon Claw, Poison Jab\u8230?Description: More brutal than before Mega Evolution, it slices foes apart with its scythe-like arms. (Mega Evolution).}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So she went straight for Mega Evolution. But even Mega Garchomp doesn't have it easy against Flutter Mane, does it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How confident\u8212?choosing a battle where she's at a type disadvantage."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
