She really was confident, wasn't she?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane had Fairy typing\u8212?it was immune to Dragon-type moves. And Misty Terrain still lingered on the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Say hello to our opponent, Flutter Mane."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced up at the fading sunlight, then snapped his fingers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Moonblast."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane screeched, a sphere of moonlight gathering before it, then shot downward at incredible speed toward Mega Garchomp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moonblast\u8212?super effective against Mega Garchomp. And with its Protosynthesis boosting its Special Attack, if that attack landed, even Cynthia's Mega Garchomp would lose half its life in one strike.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But such a direct attack was easy to dodge. Still, Cynthia made no move to evade.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Poison Jab!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The blood-red scythe in Mega Garchomp's hand gleamed with deep violet light as it swung down on the Moonblast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The scythe cleaved into the energy sphere, violet venom clashing wildly with moonlight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Moonblast detonated, waves of energy exploding outward. Mega Garchomp staggered back under the shockwave\u8212?but not a single wound marred its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The raging dragon raised its head, its fierce gaze locking onto the airborne Flutter Mane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What terrifying brute force."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven couldn't help but sigh as he watched Mega Garchomp cleave through Flutter Mane's Moonblast with a non-STAB Poison Jab.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That same overwhelming strength was the very reason he had lost to Cynthia\u8212?the reason his Mega Metagross couldn't stand against her Mega Garchomp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not technique. Not strategy. Just raw power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Mega Garchomp's brute force was simply overwhelming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"True enough, but battles aren't just about raw power." Alder shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sunny Day's ended, Protosynthesis is gone, and Misty Terrain should fade soon too."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
