Mega Garchomp's evolution actually reduced its Speed. Of course, unlike in turn-based battles, those ten missing points weren't everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the fact remained\u8212?Mega Garchomp wasn't as agile as its base form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane's speed gave it the option to kite Mega Garchomp around the field, risky though it might be.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And there were Stealth Rocks on the battlefield. Flutter Mane hadn't triggered them yet only because it had barely moved since entering, mostly firing from a fixed position.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But in the time it took Dylan to think, Mega Garchomp had already lunged forward, leaping high beneath Flutter Mane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its twin scythes glowed with ghostly energy\u8212?Shadow Claw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dodge."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan had sorted his plan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane shifted effortlessly to the side, avoiding the direct strike without panic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garchomp!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia wasn't surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Garchomp halted instantly, twisting its right arm to sweep across in a vicious slash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane ducked low, avoiding again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a growl, Mega Garchomp slashed downward with its left scythe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flutter Mane floated backward, dodging once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roaring in frustration, Mega Garchomp refused to relent, lunging after its opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Icy Wind!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
