And Dylan's odd plays had tipped her off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As expected of you, Cynthia." Dylan chuckled, withdrawing Flutter Mane into its Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before disappearing, the ghost shot Mega Garchomp a resentful glare\u8212?as if it had been robbed of a kill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But also a pity."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan sighed softly, pulling out another Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You could've taken down one of my mainstays."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeed\u8212?had Destiny Bond worked, Cynthia would've scored that victory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now\u8230? that chance was gone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I haven't lost yet, Dylan." Cynthia's eyes sharpened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then face this one."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smiling faintly, Dylan tossed his fourth Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar! To the field!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Jie-jie~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A shadow fell, twisting into the shape of a grayish-black Gengar, grinning wickedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But before it could posture, the plump ghost yelped, clutching its short legs and blowing on its feet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Spikes\u8212?left by the Gastrodon earlier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Agatha's brow lifted slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
