With refined grace, Dylan clasped his Keystone, smiling elegantly at Cynthia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now then, Cynthia\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shall we have a delightful duel of Mega Evolutions?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
