Lorelei huffed coldly, visibly annoyed. She had been searching for a Laprasite or Dewgongite for ages, but without success.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Damn it\u8212?did her team really not have a single member capable of Mega Evolution?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
