On the battlefield\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Since it's Gengar\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia raised her arm with commanding force, her gaze fierce.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She took the initiative. Her Mega Garchomp was born to attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Claw!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Garchomp charged forward, its scythe-like crimson blades gleaming with blue light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The colossal land shark barreled toward Mega Gengar with overwhelming ferocity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shadow Ball!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
