Her right hand lifted high, the Pok\u233? Ball gleaming in the light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes\u8212?she was still Paldea's strongest Champion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Nemona and Juliana, as talented as they were, hadn't surpassed her yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Red, as one of Kanto's Elite Four\u8212?show me your strength and your talent!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let us have a battle worthy of legends!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a smooth motion, Geeta threw her Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My lead\u8212?Glimmora!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
White light flashed, and a cone-shaped Pok\u233?mon floated before her, unfurling like a crystalline flower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Glimmora, huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red's expression sharpened as he recognized the Rock- and Poison-type Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation, Red sent out his partner. The massive turtle landed with a heavy thud, tilting its head and glaring menacingly at Glimmora.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Opening with Glimmora\u8212?looks like Geeta's going all out," Dylan said from the stands with a faint smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"She'll have to. Red isn't an opponent you can take lightly," Steven added quietly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, do you think Red can beat her?" Leaf asked curiously, eyes fixed on the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you ask me," Dylan replied, "I'd say yes\u8212?Red will win."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So confident?" Leaf tilted her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Geeta was one of the strongest Champions out there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course. Red's one of my Elite Four, after all." Dylan grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, if you're that sure, then I guess there's nothing to worry about," Leaf laughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She glanced from the maturing young man in the cap on the field to Dylan beside her\u8212?and her smile only grew sweeter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not bad at all. Her taste in people really was impeccable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back on the S.S. Anne, she had picked two true prodigies\u8212?both absolute legends.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
