474: Chapter 475: Leon vs. Steven!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Kanto Elite Four had changed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the next day, two official announcements from the Kanto League spread rapidly across the world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We regret to inform everyone that Leaf will be retiring today. We are deeply grateful for her dedication and love for the Kanto League during her time of service. Though her departure is unfortunate, the League respects her choice. Everyone should follow their dreams\u8212?we eagerly look forward to Leaf's bright future. \u8212? Kanto League"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Official notice: Trainer Selene has successfully passed the Elite Four evaluation. Beginning today, Selene will officially serve as a member of the Kanto Elite Four, protecting the Kanto region. \u8212? Kanto League"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These two statements instantly shocked nearly everyone following Kanto's recent surge in attention.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Giovanni, Red, and Blue had brought the Kanto Elite Four's popularity to unprecedented heights\u8212?their presence was overwhelming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And now, the fourth seat had suddenly changed hands. Naturally, this was huge news.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most importantly\u8212?Selene? Many had never even heard of her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the Kanto Elite Four's level of power already beyond doubt, the idea of an unfamiliar trainer joining their ranks left many wondering if she could handle the pressure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not gonna lie, judging from the official photo, she looks so young\u8230? are they sure she's ready?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
