Meanwhile, the person at the center of it all was lounging in a hotel room, casually scrolling through the comments with amusement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Doesn't this bother you at all? Seeing people badmouthing you?" Leaf asked curiously, watching as Selene kicked her bare, pale feet lazily in the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's pretty funny," Selene said with a mischievous smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To the harsh words and doubt online, she felt no irritation\u8212?if anything, it was kind of entertaining.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Funny?" Leaf blinked in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, my ranking isn't that high yet. It's normal," Selene replied casually.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She didn't care what strangers thought\u8212?and certainly didn't lose sleep over it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's the right attitude," Dylan said, walking over approvingly. "Ignore the noise. Just let your strength do the talking."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the end, the battlefield was the only place that truly mattered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ exactly! My rank's going to shoot up in no time!" Selene grinned confidently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's go. Steven and the others are waiting outside."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When they reached the gates of Naranja Academy, Steven's group was indeed there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So this is the new Kanto Elite Four member, Selene?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was Wallace who noticed her first\u8212?the sweet, flower-hatted girl trailing obediently beside Dylan. Her bright eyes and delicate frame certainly stood out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello, seniors. I'm Selene."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Dylan could introduce her, she gave a polite bow, smiling warmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her well-mannered demeanor and gentle tone immediately won over Leon and the others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What a lovely junior. I heard you used to be Dylan's apprentice\u8212?then you must be quite talented," Geeta said curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She'd actually heard about Selene yesterday\u8212?after all, Selene's most recent battle had been against Rika.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And according to Rika, that "sweet-looking girl" had utterly demolished her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With just a Venusaur. No setup, no gimmicks\u8212?just pure domination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even hours after the match, Rika was still in disbelief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, that's to be expected. She's an Elite Four now," Leon laughed heartily, folding his arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf's retirement had been a surprise, sure, but it was clear why\u8212?they'd found someone better.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Which meant this cheerful, innocent-looking girl standing before them was stronger than Leaf.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Dylan wasn't the type to train anyone ordinary.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not really~ I've never actually battled Leaf before," Selene said shyly, cheeks slightly pink.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's eyebrow twitched, and even Lillie and Leaf looked a bit awkward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That innocent act of hers was\u8230? extremely unconvincing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Please don't. I'd rather not get wrecked for no reason," Leaf said quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She wasn't some battle junkie\u8212?why fight someone she knew she couldn't beat?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene's super strong! You guys better be careful," Lillie added in her sweet, ringing voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh? Then I'll be waiting for your challenge," Wallace smiled with interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sure! Once I'm allowed to challenge you, I'll definitely take you on, Wallace-senpai," Selene said with a sugary grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A former regional Champion was definitely a tempting target.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that, Dylan gave Wallace a knowing look. Yep\u8212?same old Wallace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
