"Not like this one," Dylan replied. "Her talent's among the best I've ever seen\u8212?and she's clever, too. Her battling style is tactical, not just brute force."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"She learned a lot of\u8230? unconventional strategies from me last year," he added vaguely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace looked confused. "What do you mean?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Never mind. She probably won't even need them."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Selene had studied all sorts of underhanded techniques from him\u8212?but at her current level, she likely wouldn't even need to use them to defeat Wallace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoopa Confined opened another golden ring, and Dylan's group stepped through, arriving in Mauville City, Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Steven and Wallace's invitation, they spent two days sightseeing before the main event\u8212?at Mauville Arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the announcer declared the start of the match, Leon and Steven strode out onto the stage to thunderous applause.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most of it was, of course, for Steven. In Hoenn, his popularity was immense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rich, handsome, brilliant, and kind\u8212?the perfect gentleman Champion. Who wouldn't love him?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once the referee explained the rules, the battle began.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Steven! I've been waiting for this!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon whipped his cape behind him, his fierce eyes locked on his opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For someone as battle-hungry as Leon, facing Steven was a dream come true.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, me too," Steven replied with a calm smile. "Dylan's spoken highly of you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon's interest piqued. Dylan had known Steven and the others long before meeting him, so it wasn't too surprising\u8212?but still, he was curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What exactly had Dylan said?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He said your strength was exceptional\u8212?that even compared to Champion Lance, you're about even."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haha~ Dylan gives me too much credit," Leon said, laughing heartily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But despite his modest words, he was clearly pleased.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, praise from Dylan was no small thing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A powerful rival is a rare treasure. Let's see your true strength today, Leon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll give it everything I've got, Steven!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Champions' eyes blazed with mutual respect and determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For trainers like them, worthy opponents were few and far between.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee signaled the start, and Steven led with his signature Skarmory, while Leon opened with Aegislash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I wonder if Steven can actually win," Wallace murmured from the stands, concern clear in his voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon had already proven his strength\u8212?defeating both Iris and Geeta without breaking a sweat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Dylan himself had acknowledged Leon's power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Probably not," Geeta said quietly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As long as their raw strength isn't too far apart, the outcome depends on who performs better in the moment," Cynthia observed calmly. "Tactics and command matter just as much as power."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"True," Geeta agreed, but then fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field, Skarmory had just set up Stealth Rock\u8212?only to be blasted midair by Aegislash's Shadow Ball, nearly crashing to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even without a type advantage, Skarmory's low special defense and Aegislash's immense special attack made the hit devastating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, how many of Steven's Pok\u233?mon do you think Leon will take down?" Leaf asked quietly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The implication was clear\u8212?she didn't think Steven would win.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan didn't answer immediately. He simply fell into thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(End of Chapter)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
