475: Chapter 476: Where Is the Brave Soul Who\u8217?ll Charge at Dylan?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How many of Leon's main Pok\u233?mon could Steven actually take down?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan honestly couldn't say. After all, this was the first time Steven and Leon had ever battled. Even in the Masters Eight tournament, Leon had never been placed in the same bracket as Steven or Cynthia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it didn't matter much\u8212?the result would soon speak for itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon's Aegislash was incredibly powerful, that much was undeniable. Despite the Stealth Rock now spread across the field, Steven's Skarmory was nearly knocked out of the sky by a single Shadow Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The overwhelming force of the attack left Steven no choice but to recall Skarmory and send out his second Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Claydol.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aegislash had the type advantage against Claydol, but the reverse was also true\u8212?Claydol's Ground-type attacks could hit hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two clashed fiercely, but the outcome wasn't surprising: Claydol went down to Aegislash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Next, Steven sent out his Iron Treads, the paradox Pok\u233?mon he'd received from Dylan himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Treads fought well, but Aegislash's aerial advantage made things difficult. Despite Steven's efforts, his Iron Treads ultimately fell to Aegislash's Sacred Sword.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aegislash's dominance was terrifying!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah! Keep talking, all of you who said Leon was overrated!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is the unbeatable Champion of Galar\u8212?Leon! Didn't I say it before? Even Dylan's Champion team wiped everyone out effortlessly! And you still dared to mock Leon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The battle's not even over yet, and the Galar fans are already popping champagne?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hah! Keep coping! I'll eat my shirt if Steven wins this one!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The online chat exploded with excitement\u8212?especially among Galar fans and trainers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back when Leon had been effortlessly swept by Dylan, Galar had suffered endless ridicule, even earning the title of the "weakest region."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon's later performances had repaired that reputation somewhat, but this battle had completely flipped public opinion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Unbelievable\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace was stunned. He hadn't expected Leon to be this strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just one Aegislash, and already three of Steven's Pok\u233?mon were gone\u8212?one forced to switch, two completely defeated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this was Steven they were talking about!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aegislash is that kind of Pok\u233?mon," Cynthia said, brow furrowing slightly. "But Leon's control of it is\u8230? masterful."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone knew Leon was strong\u8212?even Dylan himself had acknowledged that much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But how strong?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, they had proof. Even Steven, ranked No. 3 in the Masters, was being completely overwhelmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
