Steven clearly understood that too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His fourth Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Metagross\u8212?hit the field and immediately Terastallized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a fierce exchange, he finally took down the unstoppable Aegislash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon's second Pok\u233?mon was then revealed\u8212?Cinderace, Galar's Fire-type starter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon was known for his wide range of types, and famously, four of his core Pok\u233?mon were all starters: Cinderace, Rillaboom, Inteleon, and of course, his ace\u8212?Charizard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And those starters were no pushovers\u8212?each one had Champion-level strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon didn't hold back. Facing Steven's Terastallized Metagross, he Gigantamaxed his Cinderace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
