The two titans clashed in a fiery, close-range slugfest that lit up the stadium.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is insane," Wallace muttered, eyes wide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Charizard X was ridiculous\u8212?how could it possibly go toe-to-toe with Mega Metagross? It was even slightly winning!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace couldn't fathom how Leon had trained it to this level.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is Charizard really that strong?" he asked incredulously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, of course," Dylan replied matter-of-factly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"?" Wallace blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My brother's Fire-type ace is also a Charizard," Lillie chimed in sweetly. "Even Entei and Moltres couldn't beat his Charizard Y!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, my Charizard's no weaker than Leon's or Red's," Dylan added modestly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
