She'd only mentioned it because she was annoyed\u8212?Lance kept "inviting" her for training sessions under his Champion title.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Erika was pretty sure he was just using that as an excuse to spar with her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?You guys are unbelievable," Wallace sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match on the field ended soon after\u8212?Leon's Charizard X defeated Steven's Mega Metagross in an explosive finish.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan wasn't surprised by the outcome, though the Hoenn crowd was heartbroken.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon's victory meant Steven's ranking would drop\u8212?again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Down to No. 4, right above Johto's Champion, Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And considering Lance's reputation as the "Invincible Dragon Master," who knew when he'd decide to overtake Steven next?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But that was a problem for another day.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
