477: Chapter 478: I\u8217?m a True Disciple of Dylan\u8217?s!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey~ Master Mustard, please go easy on me today, okay?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sweet and lively girl smiled with bright eyes, her tone crisp and teasing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I've always respected strong veterans like you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Old man like me doesn't deserve that kind of praise, you know~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard waved a hand modestly, chuckling good-naturedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But your ranking isn't exactly low, Master Mustard. You've still got quite the fight in you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene tilted her head skeptically. She didn't believe that for a second\u8212?he might look old and gentle, but rankings didn't lie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't the early days of the World Championships anymore. The weak were quickly eliminated, and only the strong stayed near the top.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Take Alder, for example\u8212?he'd originally been in the top fifteen, but now he'd fallen out of the top twenty altogether.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Mustard was still sitting at number fifteen. That said everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I hope you'll show me what the once 'Strongest Champion' of Galar can really do."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before challenging Mustard, Selene had thoroughly researched his background.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once hailed as the Greatest Champion in History, Mustard had reigned undefeated for eighteen years straight\u8212?a record that still hadn't been broken.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A living legend who had once dominated the entire Galar region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Those are old stories now~ no need to bring them up," Mustard replied casually, smiling with humility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But you\u8212?since you're Dylan's student, how about letting this old man see just how strong his disciple has become~?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene blinked. Dylan? Did he mean her gym leader mentor?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pfft\u8212?she almost couldn't stop herself from laughing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course, Master Mustard! I'm Dylan's true disciple, after all!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Holding back her giggles, she confidently thumped her chest, her bright eyes brimming with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The battle will now begin! The challenger\u8212?Selene from the Kanto region! The defender\u8212?Mustard from Galar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The battle format is 6 vs 6! Both sides may use two forms of enhancement. The match ends when one side's six Pok\u233?mon are all unable to battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Begin!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee bowed politely to both trainers before stepping aside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the massive screen, the portraits of Selene and Mustard appeared on opposite sides. The pointer spun rapidly\u8212?then landed on Selene's side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ohh~ looks like I go first!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smiling brightly, Selene slipped on a pair of silk gloves and flexed her fingers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then, Master Mustard, ready yourself! I'm coming at you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her gaze sharpened, the air around her shifting as she tossed a Pok\u233? Ball into the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gone was the soft, cute demeanor\u8212?replaced by the aura of a determined fighter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ohh~ not bad at all~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard's eyes gleamed. Yes, that's the spirit I wanted to see.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And it's only going to get better! No matter who stands in my way\u8212?I'm going to become Champion!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene spun and threw her first Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No matter who it is! Anyone blocking my path to the top\u8212?I'll take them down!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My first partner\u8212?it's you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A ferocious roar shook the arena as the towering, muscular tiger landed, spreading its arms with a menacing glare toward Mustard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar, huh? What power\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard's brow twitched slightly. That Incineroar was no ordinary one\u8212?its aura alone was intimidating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then a grin spread across his face. His fighting spirit was fully ignited.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hahaha! That's exactly why I joined this World Championship in the first place!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He unzipped his green jacket, folded it neatly, and set it aside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Underneath, he wore a yellow vest bearing the same sword-and-shield emblem as Leon's outfit, paired with loose gray pants.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"With an opponent like this, even an old man like me can't help but get fired up~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then\u8230? it's my turn!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard spread his legs into a fighting stance, one arm pointed forward, the other cocked back\u8212?a signature pose that radiated confidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mienshao!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flash of white light\u8212?his Mienshao appeared, graceful yet fierce, settling into a combat stance and glaring at Incineroar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene gave a sharp command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar bellowed at Mienshao, unleashing its Intimidate!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Mienshao stood utterly unfazed, eyes unwavering.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch\u8212?Inner Focus, huh? That's annoying."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene clicked her tongue. Of course\u8212?it was the Inner Focus ability.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Pok\u233?mon with that trait never flinched or wavered in spirit, immune to Intimidate's effects.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Which meant Incineroar's Fake Out tactic wouldn't work either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the stands\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Master Mustard seems quite fired up. It's been a while since I've seen that expression on him," Leon said with a nostalgic smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not surprising," Dylan replied calmly. "Mustard's strong\u8212?but after retiring to the Isle of Armor, he probably hasn't had many even matches."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard had always been a warrior at heart. But ever since stepping down, he'd rarely battled seriously again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Leon, though stronger now, was too busy (and too directionally challenged) to make the trip for a proper duel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"True," Leon nodded. "This World Championship's a great chance for him."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Though I'm not sure Selene can handle him," Wallace said, stroking his chin before glancing toward Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They didn't know Selene's true power\u8212?but Dylan certainly did.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We'll see soon enough," Dylan said with a faint smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incineroar, Parting Shot!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene didn't waste time trading blows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Incineroar hurled a mocking roar at Mienshao before vanishing into light, returning to its ball and leaving Mienshao's stats lowered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Debuffing, huh?" Mustard chuckled. "Classic Incineroar strategy. Figures."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd expected as much the moment he saw it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene swiftly sent out her ace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The grinning ghost appeared\u8212?then Selene raised her hand. The Key Stone on her glove gleamed brilliantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Evolution!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the light faded, Mega Gengar hovered in the air, exuding eerie menace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Going Mega right off the bat?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace blinked. "That's rare. Most trainers save it as a trump card."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene doesn't fight the usual way," Lillie said softly, smiling faintly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Opening with her ace, then switching and Mega Evolving\u8212?that was pure chaos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Lillie wasn't surprised. Selene had used the same unorthodox approach when challenging the Rota Gym.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, an early Mega Gengar made sense\u8212?its Shadow Tag could easily trap opponents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hah\u8230? this might be tricky~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard frowned slightly. He knew exactly what that ability meant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, his Mienshao knew U-turn\u8212?if it could land a hit, it could escape.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it wasn't that simple. U-turn only worked if it connected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Mega Gengar dodged, Mienshao would be stuck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard ordered Mienshao to dig underground with Dig to both evade and counterattack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Selene had no intention of attacking head-on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar floated upward, a ghostly nail materializing before it\u8212?shrouded in dark mist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Ghost-type move\u8212?Curse!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard's eyes widened. "Wait\u8212?she's using Curse right after Mega Evolving?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who on earth had taught her to fight like that?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mienshao, stop it!" he barked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Too late. The cursed nail plunged into Gengar's body, and a sinister energy shot into Mienshao.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The curse took hold instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mienshao froze mid-motion, its expression twisting in pain as it crashed to the ground, overwhelmed by the dark energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gyaaahahaha~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar cackled gleefully, showing no sign of pain despite its self-inflicted wound. It loved cursing others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's once-innocent face mirrored that same devilish grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mienshao, U-turn\u8212?now!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard barked the command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it was cursed, it had to retreat quickly or it'd be finished!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Encore!" Selene's smile widened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Mienshao tried to leap up, Mega Gengar shot forward like a phantom, clapping mockingly with a distorted giggle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A strange wave pulsed from its hands\u8212?Mienshao froze again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It couldn't use U-turn anymore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mustard's eyes bulged. "No way!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Encore had locked Mienshao into its last move\u8212?Dig.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But digging was useless against a floating Mega Gengar\u8212?meaning Mienshao was doomed to take curse damage until it fainted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This\u8230? this is a death trap!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was nothing he could do\u8212?his Mienshao would be cursed to oblivion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match had barely begun, and Mustard was already sweating bullets.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the stands\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's just evil. Is she even human? Poor Master Mustard," Dylan said, shaking his head in mock sympathy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace and the others all turned toward him with odd, conflicted looks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?What? Why are you all staring at me like that?" Dylan's eyelid twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
