But that unique power of hers hadn't responded at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was her resolve still lacking?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yellow trembled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You can't beat me. Give up," Lance said coldly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No! As long as my partners and I stand together, our bond can overcome anything!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And create miracles!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yellow's eyes hardened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Slowking!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A mysterious pulse flooded Slowking's body\u8212?Viridian power\u8212?strengthening it dramatically. Slowking straightened, blue psychic light flickering in its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I feel\u8230? terrifyingly strong!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
