"Come on."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan raised his arm and gestured invitingly at Selene and Iron Valiant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Let me see how strong you've become.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
