Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The metallic beam blasted out\u8212?but straight into the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nian!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Goodra let out a furious roar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
