Wallace frowned slightly. Hitting Iron Valiant like that wasn't easy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, that hit must've hurt. Iron Valiant's defenses aren't great\u8212?it was clearly prepared in advance," Steven nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Naturally, they were rooting for Selene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Dylan the final boss\u8212?everyone knew how terrifying he was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
