And unlike something absurdly agile like Gliscor, Hisuian Goodra lacked the mobility to consistently catch Iron Valiant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now it comes down to Selene's execution," Steven agreed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant, are you okay?" Selene asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant gave a low cry, indicating it was fine. The Iron Tail had been heavy, but at full health, it could take a hit like that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene let out a breath of relief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good thing it was Iron Tail and not Flash Cannon\u8212?Iron Valiant's Special Defense was truly awful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant, Aura Sphere!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene turned her gaze to the Hisuian Goodra slowly pushing itself up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because of that Iron Tail, she'd missed a perfect follow-up opportunity\u8212?but it didn't matter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Goodra was already on its last legs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It couldn't take much more!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant raised its right arm, forming an Aura Sphere and firing it straight at Hisuian Goodra.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flash Cannon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Goodra immediately fired back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flash Cannon smashed through Aura Sphere and surged toward Iron Valiant\u8212?but Iron Valiant nimbly dodged again, accelerating as it closed in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
