A brutal Fighting-type Close Combat!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the relentless assault, Hisuian Goodra's rotation slowed, until Iron Valiant's final strike forcibly brought it to a halt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Focus Blast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thunder!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
