Thunder had done serious damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With its low Special Defense\u8212?and Hisuian Goodra's massive Special Attack\u8212?the hit hurt badly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant was heavily injured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the smoke slowly cleared, Hisuian Goodra's figure came back into view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
