Selene clenched her teeth, about to order Iron Valiant to attack again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No matter what, this Hisuian Goodra\u8212?already barely hanging on\u8212?had to go down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nian\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
