\u12302?Ding\u8212?Arcanine (Hisuian Form), Fire/Rock type, Legendary Pok\u233?monAbility: IntimidateMoves: Raging Fury, Extreme Speed, Fire Blast, Crunch, Morning Sun\u8230?Description: It lunges at prey with violently burning flames wrapped around its fangs. Despite its massive size, it uses agile feints to toy with opponents, moving as if it were dancing.\u12303?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
