Dylan said, giving her a brief warning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire\u8230? Rock?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's expression turned subtle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because that typing was actually very easy to target.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In truth, Hisuian Arcanine's typing was kind of awkward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regular Arcanine was pure Fire. While it had fewer resistances, it didn't suffer from Hisuian Arcanine's glaring weaknesses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
