"Iron Valiant, be careful," Selene said seriously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant raised its twin arm-blades, fully alert.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright then, Selene,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine lowered its body, muscles tensed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An invisible pressure spread out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A layer of white light dispersed from Iron Valiant's body\u8212?Intimidate had lowered its Attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the next instant, Hisuian Arcanine shot forward like an arrow, so fast it left only a red afterimage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normal-type Extreme Speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant\u8212?Quick Guard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene shouted immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fighting-type Quick Guard could block priority moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant locked onto the blazing red streak, taking a defensive stance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a blink\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
White light flared in front of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Quick Guard!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whoosh!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rush of wind brushed past Iron Valiant's face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was nothing in front of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant's pupils shrank.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine hadn't rammed into it at all\u8212?it had slipped right past!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been played.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant! Watch out!" Selene yelled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Arcanine that had sprinted past immediately pivoted, charging back in from behind\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still Extreme Speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant barely had time to turn before Hisuian Arcanine slammed hard into its chest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant staggered backward. Already weakened, that hit hurt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Blast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using the recoil to leap back, Hisuian Arcanine gathered flames in its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A blazing, gigantic \u22823?-shaped inferno crashed down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire-type Fire Blast!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant, Brick Break!" Selene's expression changed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant steadied itself, crossing its arm-blades in front of its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire Blast smashed directly into Brick Break.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blazing flames surged violently\u8212?Fire-Tera Fire Blast was terrifyingly powerful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant gritted its teeth, bursting with strength as it hacked forward, forcibly splitting the inferno apart.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The flames exploded outward, blasting Iron Valiant backward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Iron Valiant could even regain its footing, a red figure burst out of the flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine ignored the lingering fire entirely, charging straight through it and slamming into Iron Valiant again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant let out a pained grunt as it was sent flying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine didn't stop.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While sprinting, it leapt and unleashed a roaring pillar of fire downward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flamethrower hit cleanly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flames and shockwaves exploded outward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine landed almost soundlessly, its Fire-Tera crystal body gleaming red, head held high like a proud, ferocious lion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The flames dissipated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant lay unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Iron Valiant has lost the ability to battle. Hisuian Arcanine wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee raised the flag.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd exploded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's so cool!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I still think normal Arcanine looks better, but damn\u8212?this one fighting at full sprint is insanely cool."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It beat Iron Valiant that easily? Is Champion Dylan getting serious now?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Compared to the passive Hisuian Goodra, this Hisuian Arcanine's pressure is on a whole different level."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The stadium buzzed with discussion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's rough\u8212?this Hisuian Arcanine is strong,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nemona said, eyes sparkling with excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had a special enthusiasm for Pok\u233?mon she'd never seen before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mm. Iron Valiant wasn't at full strength, but Hisuian Arcanine's performance was outstanding,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Geeta analyzed calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The pressure from Extreme Speed is intense, and its follow-up speed is frightening. This is going to put a lot more pressure on Selene."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Extreme Speed \u8594? Fire Blast \u8594? Extreme Speed \u8594? Flamethrower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was all Hisuian Arcanine had used.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet the sheer high-speed oppression it displayed was terrifying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, Iron Valiant was injured\u8212?but that didn't diminish Hisuian Arcanine's overwhelming dominance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hisuian Goodra fought defensively. Hisuian Arcanine fights proactively. Of course the pressure's different,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue shook her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An attacker and a defender created completely different kinds of stress for their opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I wonder how Selene plans to deal with this Hisuian Arcanine,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nemona rested her chin on her hand, eyes shining.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This kind of battle\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was just too good to watch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
