545: Chapter 546: Against Me?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So vicious\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene recalled Iron Valiant, her fair little face tightening into a frown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Judging from Hisuian Arcanine's ferocious combo just now, this Pok\u233?mon was overwhelmingly aggressive\u8212?completely different from Hisuian Goodra or the illusion-based Hisuian Zoroark.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder Dylan had chosen to Terastallize it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Pok\u233?mon with such overwhelming frontal combat power was extremely hard to deal with.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a brief moment of thought, Selene decisively threw out Mega Gengar's Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Heh heh heh~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Accompanied by an eerie chuckle, Mega Gengar rose from the shadows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After resting for a while, Mega Gengar's mental state had recovered quite a bit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As expected\u8212?Gengar. A good choice," Dylan said calmly, unsurprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The oppressive pressure of Extreme Speed was obvious, and his Hisuian Arcanine clearly excelled at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar's Ghost typing made it immune to Normal-type Extreme Speed, and its proficiency with status moves allowed it to avoid direct confrontation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Mega Gengar to counter Hisuian Arcanine was, objectively speaking, a very smart decision.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar spread a wicked grin as dark light flashed in its eyes. A hazy black shadow covered Hisuian Arcanine's silhouette.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Shadow Tag active, Hisuian Arcanine could no longer be switched out normally.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan launched the attack immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine shot forward in an instant, its fiery red form tearing across the battlefield like lightning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though Extreme Speed was ineffective against Mega Gengar, it was still perfect for closing the distance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar! Toxic Spikes!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene gave the order at once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar floated upward, its claws coming together as a deep-purple energy sphere formed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan let out a soft chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine dashed beneath Mega Gengar and leapt high into the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Crunch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boosted by Extreme Speed, its movement was terrifyingly fast. It shot past Mega Gengar, the Extreme Speed fading as it twisted midair and turned back down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Black light flared from its jaws\u8212?Dark-type Crunch!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Toxic Spikes were hurled skyward, but Mega Gengar itself couldn't evade in time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crunch!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine bit down hard on Mega Gengar's head, drawing a shrill cry of pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It swung Mega Gengar violently before hurling it straight toward the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar slammed down like a cannonball, baring its teeth in agony\u8212?its condition now extremely poor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Blast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pressed the attack without mercy. This was the perfect moment\u8212?Mega Gengar wouldn't even have time to use Destiny Bond.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Deep-purple droplets rained down, sinking into the battlefield and vanishing. A faint violet gleam flickered, then disappeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Toxic Spikes were set.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mid-fall, Hisuian Arcanine's mouth filled with blazing crimson flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive {\b
Fire Blast} crashed down, smashing directly into the Mega Gengar that was trying to sink into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Violent flames erupted, heat waves surging skyward\u8212?an overwhelmingly powerful Fire Blast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar!" Selene's expression changed slightly\u8212?but she didn't panic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attack had come far too fast. She hadn't expected Hisuian Arcanine's follow-up to be this brutal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That fast-paced offense is insane\u8212?Mega Gengar might not hold on," Iris muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That Fire Blast was extremely powerful. If nothing unexpected happens, Mega Gengar won't survive it," N agreed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar already had low defenses. It had been hit twice by Hisuian Zoroark's retaliatory attacks earlier, then taken Crunch just now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three super-effective hits\u8212?and still standing. That alone was impressive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But surviving Fire Blast? Unlikely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Hisuian Arcanine landed, deep-purple light suddenly flared across its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Toxic Spikes damage triggered.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Many spectators wore strange expressions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxic Spikes was something Dylan himself had popularized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And now\u8212?he was the one being poisoned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What's more, it was his own student who'd done it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced at Hisuian Arcanine. One layer of Toxic Spikes was completely manageable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Mega Gengar\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pain Split!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene suddenly shouted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?" Dylan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the shadows nearby, Mega Gengar's faint red eyes lit up as it slowly rose from underground, barely hanging on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
White light flowed from both Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Normal-type Pain Split.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The energy merged, split evenly, and returned to both.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, Hisuian Arcanine's aura weakened noticeably, while Mega Gengar's condition visibly improved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So you used Endure," Dylan said calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Otherwise, Mega Gengar couldn't possibly have survived that Fire Blast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hehe~ You're sharp as always, Dylan," Selene laughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Endure had let Mega Gengar cling to life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The situation had been too sudden\u8212?Destiny Bond wasn't even an option.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this Endure into Pain Split combo dragged Hisuian Arcanine's condition down hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now the advantage is mine! Dylan\u8212?no one understands how scary Toxic Spikes are better than you do, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene smiled sharply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Toxic Spikes on the field, a grounded Pok\u233?mon like Arcanine was at a natural disadvantage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless Dylan switched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're confident," Dylan said lightly. "Then let me crush that confidence."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene tilted her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Toxic Spikes aren't removed only by clearing moves," Dylan replied, eyes on Mega Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine\u8212?Dig."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine plunged underground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flare Blitz!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan continued.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A low, rumbling roar echoed beneath the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Using Flare Blitz underground?" Selene froze\u8212?then her eyes widened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was he planning to vaporize the Toxic Spikes with extreme heat?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That sounded impossible\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Except it actually might work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Heat began seeping up from the ground. The battlefield grew hotter and hotter beneath Selene's sandals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red light glowed faintly under the surface. Cracks spread. Flames leaked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The air became scorching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something was very wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar! Get ready\u8212?Protect!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene ordered instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar floated up, green light gathering beneath it\u8212?but it hesitated, staring at the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like a volcanic eruption, massive torrents of fire burst from the entire battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar instantly used Protect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Towering flames dyed the sky crimson, reflecting in the stunned eyes of every spectator.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blazing firestorms surged outward. Selene had to shield her face\u8212?the wind itself was burning hot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two seconds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three full seconds passed before the flames finally subsided.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The arena's temperature had risen dramatically. The battlefield itself was scorched dry, white steam rising from the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine emerged, landing on the blistering earth, head held high\u8212?wild, ferocious, and domineering.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this time\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No Toxic Spikes damage triggered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Protect faded. Mega Gengar hovered above, staring down at Hisuian Arcanine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Pok\u233?mon faced each other once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the stadium had completely exploded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"WHAT WAS THAT?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The whole field erupted in flames\u8212?are you telling me that was Flare Blitz?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That was insane!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is what Fire-type trainers live for!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Using Flare Blitz underground like that\u8212?learned something new today!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd was roaring.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Did you get it?" Dylan said calmly, smiling at Selene's twitching mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Even without Defog or Rapid Spin, there are other ways to clear Toxic Spikes."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene rolled her eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that worked too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her Incineroar could do something similar\u8212?but she'd never even thought of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even after training under Dylan and developing unconventional battle instincts, this kind of tactic\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was ridiculous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Seriously, Dylan\u8230? If this keeps up, Toxic Spikes are going to lose value again."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not necessarily," Dylan said with a chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This method, inspired by anime-style tactics, wasn't easy to replicate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxic Spikes couldn't be burned away with ordinary flames\u8212?it required sustained, extremely high temperatures.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And that demanded raw power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stronger Pok\u233?mon created stronger moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Likewise, stronger Toxic Spikes were harder to erase.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar's Toxic Spikes, for instance\u8212?even a normal Fire-type could burn for an hour and still fail to melt them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the end, it all came down to strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's continue, Selene."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan cut the conversation short.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine\u8212?Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine burst forward again, energy surging.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar! Stay sharp!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar hovered tensely, eyes locked on the red blur.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, Hisuian Arcanine appeared behind it and leapt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now\u8212?Shadow Ball!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene swung her arm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar retreated while forming a Shadow Ball and firing it\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Hisuian Arcanine arched backward, dodging cleanly, then flipped and charged again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was the motion of Aerial Ace\u8212?performed mid\u8211?Extreme Speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene stared in disbelief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was even possible?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But there was no time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine was already in Mega Gengar's face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Crunch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its jaws snapped shut again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crunch hit squarely, Mega Gengar shrieking as it clawed desperately at Arcanine's face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Arcanine didn't let go\u8212?shaking it violently before hurling it down once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar smashed into the ground, eyes squeezed shut in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Blast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan gave the finishing order.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced at Selene\u8212?by now, she'd probably use {\i
that}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine unleashed another Fire Blast from above.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar! Destiny Bond!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene shouted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was the second time\u8212?she was ready.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Mega Gengar was going down, it would take Arcanine with it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar forced itself to look up, eerie light flaring in its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Too predictable, Selene," Dylan said with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's face changed instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Fire Blast slammed into the ground\u8212?not Mega Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A feint!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The flames still exploded outward, scorching Mega Gengar painfully\u8212?but not enough to knock it out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Destiny Bond expired.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it couldn't be used again immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine landed, leapt again\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another Fire Blast fired point-blank, striking Mega Gengar as it tried to sink into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The explosion engulfed the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the smoke cleared, Mega Gengar had reverted to normal Gengar, eyes spinning as it lay at the bottom of a crater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar has lost the ability to battle. Hisuian Arcanine wins."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee announced.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene recalled Gengar, staring at the Pok\u233? Ball with a headache.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using what Dylan taught her\u8212?against Dylan himself\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Really didn't work at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He saw through everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
