546: Chapter 547: Dylan\u8217?s Abilities\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Selene's having a rough time now\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blue clicked his tongue. Mega Gengar had already lost the ability to battle, and if Selene hadn't used Pain Split midway to drag down Hisuian Arcanine's condition\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That Hisuian Arcanine would probably still be in excellent shape right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That Hisuian Arcanine\u8230? its combat power is completely at ace level."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni narrowed his eyes slightly as he looked at the ferocious, imposing Hisuian Arcanine\u8212?especially considering that Terastallization had eliminated its two biggest quadruple weaknesses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How many main forces has Dylan trained, anyway?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni shook his head helplessly. No matter how he thought about it, Dylan was simply outrageous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Pok\u233?mon like these Hisuian forms\u8212?Dylan had never used them before. They had to be newly trained, right?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet their battle strength was already this high.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could this be Dylan's Viridian Power?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?It might actually be."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giovanni glanced at Yellow, who was staring at Dylan with sparkling eyes full of admiration, and seriously considered the possibility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, Yellow already existed\u8212?someone who could temporarily boost a Pok\u233?mon's strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So why wouldn't there be someone like Dylan, whose power accelerated training speed?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That would perfectly explain why Dylan raised Pok\u233?mon so fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
According to a certain unnamed girl, back then two identical Litten were raised side by side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After just one week, hers was still acting cute\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Dylan's had already evolved into Incineroar and was out there slaughtering everything in sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was that something normal logic could explain?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Absolutely not.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That had to be Viridian Power cheating the system.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why doesn't my Viridian Power do that\u8230??"Even Giovanni couldn't help but feel envious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After hesitating briefly, Selene finally threw her fourth Pok\u233? Ball. Weezing appeared in front of her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing, huh? Looks like she doesn't plan on dealing with Hisuian Arcanine head-on."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The problem is that Arcanine really {\i
is} too strong. Extreme Speed itself is already unreasonable."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nemona and Geeta discussed quietly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sending out Weezing clearly wasn't meant for a straight fight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was a one-for-one exchange.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing knew Destiny Bond.It knew Explosion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A professional mutual-destruction specialist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But Champion Dylan definitely anticipated this," Leaf said calmly."He can tell what Selene's thinking."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar's Destiny Bond had already been "cracked" earlier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Explosion\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's strong, sure\u8212?but if the opponent can use Protect in time, it's very hard to succeed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, Destiny Bond and Explosion work best when they're unexpected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Right now, Selene sending out Weezing\u8212?anyone could guess what she wanted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But from another angle," Geeta suddenly said,"Maybe Selene is trying to force Dylan to hesitate."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nemona and Leaf froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing, huh."Dylan smiled faintly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine burst forward at full stride, charging straight at Weezing at terrifying speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing! Sludge Bomb!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing spat out deep-purple sludge bombs, predicting Arcanine's running path.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Hisuian Arcanine didn't dodge at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It threaded between the sludge bombs at blinding speed, weaving left and right effortlessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To the audience, all they saw was a red blur slicing through the projectiles\u8212?afterimages trailing behind it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gasps and screams erupted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was just too cool.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Extreme Speed slammed straight into Weezing, sending it tumbling backward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fire Blast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using the rebound from the impact, Hisuian Arcanine charged flames in its mouth while sliding back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive Fire Blast roared out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Protect!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing's physical defense was very high\u8212?Extreme Speed hadn't hurt it much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A green barrier flashed up just in time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire Blast exploded violently, flames painting the sky red.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the attack failed to break Protect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The flames faded. The barrier disappeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another collision.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine struck again with Extreme Speed, charging through the lingering flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, it didn't retreat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At point-blank range, blazing fire erupted from Arcanine's mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The raging column of flame struck Weezing head-on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was no time to defend.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fire slammed it down, smashing it into the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A perfect hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So vicious\u8230?!"Selene's delicate face scrunched up again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She'd lost count of how many times she'd complained like this already.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine's offense was simply too violent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not only were the attacks powerful, but the follow-ups were relentless\u8212?no breathing room at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flare Blitz!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan wasn't finished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine dove from midair, flames exploding around its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fire-type Flare Blitz!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOOOOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attack slammed into Weezing, which hadn't even stood up yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Explosive flames and shockwaves tore through the battlefield, cracking the ground apart.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire arena shook.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap! Extreme Speed, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz\u8212?how is that so smooth?!"Rosa stared, dumbfounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That Weezing's getting completely wrecked. No way it can withstand an assault like that," Alder exclaimed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N glanced toward Selene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The smoke and embers cleared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine stood proudly at the edge of a massive crater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red lightning crackled across its body\u8212?the recoil damage from Flare Blitz.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It let out a low grunt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flare Blitz hurt, but it was already used to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Toxic!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Selene's voice rang out sharply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Hmm?"Dylan looked toward the crater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing\u8212?previously motionless\u8212?suddenly sprang up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A splash of dark-purple venom sprayed straight at Hisuian Arcanine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcanine tried to dodge, but the recoil slowed it just enough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some venom struck home.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The poison sank in instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark purple light flared across Arcanine's body, its expression twisting in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Badly poisoned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The first tick of Toxic wasn't too painful\u8212?but Hisuian Arcanine was furious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You disgusting mutant ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan ordered immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The poison damage ended\u8212?and Hisuian Arcanine vanished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing\u8212?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Extreme Speed smashed into Weezing again, slamming it to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flamethrower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced at Selene.What would she choose?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine charged flames again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Explosion!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blinding white light erupted from Weezing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For this moment\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
I am the sun.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing's expression was utterly deranged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine retreated instantly, moving at full speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOOOOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Weezing detonated completely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive shockwave exploded outward, wind pressure so violent no one could keep their eyes open.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normal-type Explosion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the dust finally settled\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine lay collapsed in a corner of the field, face twisted in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark-purple poison light flickered again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxic damage triggered once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the crater's center, Weezing lay unconscious\u8212?Explosion guaranteed that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the key was Arcanine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though it escaped the blast's center, the explosion's massive range still clipped it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And more importantly\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was badly poisoned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was why Dylan hadn't ordered Protect earlier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Toxic triggered mid-guard, it would have been over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even now, after the poison tick ended, Hisuian Arcanine was barely standing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It turned its head toward Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan nodded gently\u8212?no disappointment in his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only then did Hisuian Arcanine finally relax.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It still mustered the strength to glare viciously at Weezing one last time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Terastallization light faded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its consciousness blurred.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hisuian Arcanine collapsed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weezing and Hisuian Arcanine have both lost the ability to battle."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The stadium erupted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finally beat that Hisuian Arcanine\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That thing was insane\u8212?trying to brute-force it would've been a team wipe."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If not for Gengar and Weezing, taking it down would've been ridiculously hard."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's hear it! What Iron Valiant and Mega Gengar couldn't do\u8212?Weezing did!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Anyone says Weezing's mid again and I'm throwing hands!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd buzzed loudly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's tyrannical Hisuian Arcanine had finally fallen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Which meant\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone could now look forward to Dylan's next Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
