547: Chapter 548: It\u8217?s Angry\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Against an opponent like that, it really does come down to winning with status moves."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace couldn't help but sigh emotionally.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"To think Hisuian Arcanine would fall like that."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he'd been the one on the field, he'd probably have been steamrolled straight through by that Hisuian Arcanine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet Selene had defeated it using only two Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, Iron Valiant had fought it briefly, but anyone who understood the matchup knew the truth\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Iron Valiant hadn't really done much damage to it at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mega Gengar's Pain Split had dragged Hisuian Arcanine's HP down by half, and only then did Weezing finish it off with Toxic + Explosion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mm. If you tried to take it head-on, beating that Hisuian Arcanine would be extremely difficult," Steven agreed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
