Red's ace, Mega Charizard X, had fallen, and this full-team battle had clearly entered its final countdown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Red still had his mainstay Blastoise, everyone knew the truth\u8212?how could a single Blastoise possibly be a match for Meowscarada?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though Meowscarada had Terastallized into Dark-type, it still retained the power boost to its Grass-type moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What's more, even without any move-type power boosts, dealing with a Blastoise was still an easy task for Meowscarada.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battle continued. Red didn't give up\u8212?but compared to Meowscarada, Blastoise was so clumsy it looked downright silly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From start to finish, Blastoise never managed to touch Meowscarada even once. When Meowscarada's final Flower Trick landed, Blastoise crashed to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching Blastoise fall unconscious, Red could only shake his head helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had truly fought with everything he had\u8212?but it still wasn't enough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Blastoise is unable to battle. Meowscarada wins!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Since Red has lost all six of his Pok\u233?mon, the winner of this match is Dylan!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf entered the field and announced the final result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The winner is decided! Dylan defeats Red and claims the ultimate championship of this World Championships!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the platform, the slick-haired host shouted at the top of his lungs, unleashing the loudest roar of his life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His excitement ignited the entire stadium.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wooo!!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're the champions!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I say Champion Dylan is unbeatable\u8212?who agrees, who disagrees?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No one can beat Champion Dylan! He didn't even need legendaries to crush the runner-up!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Absolutely deserved! This championship wasn't surprising at all!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"AHHH\u8212?Champion Dylan! I want to marry you! I want to have your babies!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire venue erupted into frenzied cheers, everyone shouting the same name.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hahaha\u8212?my son is the world champion!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the stands, the Itto's face was flushed red with excitement as he laughed nonstop, overflowing with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Xin'er is amazing!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's Mother wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes, crying tears of joy. From the bottom of her heart, she was proud\u8212?this was her son.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"When Grandma and the others find out, they'll definitely be happy too."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She knew Dylan was outstanding, but witnessing him win the world championship with her own eyes made the joy indescribable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"All thanks to my foresight!" the Itto said smugly, wrapping an arm around Dylan's Mother's shoulder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If I hadn't let this kid inherit the Gym back then, how could his potential have been forced out?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he hadn't wanted to go on a honeymoon trip with Dylan's Mother and handed the Gym over to Dylan, how could Dylan have exploded with such Trainer talent and reached this point in just two short years?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mm! As expected of me!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pah! You really know how to pat yourself on the back," Dylan's Mother shot him an eye-roll.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hahaha!" The Itto didn't care in the slightest. He was so happy that even their ancestors in heaven were probably lighting incense in celebration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He made money for his son, and his son became world champion\u8212?perfect! Truly the winner of life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A beautiful, caring wife. Endless wealth. A perfect, outstanding son. Absolute bliss!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something still felt missing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Itto suddenly fell into thought. What was it again?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well done. As expected of my Meow."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan walked onto the field, rubbing Meowscarada's head with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Meow~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meowscarada's big eyes curved into crescent moons, its cry full of pride and joy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing that expression, Dylan chuckled softly, then looked around at the crowd chanting his name in fervor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This feeling\u8230? wasn't bad at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's smile deepened. Being the focus of everyone's gaze\u8212?admiration, fervor, reverence\u8212?hearing them shout his name\u8230? it was truly exhilarating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't even competed in a regional league, but winning the World Championships\u8212?did that count as fulfilling a dream?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Red, that was a great battle."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan walked over to Red. Red had just sprayed healing medicine on Blastoise, which had regained consciousness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise looked dejected, head lowered, while Red gently comforted it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you, Dylan. You've gotten even stronger."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red shook Dylan's outstretched hand, Dylan's reflection clear in his crimson eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan had grown stronger\u8212?Red could clearly feel it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The first battle in Vermilion City\u8212?Dylan had relied on his understanding of Poison to defeat him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The second, a Gym challenge with a Fire-type team\u8212?Dylan's strength was already obvious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this time, another Poison-type team\u8212?yet again, Red wasn't a match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No one stays in place forever. You too, Red\u8212?you're far stronger than the last two times," Dylan replied with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll challenge you again."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red pressed down the brim of his cap. Beneath its shadow, his eyes still burned bright and fierce.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three straight losses\u8212?but that was fine!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan from Galar lost to Leon eleven times, didn't he? Three losses were nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Red felt he probably wouldn't "catch up" to Raihan's record anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course. You're always welcome."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan truly meant that. He enjoyed battling\u8212?and Red's next challenge would be a Gym challenge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A perfect chance to let his other attribute teams "get some fresh air."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red nodded, already thinking about his next team composition.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Recently, he'd heard rumors of an extremely powerful wild Pok\u233?mon appearing in Cerulean Cave. He planned to check it out when he had time\u8212?maybe even capture it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The finals ended, followed naturally by the award ceremony.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow, President of the Pok\u233?mon League and Chairman of the Kanto League, personally presented the award.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Congratulations, Dylan. From today on, you are truly the strongest Trainer in the world."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Radiant with pride, Goodshow placed the medal on Dylan and handed him the trophy, his tone filled with both pride and awe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From Goodshow's perspective, he had witnessed Dylan's rise firsthand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The kid who once discussed rewards with him had, in the blink of an eye, climbed to the very peak of the world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sometimes Goodshow felt that both he and Kanto were incredibly fortunate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Dylan had been born in another region, the one feeling envy now wouldn't be the other League Chairs\u8212?it would be him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you. I also owe much to your care and guidance," Dylan replied respectfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hahaha! This Itto didn't do much. Go take photos\u8212?capture this moment."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodshow laughed and gestured to the photographer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though the World Championships winner didn't enter the Hall of Fame, commemorative photos were still essential.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, this was a global tournament\u8212?its prestige spoke for itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan released the Pok\u233?mon he used in the finals: Arbok, Toxapex, Drapion, Crobat, Gengar, and Meowscarada.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright everyone\u8212?strike your coolest pose! I'll capture your best moment," the photographer said, adjusting the camera.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drapion, the largest, stood behind Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxapex tilted its head at Dylan's left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meowscarada stood on his right, hands on its hips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arbok stretched upward from behind his left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crobat hovered behind on the right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar was the smartest of all\u8212?sitting right in front of Dylan, pulling a huge, goofy grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Click.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment was frozen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kanto Champion Dylan defeated his final opponent, Red, to win the inaugural World Championships. The news spread across the globe like a storm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The name Dylan truly became the idol of Trainers worldwide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a Trainer with dreams, what could be more alluring than becoming world champion?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regional Champion? That was already yesterday's glory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How many regional champions had been eliminated at the World Championships?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, for rookie Trainers, regional champion was still the first goal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the day after the World Championships ended, another bombshell rocked the world:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kanto Champion Dylan retired.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red assumed the title of Kanto Champion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trainer Yellow became a member of the Elite Four.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The shock was immense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan had just won the world championship\u8212?and retired immediately?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with the League's official statement, fans struggled to accept it. Only after Dylan released a personal video explanation did the uproar finally settle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the backyard of the Rota Gym, Dylan lounged lazily beneath a tree.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was the end of the year, the World Championships had just concluded, and there were no challengers at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan was extremely free. He was even considering taking Lillie, Leaf, and Ilene on a vacation to Alola.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the moment, he was chatting on a call with Steven and Wallace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Man, I really didn't expect you to retire, Dylan. Say\u8212?are you interested in Pok\u233?mon Contests? We could start a Pokemon Contest Cup together!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace's eyes sparkled with enthusiasm on the video call.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What kind of nonsense is that? Knock it off," Steven couldn't help but roast him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You think Dylan is as free as you?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace already had his Wallace Cup, and now he wanted to rope Dylan into a Pokemon Contest Cup?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe in the future. I've got a headache of a problem right now," Dylan said, rubbing Eevee's soft fur in his arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What happened?" Wallace asked curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My dad\u8230? he's pressuring me to get married."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan rubbed his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Last night after returning to Rota Street, the Itto dragged him aside and talked endlessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When were you getting married? When were you having kids?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He and Dylan's Mother were in full agreement\u8212?Dylan should settle down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Career established. Family wealthy. Time for life's big matters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm only nineteen, guys," Dylan said helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I get it," Steven nodded. Before Zivetch Magnolia was incarcerated, he'd been pressured the same way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pfft\u8212?hahaha!" Wallace burst out laughing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, Dylan, do you have someone you like?" Steven asked curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course he does," Wallace chimed in eagerly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Leaf, Lillie, and Ilene\u8212?his childhood friend, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes," Dylan nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then which one do you like most?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I want to marry all three," Dylan answered honestly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There's no law against it in this world."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven and Wallace stared at him, speechless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then why are you telling us this?" Steven sensed something was wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This guy wasn't troubled at all\u8212?he was baiting them!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I want your advice. I've never been married before. I don't know what to do next," Dylan said earnestly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven: (\u8212?)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace: (\u65077?)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After that, Dylan also "consulted" Giovanni, Lance, Leon, Geeta, Cynthia, and others\u8212?more like informing them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wanted them to witness his proposal to the three girls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Itto might be impatient, but Dylan agreed with one thing\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His life was nearly perfect, but he still needed the most important companion: the person to walk with him through the rest of his life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the final day of the year, Yellow, May, and Dawn took Leaf, Lillie, and Ilene out shopping together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Wallace and the others secretly entered the Rota Gym using Hoopa Unbound's golden rings and prepared the venue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At eight in the evening, Hoopa Unbound appeared before the six girls and mysteriously tossed out a golden ring, gesturing for them to step through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The instant they passed through, Yellow, May, and Dawn joined the main group and lifted up placards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf, Lillie, and Ilene were stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shimmering blue light rippled across the lake\u8212?Kyogre was glowing beneath the water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pink luminescent diamonds dotted the lawn\u8212?crafted by Diancie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
White balloons. White petals. Crystal lamps. A flower-ringed stage. And the starry sky above.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their minds went blank.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan, dressed in a black suit, walked toward them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Holy golden light descended as Arceus appeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three ring boxes floated forward under Arceus's control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"!!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf suddenly understood. She covered her mouth, eyes shining with joy as she looked at Dylan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lillie's face flushed red. Tears welled in Ilene's eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She could hear Dylan's gentle voice\u8212?but the sudden happiness was overwhelming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She only caught the final, most important sentence:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Will you marry me?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before the three could respond\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Marry him! Marry him!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace and the others started cheering loudly, waving placards. Especially Steven and Blue\u8212?they shouted so loudly it was impossible to ignore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Leaf didn't care at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This felt like a dream!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm willing!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One year later, the world was still as lively as ever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The most interesting news was that the Kanto Champion had changed again\u8212?May defeated Red and claimed the title.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That meant next year's Kanto Champion would be May.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan wasn't surprised at all. May and Red were close in strength, trading wins in private matches.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wouldn't be shocking if Red reclaimed the title the year after.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what mattered now was\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I must've been blind back then to marry you together with Lillie and Ilene!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf, holding a baby, looked slightly rounder in the face\u8212?yes, she'd already had one child.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't get mad, don't get mad. I drank too much with Wallace and the others last night\u8212?they're really not human!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan sighed helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yesterday was his daughter's one-month celebration, and Wallace, Leon, and the others came to Kanto. They drank hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So that's your excuse for sleeping with Selene?" Leaf glared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dylan, she's your disciple!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I think I can explain\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan glanced at the tightly shut room door, scalp tingling as he cursed Wallace and Leon internally.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They'd been the ones pushing drinks nonstop.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But wait\u8212?he'd blacked out completely. And he vaguely remembered Ilene helping him to his room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And in dramas, drunken hookups were fake anyway\u8212?when you black out, you're like a dead pig!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How could he have initiated anything?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The more Dylan thought about it, the more suspicious it felt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could Selene have\u8230? attacked him while he was asleep?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That rebellious disciple would be capable of that!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then again, Leaf and the others should've been watching over him\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan was puzzled. Leaf noticed too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cough\u8230? so what are you planning to do now?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine. I get it. Marry one more."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaf rolled her eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Leaf\u8230? you didn't all plan this together, did you?" Dylan asked helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course not! You jerk\u8212?what do you take us for? We can barely share you as it is. Why would we add another?" Leaf retorted righteously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan thought about it\u8212?it made sense. Still, something felt off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then\u8230? another wedding?" he asked tentatively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And you're asking me that?" Leaf shot back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, alright. I'll talk to May properly later."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan pondered how to even start that conversation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Waking up next to your disciple\u8212?and being caught by your wives\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah. Awkward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gym Leader bro, there's a challenger," a message from Yellow popped up on his phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll go handle the challenger," Dylan said to Leaf.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go on."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching him head toward the Gym, Leaf hummed softly, smiling as she gently touched her daughter's cheek and pushed open the room door.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Once things are settled with May, we'll truly be one family."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So this is the Rota Gym."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A cute brown-haired girl stared curiously at the massive turntable before her, filled with excitement at the legendary Gym.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you the challenger?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A clear male voice reached her ears.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She turned around, eyes lighting up instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan\u8212?the legendary Rota Gym Leader!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ever since she was underage, she'd heard countless stories about the Rota Gym and its master.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was her idol.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The strongest Trainer in the world\u8212?and that was her goal too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hello! I'm Ayumi from Pallet Town, a Trainer who just started traveling this year."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She introduced herself excitedly. On her head sat a cute Eevee, staring at Dylan with big watery eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I see\u8212?a Trainer from Pallet Town?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dylan's eyes flickered slightly as he smiled and nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm Dylan, the master of this Rota Gym.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So\u8212?are you ready?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"YES!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(The End)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
